export const doppelkopfTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf መስመር — ነጻ የአካባቢ ካርድ ጨዋታ","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"ባለ አራት መቀመጫ የዶፔልኮፕ ልምምድ ጨዋታ ከሶስት የሀገር ውስጥ የኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ጋር ይጫወቱ። ቡድኖችን፣ ትራምፕዎችን፣ ዘዴዎችን እና የዳግም/ኮንትራ ጥሪዎችን ይማሩ። ነፃ፣ ምንም መለያ የለም።","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"በአካባቢው ባለ አራት መቀመጫ የዶፔልኮፕ ጨዋታ ይጫወቱ። በሚችሉበት ጊዜ የሚመራውን ሱስ ወይም ትራምፕ ይከተሉ፣ የ Re ቡድንን በክለብ ንግስቶች በኩል ያግኙ እና የ Re ወይም Kontra ማስታወቂያ ይሞክሩ።","A quick example":"ፈጣን ምሳሌ","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"በተለመደው ጨዋታ የክለቦች ንግስት የያዙት ሁለቱ ተጫዋቾች ሬ. አንድ ተጫዋች ሁለቱንም ከያዘ ሰርግ ይጀምራል፡ በመጀመሪያዎቹ ሦስቱ ሽንፈትን ያሸነፈ የመጀመሪያው ተጫዋች አጋራቸው ይሆናል።","How to play":"እንዴት መጫወት እንደሚቻል","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"ጨዋታው 48 ካርዶችን ያቀርባል፡ ሁለት ቅጂዎች ace፣ አስር፣ ንጉስ፣ ንግስት፣ ጃክ እና ዘጠኝ በእያንዳንዱ ልብስ። እያንዳንዱ አራት መቀመጫዎች 12 ካርዶችን ያገኛሉ. የትራምፕ ትእዛዝ የሚጀምረው በልብ አስር ሲሆን ከዚያም ንግስቶች እና ጃክሶች በቅደም ተከተል ፣ የአልማዝ ካርዶችን ይከተላል። አንድ ብልሃት የሚያሸንፈው በከፍተኛው ትራምፕ ነው፣ ወይም ምንም መለከት ካልተጫወተ ​​የሊድ ልብስ ከፍተኛው ካርድ ነው። ጨዋታው 240 ካርድ አይኖች አሉት።","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","How many cards and players are there?":"ምን ያህል ካርዶች እና ተጫዋቾች አሉ?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf በአራት መቀመጫዎች እና በ 48 ካርዶች እዚህ ይጫወታል: የእያንዳንዱ የ 24 ካርድ ፊት ሁለት ቅጂዎች. እያንዳንዱ መቀመጫ የ 12 ካርዶችን ይቀበላል.","How are the teams found?":"ቡድኖቹ እንዴት ይገኛሉ?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"በተለመደው ጨዋታ የክለቡ ንግሥት የያዙት ሁለቱ መቀመጫዎች Re; ሌሎቹ ሁለቱ ኮንትራ ይመሰርታሉ። አንድ መቀመጫ ሁለቱንም የክለብ ንግስቶች የሚይዝ ከሆነ, የጋብቻ ህግ በመጀመሪያዎቹ ሶስት ዘዴዎች ውስጥ አጋርን ያገኛል.","What happens during a wedding?":"በሠርግ ወቅት ምን ይሆናል?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"ከመጀመሪያዎቹ ሶስት ብልሃቶች አንዱን ያሸነፈ የመጀመሪያው መቀመጫ ሬ. የሰርግ መቀመጫው ሶስቱን ካሸነፈ ጨዋታው እንደ አንድ ተጫዋች የአልማዝ ሶሎ ይቀጥላል።","Which card is the strongest trump?":"በጣም ጠንካራ የሆነው የትኛው ካርድ ነው?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"ልብ አስር ከፍተኛ ነው። ኩዊንስ በክለብ፣ በስፓድ፣ በልብ፣ በአልማዝ ቅደም ተከተል፣ ከዚያም ጃክን በተመሳሳይ የሱቱት ቅደም ተከተል፣ ከዚያም የአልማዝ ኤሲ፣ አስር፣ ንጉስ እና ዘጠኝ ይከተላሉ።","Must I follow suit?":"መከተል አለብኝ?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"አዎ። ትራምፕ ያልሆነ ልብስ ከተመራ፣ በሚችሉበት ጊዜ ያንን ልብስ ይጫወቱ። መለከት ከተመራ፣ ስትችል መለከትን ተጫወት። አለበለዚያ ማንኛውንም ካርድ ይምረጡ.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"ሬ እና ኮንትራ ማለት ምን ማለት ነው?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"የሁለቱ ቡድኖች ስም ናቸው። በተፈቀደው የመክፈቻ መስኮት አንድ ተጫዋች ቡድናቸውን አንድ ጊዜ ማስታወቅ ይችላል። ጥሪው የሚታይ ሲሆን የማሸነፍ ደረጃውን እና የጨዋታ ነጥቦችን ይለውጣል።","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"ይህ ሙሉ የውድድር ደንብ ነው?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"ቁ. ይህ ከRe/Kontra ጥሪዎች እና ከሠርግ ህግ ጋር የተለመደው የጨዋታ የአካባቢያዊ ልምምድ ስሪት ነው። ከመጫወቻ በፊት የተመረጡ ብቸኛዎችን, እምቢታዎችን, የውድድር ቅጣቶችን እና ብዙ የቤት ውስጥ ህጎችን ይተዋል.","Can I play with three friends online?":"በመስመር ላይ ከሶስት ጓደኞች ጋር መጫወት እችላለሁ?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"አይ. ሦስቱ ተቃዋሚዎችዎ ቀላል የአገር ውስጥ ኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ናቸው። ምንም መለያ፣ ግጥሚያ ወይም የመስመር ላይ ብዙ ተጫዋች የለም።","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"የእኔ ስምምነት በመስመር ላይ ተሰቅሏል ወይም ተቀምጧል?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"ምንም የጨዋታ ውሂብ አልተሰቀለም። የአሁኑ ስምምነትዎ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ በራስ-ሰር በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ስለሚቀመጥ በኋላ መቀጠል ይችላሉ።","Rules and limitations":"ደንቦች እና ገደቦች","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"ይህ ተራ የአካባቢያዊ የልምምድ ጨዋታ እንጂ የመስመር ላይ ባለብዙ ተጫዋች፣ ቁማር፣ የውድድር ደንበኛ ወይም የባለሙያ ፈላጊ አይደለም። የዲዲቪ መደበኛ-ጨዋታ ካርድ ቅደም ተከተል, የ Re/Kontra ጥሪዎች እና የሠርግ መፍታትን ይጠቀማል, ነገር ግን ሊመረጡ የሚችሉ ሶሎሶችን አይተገበርም, እንደ keine 90 ያሉ እምቢታዎች, የውድድር ቅጣቶች, ሁሉም ልዩ የሰንጠረዥ ደንቦች ወይም የተረጋገጠ የውድድር ውጤት. ሶስቱ ሲፒዩዎች ቀላል የህግ እንቅስቃሴ ሂውሪስቲክስን ይጠቀማሉ እና ደካማ ውሳኔዎችን ሊወስኑ ይችላሉ።","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ለመጫወት ነፃ። ካርዶች እና ውጤቶች በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ; ምንም የጨዋታ ውሂብ አይሰቀልም።","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf ይጫወቱ","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Language":"ቋንቋ","UsefulVerse":"ጠቃሚ ቁጥር","All tools":"ሁሉም መሳሪያዎች","New deal":"አዲስ ስምምነት","Resume saved deal":"የተቀመጠውን ስምምነት ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Delete saved deal":"የተቀመጠ ስምምነትን ሰርዝ","Choose New deal to begin.":"ለመጀመር አዲስ ስምምነት ይምረጡ።","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"አዲስ ስምምነት ይጀምሩ ወይም የተቀመጠ ጨዋታዎን ይቀጥሉ።","You":"እርስዎ","CPU":"ሲፒዩ","Seat":"መቀመጫ","Your hand":"የእርስዎ እጅ","Current trick":"የአሁኑ ብልሃት።","Turn":"አዙር","Re eyes":"የዳግም አይኖች","Kontra eyes":"የኮንትራ አይኖች","Re tricks":"እንደገና ዘዴዎች","Kontra tricks":"የኮንትራ ዘዴዎች","Match points":"የተዛማጅ ነጥቦች","Announce Re":"እንደገና አስታወቀ","Announce Kontra":"ኮንትራ አስታወቀ","Play selected card":"የተመረጠውን ካርድ ያጫውቱ","Select a card":"ካርድ ይምረጡ","Re":"ዳግም","Kontra":"ኮንትራ","Team not yet known":"ቡድን እስካሁን አልታወቀም።","Trick table":"የተንኮል ጠረጴዛ","Clubs":"ክለቦች","Spades":"ስፓድስ","Hearts":"ልቦች","Diamonds":"አልማዞች","Nine":"ዘጠኝ","Jack":"ጃክ","Queen":"ንግስት","King":"ንጉሥ","Ten":"አስር","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"ሁለተኛ ቅጂ","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"የእርስዎ ተራ። ህጋዊ ካርድ ይምረጡ።","A computer player is thinking…":"የኮምፒውተር ተጫዋች እያሰበ ነው…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"አዲስ ስምምነት ተዘጋጅቷል። እርስዎ ይህንን ልምምድ ዙር ይመራሉ.","Selected card":"የተመረጠ ካርድ","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"ጨዋታው ህጋዊ አይደለም። በሚቻልበት ጊዜ ትራምፕን ይከተሉ።","Deal saved on this device.":"ቅናሹ በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ተቀምጧል።","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"አካባቢያዊ ቁጠባ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ የለም።","Saved deal resumed.":"የተቀመጠው ስምምነት ከቆመበት ቀጥሏል።","Saved deal deleted.":"የተቀመጠው ስምምነት ተሰርዟል።","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"የተቀመጠው ስምምነት ሊነበብ አልቻለም። ይሰርዙት እና እንደገና ይጀምሩ።","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"ሠርግ፡ በሦስት ዘዴዎች ያሸነፈ የመጀመሪያው ተጫዋች አጋር ይሆናል።","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"ሠርግ ተፈቷል፡ ተንኮል አሸናፊው አጋር ነው።","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"የሰርግ ተጫዋች የመጀመሪያዎቹን ሶስት ብልሃቶች አሸንፏል። ስምምነቱ አሁን የአልማዝ ብቸኛ ነው።","Re announced.":"እንደገና ተገለጸ።","Kontra announced.":"ኮንትራ ታወቀ።","Re wins the deal.":"ድጋሚ ስምምነቱን አሸነፈ።","Kontra wins the deal.":"ኮንትራ ስምምነቱን አሸንፏል።","Final eyes":"የመጨረሻ አይኖች","Game points":"የጨዋታ ነጥቦች","Teams":"ቡድኖች","Start another deal to play again.":"እንደገና ለመጫወት ሌላ ስምምነት ጀምር።","Rules reference":"የሕጎች ማጣቀሻ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"የጀርመን ዶፔልኮፕ ማህበር · የውድድር ህጎች፣ 21 የካቲት 2026","Card":"ካርድ","eyes":"አይኖች"},"ar":{"Doppelkopf":"دوبلكوبف","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — لعبة بطاقات محلية مجانية","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"العب لعبة تدريب Doppelkopf بأربعة مقاعد ضد ثلاثة من لاعبي الكمبيوتر المحليين. تعلم الفرق والأوراق الرابحة والحيل ومكالمات Re/Kontra. مجاني، بدون حساب.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"العب لعبة Doppelkopf محلية ذات أربعة مقاعد. اتبع الدعوى التي تقودها أو الورقة الرابحة عندما تستطيع، وابحث عن فريق Re من خلال ملكات النادي، وحاول إعلان Re أو Kontra.","A quick example":"مثال سريع","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"في اللعبة العادية، اللاعبان اللذان يحملان ملكة النادي هما Re. إذا حصل أحد اللاعبين على كليهما، يبدأ حفل الزفاف: أول لاعب آخر يفوز بخدعة في الثلاثة الأوائل يصبح شريكه.","How to play":"كيفية اللعب","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"تتعامل اللعبة مع بطاقات 48: نسختان من الآس، والعشرة، والملك، والملكة، والجاك، وتسعة في كل مجموعة. يحصل كل مقعد من المقاعد الأربعة على بطاقات 12. يبدأ أمر ترامب بالقلب العشرة، ثم الملكات والرافعات بترتيب الدعوى، تليها البطاقات الماسية. يتم الفوز بالخدعة بأعلى ورقة رابحة، أو أعلى بطاقة من المجموعة التي تقودها إذا لم يتم لعب ورقة رابحة. تحتوي اللعبة على عيون بطاقة 240.","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","How many cards and players are there?":"كم عدد البطاقات واللاعبين الموجودين؟\nيتم لعب","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf هنا بأربعة مقاعد وبطاقات 48: نسختان من كل وجه من بطاقات 24. يتلقى كل مقعد بطاقات 12.","How are the teams found?":"كيف يتم العثور على الفرق؟","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"في اللعبة العادية، المقعدان اللذان يحملان ملكة النادي من شكل Re؛ الاثنان الآخران يشكلان كونترا. إذا كان أحد المقعدين يحمل ملكتي النادي، فإن قاعدة الزفاف تجد شريكًا خلال الحيل الثلاثة الأولى.","What happens during a wedding?":"ماذا يحدث أثناء حفل الزفاف؟","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"أول مقعد آخر يفوز بإحدى الحيل الثلاث الأولى ينضم إلى Re. إذا فاز مقعد الزفاف بالثلاثة، فستستمر اللعبة كلاعب واحد ماسي منفرد.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"أي بطاقة هي الورقة الرابحة الأقوى؟","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"القلب العشرة هو الأعلى. تتبع الملكات المضرب، الأشياء بأسمائها الحقيقية، القلب، ترتيب الماس، ثم الرافعات بنفس ترتيب الدعوى، ثم الآس الماسي، العشرة، الملك والتسعة.","Must I follow suit?":"هل يجب علي أن أتبعه؟","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"نعم. إذا تم قيادة بدلة غير رابحة، فالعب تلك البدلة عندما تستطيع ذلك. إذا تم قيادة الورقة الرابحة، فالعب الورقة الرابحة عندما تستطيع ذلك. خلاف ذلك، اختر أي بطاقة.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"ماذا يعني Re وKontra؟","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"هما اسماء الفريقين. خلال النافذة المفتوحة المسموح بها، يمكن للاعب أن يعلن عن فريقه مرة واحدة. المكالمة مرئية وتغير حد الفوز ونقاط اللعبة.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"هل هذه هي مجموعة قواعد البطولة الكاملة؟","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"رقم. هذه نسخة تدريب محلية من اللعب العادي مع مكالمات Re/Kontra وقاعدة الزفاف. إنه يستبعد المعزوفات المنفردة التي تم اختيارها قبل اللعب، والرفض، وعقوبات البطولة والعديد من قواعد المنزل.","Can I play with three friends online?":"هل يمكنني اللعب مع ثلاثة أصدقاء عبر الإنترنت؟","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"رقم. خصومك الثلاثة هم لاعبو كمبيوتر محليون بسيطون. لا يوجد حساب أو التوفيق أو متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"هل تم تحميل صفقتي أو حفظها عبر الإنترنت؟","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"لم يتم تحميل أي بيانات للعبة. يتم حفظ صفقتك الحالية تلقائيًا في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز حتى تتمكن من استئنافها لاحقًا.","Rules and limitations":"القواعد والقيود","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"هذه لعبة تدريب محلية غير رسمية، وليست لعبة متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت أو مقامرة أو عميل بطولة أو خبير حل. يستخدم ترتيب بطاقة اللعبة العادية DDV، ومكالمات Re/Kontra وقرار الزفاف، ولكنه لا ينفذ المعزوفات المنفردة القابلة للتحديد، أو حالات الرفض مثل keine 90، أو عقوبات البطولة، أو جميع قواعد الطاولة الخاصة أو تسجيل الدورات المعتمدة. تستخدم وحدات المعالجة المركزية الثلاث استدلالات بسيطة للتحرك القانوني وقد تتخذ قرارات ضعيفة.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"لعب مجاني. تبقى البطاقات والنتائج في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز؛ لم يتم تحميل أي بيانات اللعبة.","Play Doppelkopf":"تشغيل دوبلكوبف","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Language":"اللغة","UsefulVerse":"آية مفيدة","All tools":"جميع الأدوات","New deal":"صفقة جديدة","Resume saved deal":"استئناف الصفقة المحفوظة","Delete saved deal":"حذف الصفقة المحفوظة","Choose New deal to begin.":"اختر صفقة جديدة للبدء.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"ابدأ صفقة جديدة أو استأنف لعبتك المحفوظة.","You":"أنت","CPU":"وحدة المعالجة المركزية","Seat":"المقعد","Your hand":"يدك","Current trick":"الخدعة الحالية","Turn":"دوران","Re eyes":"إعادة العيون","Kontra eyes":"عيون كونترا","Re tricks":"إعادة الحيل","Kontra tricks":"خدع الكونترا","Match points":"نقاط المباراة","Announce Re":"الإعلان عن إعادة","Announce Kontra":"الإعلان عن كونترا","Play selected card":"تشغيل البطاقة المحددة","Select a card":"اختر بطاقة","Re":"إعادة","Kontra":"كونترا","Team not yet known":"الفريق غير معروف بعد","Trick table":"جدول الخدع","Clubs":"النوادي","Spades":"البستوني","Hearts":"قلوب","Diamonds":"الماس","Nine":"تسعة","Jack":"جاك","Queen":"الملكة","King":"ملك","Ten":"عشرة","Ace":"آس","second copy":"النسخة الثانية","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"دورك. اختر بطاقة قانونية.","A computer player is thinking…":"مشغل كمبيوتر يفكر...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"صفقة جديدة جاهزة. أنت تقود هذه الجولة التدريبية.","Selected card":"البطاقة المحددة","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"هذه المسرحية غير قانونية. اتبع الدعوى أو ورقة رابحة عندما يكون ذلك ممكنا.","Deal saved on this device.":"تم حفظ الصفقة على هذا الجهاز.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"الحفظ المحلي غير متاح في هذا المتصفح.","Saved deal resumed.":"تم استئناف الصفقة المحفوظة.","Saved deal deleted.":"تم حذف الصفقة المحفوظة.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"تعذرت قراءة الصفقة المحفوظة. احذفه وابدأ من جديد.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Wedding: أول لاعب آخر يفوز خلال ثلاث جولات يصبح هو الشريك.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"تم حل الزفاف: الفائز بالخدعة هو الشريك.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"فاز لاعب الزفاف بالحيل الثلاث الأولى. الصفقة الآن هي صفقة ماسية منفردة.\nتم الإعلان عن","Re announced.":"إعادة.\nأعلن","Kontra announced.":"كونترا.","Re wins the deal.":"Re يفوز بالصفقة.","Kontra wins the deal.":"كونترا يفوز بالصفقة.","Final eyes":"العيون النهائية","Game points":"نقاط اللعبة","Teams":"الفرق","Start another deal to play again.":"ابدأ صفقة أخرى للعب مرة أخرى.","Rules reference":"مرجع القواعد","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"رابطة Doppelkopf الألمانية · قواعد البطولة، 21 فبراير 2026","Card":"البطاقة","eyes":"العيون"},"bg":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Безплатна местна игра на карти","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Играйте тренировъчна игра Doppelkopf с четири места срещу трима местни компютърни играчи. Научете отбори, козове, трикове и Re/Kontra calls. Безплатно, без акаунт.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Играйте местна игра Doppelkopf с четири места. Следвайте водения цвят или коз, когато можете, намерете отбора Re чрез клубните дами и опитайте съобщение Re или Kontra.","A quick example":"Бърз пример","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"В нормална игра, двамата играчи, които държат купа дама са Re. Ако един играч държи и двете, започва сватба: първият друг играч, който спечели трик в първите три, става негов партньор.","How to play":"Как се играе","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Играта раздава 48 карти: две копия на асо, десетка, поп, дама, вале и деветка във всяка боя. Всяко от четирите места получава 12 карти. Подредбата на Тръмп започва с червената десетка, след това дамите и валетата в ред на боите, следвани от картите с диаманти. Трик се печели от най-високия коз или най-високата карта от главния цвят, ако не е изигран коз. Играта има очи за карти 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","How many cards and players are there?":"Колко карти и играчи има?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf се играе тук с четири места и 48 карти: две копия на всяка от 24 лица на карти. Всяко място получава 12 карти.","How are the teams found?":"Как се намират екипите?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"В нормална игра двете места, държащи купа дама, образуват Re; другите две образуват Контра. Ако едно място държи и двете трефни дами, правилото за сватбата намира партньор по време на първите три взятки.","What happens during a wedding?":"Какво се случва по време на сватба?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Първото друго място, спечелило един от първите три трика, се присъединява към Re. Ако сватбеното място спечели и трите, играта продължава като диамантено соло за един играч.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Коя карта е най-силният коз?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Сърдечната десетка е най-висока. Следват дами в ред трефа, пика, сърце, каро, след това валета в същия ред, след това каро асо, десетка, поп и деветка.","Must I follow suit?":"Трябва ли да последвам примера?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Да. Ако се води цвят без коз, играйте този цвят, когато можете. Ако се води коз, играйте коз, когато можете. В противен случай изберете която и да е карта.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Какво означават Re и Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Това са имената на двата отбора. По време на разрешения прозорец за отваряне играчът може да обяви отбора си веднъж. Обаждането е видимо и променя прага на печалбата и игровите точки.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Това ли е пълният набор от турнирни правила?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Бр. Това е версия за местна практика на нормална игра с Re/Kontra разговори и правилото за сватбата. Пропуска соло, избрани преди игра, откази, турнирни наказания и много домашни правила.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Мога ли да играя с трима приятели онлайн?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Бр. Тримата ви опоненти са обикновени местни компютърни играчи. Няма акаунт, сватовство или онлайн мултиплейър.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Моята сделка онлайн ли е качена или запазена?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Няма качени данни за играта. Текущата ви сделка се запазва автоматично в този браузър на това устройство, така че можете да я възобновите по-късно.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Това е небрежна местна тренировъчна игра, а не онлайн мултиплейър, хазарт, турнирен клиент или експертен решаващ проблем. Той използва реда на картите за нормална игра DDV, разговорите Re/Kontra и сватбената резолюция, но не прилага избираеми сола, откази като keine 90, турнирни наказания, всички специални правила на масата или сертифицирано точкуване на турнири. Трите процесора използват проста евристика за законно движение и могат да вземат слаби решения.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безплатна игра. Картите и резултатите остават в този браузър на това устройство; не се качват данни за играта.","Play Doppelkopf":"Играйте Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Language":"Език","UsefulVerse":"Полезен стих","All tools":"Всички инструменти","New deal":"Нова сделка","Resume saved deal":"Възобновяване на запазена сделка","Delete saved deal":"Изтриване на запазена сделка","Choose New deal to begin.":"Изберете Нова сделка, за да започнете.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Започнете нова сделка или възобновете запазената си игра.","You":"Вие","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Седалка","Your hand":"Вашата ръка","Current trick":"Текущ трик","Turn":"Завой","Re eyes":"Re очи","Kontra eyes":"Контра очи","Re tricks":"Повторни трикове","Kontra tricks":"Контра трикове","Match points":"Точки за съвпадение","Announce Re":"Обяви Re","Announce Kontra":"Обявете Kontra","Play selected card":"Играйте избраната карта","Select a card":"Изберете карта","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Контра","Team not yet known":"Екипът все още не е известен","Trick table":"Трикова маса","Clubs":"Стопове","Spades":"Пика","Hearts":"Сърца","Diamonds":"Диаманти","Nine":"Девет","Jack":"Джак","Queen":"Кралица","King":"Крал","Ten":"Десет","Ace":"Асо","second copy":"второ копие","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Ваш ред. Изберете легална карта.","A computer player is thinking…":"Компютърен играч си мисли...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Нова сделка готова. Вие ръководите тази практика.","Selected card":"Избрана карта","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Тази игра не е законна. Следвайте примера или коз, когато е възможно.","Deal saved on this device.":"Сделката е запазена на това устройство.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Локалното запазване не е налично в този браузър.","Saved deal resumed.":"Запазената сделка е възобновена.","Saved deal deleted.":"Запазената сделка е изтрита.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Запазената сделка не може да бъде прочетена. Изтрийте го и започнете отново.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Сватба: първият друг играч, който спечели в рамките на три трика, става партньор.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Сватбата е разрешена: печелившият трик е партньорът.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Сватбеният играч спечели първите три взятки. Сделката вече е диамантено соло.","Re announced.":"Повторно обявено.","Kontra announced.":"Контра обяви.","Re wins the deal.":"Re печели сделката.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra печели сделката.","Final eyes":"Последни очи","Game points":"Точки за игра","Teams":"Екипи","Start another deal to play again.":"Започнете друга сделка, за да играете отново.","Rules reference":"Препратка към правилата","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Германска асоциация Doppelkopf · Правила на турнира, 21 февруари 2026","Card":"Карта","eyes":"очи"},"bn":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf অনলাইন — বিনামূল্যে স্থানীয় কার্ড গেম","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"তিনজন স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ারের বিরুদ্ধে চার-সিটের ডপেলকপফ অনুশীলন গেম খেলুন। দল, ট্রাম্প, কৌশল এবং রি/কন্ট্রা কল শিখুন। বিনামূল্যে, কোনো অ্যাকাউন্ট নেই।","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"একটি স্থানীয় চার-সিটের ডপেলকপফ গেম খেলুন। আপনি যখন পারেন তখন নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুট বা ট্রাম্প অনুসরণ করুন, ক্লাব কুইন্সের মাধ্যমে রে টিম খুঁজুন এবং একটি রে বা কনট্রা ঘোষণা চেষ্টা করুন।","A quick example":"একটি দ্রুত উদাহরণ","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"একটি সাধারন খেলায়, যে দুইজন খেলোয়াড় একটি ক্লাবের রানী ধারণ করেন তারা হলেন Re. যদি একজন খেলোয়াড় উভয়ই ধরে রাখে, একটি বিবাহ শুরু হয়: প্রথম অন্য খেলোয়াড় যারা প্রথম তিনটিতে একটি কৌশল জিতে তাদের সঙ্গী হয়।","How to play":"কিভাবে খেলতে হয়","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"গেমটি 48 কার্ড নিয়ে কাজ করে: প্রতিটি স্যুটে টেস, টেন, কিং, কুইন, জ্যাক এবং নয়টির দুটি কপি। চারটি আসনের প্রতিটি 12 কার্ড পায়। ট্রাম্পের আদেশ হার্ট টেন দিয়ে শুরু হয়, তারপরে রানী এবং জ্যাকগুলি স্যুট অর্ডারে, তারপরে ডায়মন্ড কার্ড। একটি কৌতুক সর্বোচ্চ ট্রাম্প দ্বারা জিতে যায়, অথবা যদি কোন ট্রাম্প খেলা না হয় তাহলে নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুটের সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড। গেমটিতে 240 কার্ড চোখ রয়েছে।","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","How many cards and players are there?":"কত কার্ড এবং প্লেয়ার আছে?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf এখানে চারটি আসন এবং 48 কার্ডের সাথে খেলা হয়: 24 কার্ডের প্রতিটি মুখের দুটি কপি। প্রতিটি আসন 12 কার্ড পায়।","How are the teams found?":"দলগুলো কিভাবে পাওয়া যায়?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"একটি সাধারণ খেলায়, একটি ক্লাবের রানী ধারণ করা দুটি আসন রে তৈরি করে; অন্য দুটি রূপ কনট্রা। যদি একটি আসন উভয় ক্লাব রানী ধরে রাখে, বিবাহের নিয়ম প্রথম তিনটি কৌশলের সময় একজন সঙ্গী খুঁজে পায়।","What happens during a wedding?":"বিয়ের সময় কি হয়?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"প্রথম তিনটি কৌশলের একটিতে জয়ী প্রথম অন্য আসনটি Re-এ যোগ দেয়। যদি বিয়ের আসন তিনটিই জিতে যায়, গেমটি এক-খেলোয়াড় ডায়মন্ড সোলো হিসাবে চলতে থাকে।","Which card is the strongest trump?":"কোন কার্ডটি সবচেয়ে শক্তিশালী ট্রাম্প?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"হার্ট দশটি সর্বোচ্চ। কুইনরা ক্লাব, কোদাল, হার্ট, ডায়মন্ড অর্ডার অনুসরণ করে, তারপর একই স্যুট অর্ডারে জ্যাক, তারপর ডায়মন্ড এস, টেন, কিং এবং নয়টি।","Must I follow suit?":"আমাকে কি অবশ্যই অনুসরণ করতে হবে?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"হ্যাঁ। যদি একটি নন-ট্রাম্প স্যুট নেতৃত্বে থাকে, আপনি যখন পারেন সেই স্যুটটি খেলুন। যদি একজন ট্রাম্প নেতৃত্বে থাকে, আপনি যখন পারেন তখন ট্রাম্প খেলুন। অন্যথায়, যেকোনো কার্ড বেছে নিন।","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re এবং Kontra মানে কি?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"তারা দুটি দলের নাম। অনুমোদিত খোলার উইন্ডো চলাকালীন, একজন খেলোয়াড় একবার তাদের দল ঘোষণা করতে পারে। কলটি দৃশ্যমান এবং জয়ের থ্রেশহোল্ড এবং গেম পয়েন্ট পরিবর্তন করে।","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"এটি কি সম্পূর্ণ টুর্নামেন্টের নিয়ম?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"না। এটি রে/কন্ট্রা কল এবং বিবাহের নিয়ম সহ সাধারণ খেলার একটি স্থানীয় অনুশীলন সংস্করণ। এটি খেলার আগে নির্বাচিত একক, প্রত্যাখ্যান, টুর্নামেন্টের শাস্তি এবং অনেক ঘরের নিয়ম বাদ দেয়।","Can I play with three friends online?":"আমি কি তিন বন্ধুর সাথে অনলাইনে খেলতে পারি?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"না। আপনার তিন প্রতিপক্ষ সাধারণ স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ার। কোনো অ্যাকাউন্ট, ম্যাচমেকিং বা অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার নেই।","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"আমার চুক্তি কি অনলাইনে আপলোড বা সংরক্ষণ করা হয়েছে?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"কোন গেম ডেটা আপলোড করা হয় না৷ আপনার বর্তমান চুক্তি এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে সংরক্ষিত হয়েছে যাতে আপনি পরে এটি পুনরায় শুরু করতে পারেন।","Rules and limitations":"নিয়ম এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"এটি একটি নৈমিত্তিক স্থানীয় অনুশীলন খেলা, অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার, জুয়া, টুর্নামেন্ট ক্লায়েন্ট বা বিশেষজ্ঞ সমাধানকারী নয়। এটি DDV নরমাল-গেম কার্ড অর্ডার, Re/Kontra কল এবং বিবাহের রেজোলিউশন ব্যবহার করে, কিন্তু নির্বাচনযোগ্য একক, প্রত্যাখ্যান যেমন keine 90, টুর্নামেন্টের শাস্তি, সমস্ত বিশেষ টেবিলের নিয়ম বা প্রত্যয়িত টুর্নামেন্ট স্কোরিং প্রয়োগ করে না। তিনটি সিপিইউ সহজ আইনি-চালিত হিউরিস্টিক ব্যবহার করে এবং দুর্বল সিদ্ধান্ত নিতে পারে।","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"খেলতে বিনামূল্যে। কার্ড এবং স্কোর এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে; কোন খেলা তথ্য আপলোড করা হয় না.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf খেলুন","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত টুলস","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ফ্রি · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Language":"ভাষা","UsefulVerse":"উপযোগী পদ্য","All tools":"সমস্ত টুলস","New deal":"নতুন চুক্তি","Resume saved deal":"সংরক্ষিত চুক্তি পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Delete saved deal":"সংরক্ষিত চুক্তি মুছুন","Choose New deal to begin.":"শুরু করতে নতুন চুক্তি বেছে নিন।","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"একটি নতুন চুক্তি শুরু করুন বা আপনার সংরক্ষিত গেম পুনরায় শুরু করুন৷","You":"তুমি","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"সিট","Your hand":"আপনার হাত","Current trick":"বর্তমান কৌশল","Turn":"বাঁক","Re eyes":"রি চোখ","Kontra eyes":"কন্ট্রা চোখ","Re tricks":"পুনরায় কৌশল","Kontra tricks":"কন্ট্রা ট্রিকস","Match points":"ম্যাচ পয়েন্ট","Announce Re":"পুনরায় ঘোষণা করুন","Announce Kontra":"কনট্রা ঘোষণা করুন","Play selected card":"নির্বাচিত কার্ড খেলুন","Select a card":"একটি কার্ড নির্বাচন করুন","Re":"Re","Kontra":"কন্ট্রা","Team not yet known":"টিম এখনও জানা যায়নি","Trick table":"ট্রিক টেবিল","Clubs":"ক্লাব","Spades":"স্পেডস","Hearts":"হার্টস","Diamonds":"হীরা","Nine":"নয়টি","Jack":"জ্যাক","Queen":"রাণী","King":"কিং","Ten":"দশ","Ace":"এসি","second copy":"সেকেন্ড কপি","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"আপনার পালা। একটি আইনি কার্ড চয়ন করুন.","A computer player is thinking…":"একটি কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ার ভাবছে…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"নতুন চুক্তি প্রস্তুত। আপনি এই অনুশীলন রাউন্ড নেতৃত্ব.","Selected card":"নির্বাচিত কার্ড","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"এই নাটকটি বৈধ নয়। সম্ভব হলে মামলা বা ট্রাম্প অনুসরণ করুন.","Deal saved on this device.":"ডিল এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত।","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"স্থানীয় সংরক্ষণ এই ব্রাউজারে অনুপলব্ধ৷","Saved deal resumed.":"সংরক্ষিত চুক্তি আবার শুরু হয়েছে৷","Saved deal deleted.":"সংরক্ষিত চুক্তি মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে৷","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"সংরক্ষিত চুক্তি পড়া যাবে না। এটি মুছুন এবং আবার শুরু করুন।","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"বিবাহ: তিনটি কৌশলের মধ্যে জয়ী প্রথম অন্য খেলোয়াড় অংশীদার হন।","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"বিয়ের সমাধান হয়েছে: কৌতুক বিজয়ী অংশীদার।","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"বিয়ের খেলোয়াড় প্রথম তিনটি কৌশল জিতেছে। চুক্তিটি এখন হীরার একক।","Re announced.":"পুনরায় ঘোষণা করা হয়েছে।","Kontra announced.":"কন্ট্রা ঘোষণা করেছে।","Re wins the deal.":"রি চুক্তিতে জিতেছে।","Kontra wins the deal.":"কন্ট্রা চুক্তিতে জিতেছে।","Final eyes":"শেষ চোখ","Game points":"গেম পয়েন্ট","Teams":"টিম","Start another deal to play again.":"আবার খেলার জন্য আরেকটি চুক্তি শুরু করুন।","Rules reference":"নিয়ম রেফারেন্স","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"জার্মান ডপেলকোফ অ্যাসোসিয়েশন · টুর্নামেন্টের নিয়ম, 21 ফেব্রুয়ারী 2026","Card":"কার্ড","eyes":"চোখ"},"ca":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf en línia — Joc de cartes local gratuït","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Juga a un joc d'entrenament Doppelkopf de quatre seients contra tres jugadors locals d'ordinador. Aprèn equips, trums, trucs i trucades Re/Kontra. Gratuït, sense compte.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Juga a un joc de Doppelkopf local de quatre places. Segueix el vestit o trump led quan puguis, troba l'equip Re a través de les reines del club i prova un anunci Re o Kontra.","A quick example":"Un exemple ràpid","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"En un joc normal, els dos jugadors que tenen una dama del club són Re. Si un jugador té tots dos, s'inicia una boda: el primer altre jugador que guanya una baza en els tres primers es converteix en la seva parella.","How to play":"Com jugar","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"El joc ofereix cartes 48: dues còpies d'as, deu, rei, dama, jota i nou a cada pal. Cadascun dels quatre seients rep les targetes 12. L'ordre de Trump comença amb el cor deu, després les dames i les preses en ordre del pal, seguit de les cartes de diamants. Un truc el guanya el trumfo més alt, o la carta més alta del pal led si no es juga cap triomf. El joc té els ulls de la targeta 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes més freqüents","How many cards and players are there?":"Quantes cartes i jugadors hi ha?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf es juga aquí amb quatre seients i targetes 48: dues còpies de cadascuna de les cares de la targeta 24. Cada seient rep les targetes 12.","How are the teams found?":"Com es troben els equips?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"En un joc normal, els dos seients que sostenen una reina del club formen Re; els altres dos formen Kontra. Si un seient té les dues reines del club, la regla del casament troba un company durant els tres primers trucs.","What happens during a wedding?":"Què passa durant un casament?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"El primer altre seient a guanyar un dels tres primers trucs s'uneix a Re. Si el seient del casament guanya els tres, el joc continua com un sol de diamant per a un jugador.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Quina targeta és l'atout més fort?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"El cor deu és més alt. Les reines segueixen en porra, pala, cor, ordre de diamants, després les preses en el mateix ordre de pal, després l'as de diamants, deu, rei i nou.","Must I follow suit?":"He de seguir l'exemple?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Sí. Si es porta un vestit no triomf, juga aquest vestit quan puguis. Si es porta un trumfo, toca un trumfo quan puguis. En cas contrari, trieu qualsevol targeta.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Què signifiquen Re i Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Són els noms dels dos equips. Durant la finestra d'obertura permesa, un jugador pot anunciar el seu equip una vegada. La trucada és visible i canvia el llindar de victòria i els punts de joc.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"És aquest el conjunt de regles del torneig complet?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Núm. Aquesta és una versió de pràctica local del joc normal amb trucades Re/Kontra i la regla del casament. Deixa de banda els solos escollits abans del joc, les denegacions, les penalitzacions del torneig i moltes regles de la casa.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Puc jugar amb tres amics en línia?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Núm. Els teus tres oponents són simples jugadors d'ordinador local. No hi ha cap compte, matchmaking o multijugador en línia.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"El meu acord s'ha penjat o desat en línia?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"No s'ha penjat cap dada del joc. La vostra oferta actual es desa automàticament en aquest navegador d'aquest dispositiu perquè pugueu reprendre-la més tard.","Rules and limitations":"Normes i limitacions","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Aquest és un joc de pràctica local casual, no multijugador en línia, jocs d'atzar, un client de torneig o un solucionador expert. Utilitza l'ordre de cartes de joc normal DDV, les trucades de Re/Kontra i la resolució del casament, però no implementa solos seleccionables, denegacions com ara keine 90, penalitzacions del torneig, totes les regles especials de la taula o puntuació certificada del torneig. Les tres CPU utilitzen heurístiques simples de moviment legal i poden prendre decisions febles.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Jugar gratuït. Les targetes i les puntuacions es mantenen en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu; no es pengen dades del joc.","Play Doppelkopf":"Jugar a Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUÏT · EXECUCIÓ AL TEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Vers útil","All tools":"Totes les eines","New deal":"Nou acord","Resume saved deal":"Reprèn l'oferta desada","Delete saved deal":"Suprimeix l'oferta desada","Choose New deal to begin.":"Trieu un nou acord per començar.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Comença un nou acord o reprèn la partida desada.","You":"Vostè","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Seient","Your hand":"La teva mà","Current trick":"Truc actual","Turn":"Gira","Re eyes":"Re ulls","Kontra eyes":"Ulls de Kontra","Re tricks":"Re trucs","Kontra tricks":"Trucs de Kontra","Match points":"Punts de partit","Announce Re":"Anunciar Re","Announce Kontra":"Anunciar Kontra","Play selected card":"Reprodueix la targeta seleccionada","Select a card":"Seleccioneu una targeta","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Equip encara no conegut","Trick table":"Taula de trucs","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Piques","Hearts":"Cors","Diamonds":"Diamants","Nine":"Nou","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Reina","King":"Rei","Ten":"Deu","Ace":"As","second copy":"segona còpia","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Tu torn. Trieu una targeta legal.","A computer player is thinking…":"Un reproductor d'ordinador està pensant...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nou acord a punt. Tu lideres aquesta ronda de pràctiques.","Selected card":"Targeta seleccionada","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Aquesta jugada no és legal. Seguiu l'exemple o trump quan sigui possible.","Deal saved on this device.":"Oferta desada en aquest dispositiu.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"L'emmagatzematge local no està disponible en aquest navegador.","Saved deal resumed.":"Acord desat reprès.","Saved deal deleted.":"S'ha suprimit l'oferta desada.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"No s'ha pogut llegir l'acord desat. Suprimeix-lo i torna a començar.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Boda: el primer altre jugador que guanya en tres trucs es converteix en el soci.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Boda resolta: el guanyador del truc és la parella.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"El jugador del casament va guanyar els tres primers trucs. L'acord ara és un sol de diamants.","Re announced.":"Va anunciar.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra anunciat.","Re wins the deal.":"Re guanya l'oferta.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra guanya l'acord.","Final eyes":"Ulls finals","Game points":"Punts de joc","Teams":"Equips","Start another deal to play again.":"Comença un altre acord per jugar de nou.","Rules reference":"Referència de regles","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Associació alemanya de Doppelkopf · Regles del torneig, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"Targeta","eyes":"ulls"},"de":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online – Kostenloses lokales Kartenspiel","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Spielen Sie ein Doppelkopf-Übungsspiel mit vier Sitzplätzen gegen drei lokale Computerspieler. Lernen Sie Teams, Trümpfe, Tricks und Re/Kontra-Anrufe. Kostenlos, kein Konto.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Spielen Sie ein lokales Doppelkopf-Spiel mit vier Spielern. Folgen Sie der ausgespielten Farbe oder dem Trumpf, wenn Sie können, finden Sie das Re-Team anhand der Kreuzköniginnen und versuchen Sie es mit einer Re- oder Kontra-Ansage.","A quick example":"Ein kurzes Beispiel","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"In einem normalen Spiel sind die beiden Spieler, die eine Kreuzkönigin halten, Re. Wenn ein Spieler beide hält, beginnt eine Hochzeit: Der erste andere Spieler, der in den ersten drei Stichen einen Stich gewinnt, wird sein Partner.","How to play":"Wie man spielt","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Das Spiel gibt 48 Karten aus: zwei Kopien von Ass, Zehn, König, Dame, Bube und Neun in jeder Farbe. Jeder der vier Sitzplätze erhält 12-Karten. Die Trump-Reihenfolge beginnt mit der Herz-Zehn, dann folgen die Damen und Buben in der Reihenfolge der Farben, gefolgt von den Karo-Karten. Einen Stich gewinnt der höchste Trumpf oder die höchste Karte der ausgespielten Farbe, wenn kein Trumpf gespielt wird. Das Spiel hat 240-Kartenaugen.","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","How many cards and players are there?":"Wie viele Karten und Spieler gibt es?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf wird hier mit vier Plätzen und 48-Karten gespielt: zwei Kopien jeder 24-Kartenseite. Jeder Sitzplatz erhält 12-Karten.","How are the teams found?":"Wie werden die Teams gefunden?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"In einem normalen Spiel bilden die beiden Sitze mit einer Club-Dame Re; die anderen beiden bilden Kontra. Wenn auf einem Sitz beide Club-Königinnen sitzen, findet die Hochzeitsregel während der ersten drei Stiche einen Partner.","What happens during a wedding?":"Was passiert während einer Hochzeit?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Der erste andere Platz, der einen der ersten drei Stiche gewinnt, schließt sich Re an. Wenn der Hochzeitssitz alle drei gewinnt, wird das Spiel als Diamant-Solo für einen Spieler fortgesetzt.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Welche Karte ist der stärkste Trumpf?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Die Herz-Zehn ist am höchsten. Es folgen Damen in der Reihenfolge Kreuz, Pik, Herz, Karo, dann Buben in derselben Farbreihenfolge, dann das Karo-Ass, die Zehn, der König und die Neun.","Must I follow suit?":"Muss ich nachziehen?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ja. Wenn eine Nicht-Trumpffarbe ausgespielt wird, spielen Sie diese Farbe, wann immer Sie können. Wenn ein Trumpf ausgespielt wird, spielen Sie einen Trumpf, wenn Sie können. Andernfalls wählen Sie eine beliebige Karte.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Was bedeuten Re und Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Das sind die Namen der beiden Teams. Während des erlaubten Eröffnungsfensters kann ein Spieler sein Team einmal bekannt geben. Der Aufruf ist sichtbar und verändert die Gewinnschwelle und die Spielpunkte.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Ist das der vollständige Turnierregelsatz?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Nr. Dies ist eine lokale Übungsversion des normalen Spiels mit Re/Kontra-Rufen und der Hochzeitsregel. Vor dem Spiel ausgewählte Soli, Ablehnungen, Turnierstrafen und viele Hausregeln werden nicht berücksichtigt.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Kann ich mit drei Freunden online spielen?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Nr. Ihre drei Gegner sind einfache lokale Computerspieler. Es gibt kein Konto, kein Matchmaking oder Online-Multiplayer.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Wird mein Angebot online hochgeladen oder gespeichert?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Es werden keine Spieldaten hochgeladen. Ihr aktuelles Angebot wird automatisch in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät gespeichert, sodass Sie es später fortsetzen können.","Rules and limitations":"Regeln und Einschränkungen","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Dies ist ein lockeres lokales Übungsspiel, kein Online-Multiplayer, Glücksspiel, ein Turnier-Client oder ein Experten-Löser. Es verwendet die DDV-Normalspielkartenreihenfolge, die Re/Kontra-Anrufe und die Hochzeitsauflösung, implementiert jedoch keine wählbaren Soli, Ablehnungen wie keine 90, Turnierstrafen, alle speziellen Tischregeln oder zertifizierte Turnierwertung. Die drei CPUs verwenden einfache Legal-Move-Heuristiken und treffen möglicherweise schwache Entscheidungen.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kostenlos spielbar. Karten und Punkte bleiben in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät; Es werden keine Spieldaten hochgeladen.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf spielen","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Language":"Sprache","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Alle Werkzeuge","New deal":"Neues Angebot","Resume saved deal":"Gespeichertes Geschäft fortsetzen","Delete saved deal":"Gespeichertes Angebot löschen","Choose New deal to begin.":"Wählen Sie „Neues Angebot“, um zu beginnen.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Starten Sie einen neuen Deal oder setzen Sie Ihr gespeichertes Spiel fort.","You":"Sie","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Sitz","Your hand":"Deine Hand","Current trick":"Aktueller Trick","Turn":"Umdrehen","Re eyes":"Re Augen","Kontra eyes":"Kontra-Augen","Re tricks":"Re-Tricks","Kontra tricks":"Kontra-Tricks","Match points":"Punkte abgleichen","Announce Re":"Betreff ankündigen","Announce Kontra":"Kontra ankündigen","Play selected card":"Ausgewählte Karte spielen","Select a card":"Wählen Sie eine Karte aus","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Team noch nicht bekannt","Trick table":"Tricktabelle","Clubs":"Schläger","Spades":"Spaten","Hearts":"Herzen","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Nine":"Neun","Jack":"Buchse","Queen":"Königin","King":"König","Ten":"Zehn","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"zweite Kopie","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Du bist dran. Wählen Sie eine legale Karte.","A computer player is thinking…":"Ein Computerspieler denkt…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Neues Angebot bereit. Du leitest diese Übungsrunde.","Selected card":"Ausgewählte Karte","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Dieses Spiel ist nicht legal. Folgen Sie Farbe oder Trumpf, wenn möglich.","Deal saved on this device.":"Angebot für dieses Gerät gespeichert.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Lokales Speichern ist in diesem Browser nicht verfügbar.","Saved deal resumed.":"Gespeicherter Deal fortgesetzt.","Saved deal deleted.":"Gespeicherter Deal gelöscht.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Der gespeicherte Deal konnte nicht gelesen werden. Löschen Sie es und beginnen Sie erneut.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Hochzeit: Der erste andere Spieler, der innerhalb von drei Stichen gewinnt, wird Partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Hochzeit gelöst: Der Stichgewinner ist der Partner.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Der Hochzeitsspieler hat die ersten drei Stiche gewonnen. Der Deal ist jetzt ein Diamond Solo.","Re announced.":"Neu angekündigt.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra angekündigt.","Re wins the deal.":"Re gewinnt den Deal.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra gewinnt den Deal.","Final eyes":"Letzte Augen","Game points":"Spielpunkte","Teams":"Teams","Start another deal to play again.":"Starten Sie einen weiteren Deal, um erneut zu spielen.","Rules reference":"Regelreferenz","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Deutscher Doppelkopfverband · Turnierregeln, 21 Feb. 2026","Card":"Karte","eyes":"Augen"},"el":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Δωρεάν τοπικό παιχνίδι καρτών","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Παίξτε ένα παιχνίδι πρακτικής Doppelkopf τεσσάρων θέσεων ενάντια σε τρεις τοπικούς παίκτες υπολογιστών. Μάθετε ομάδες, ατού, κόλπα και κλήσεις Re/Kontra. Δωρεάν, χωρίς λογαριασμό.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Παίξτε ένα τοπικό τετραθέσιο παιχνίδι Doppelkopf. Ακολουθήστε το led κοστούμι ή ατού όταν μπορείτε, βρείτε την ομάδα Re μέσω των βασίλισσες του κλαμπ και δοκιμάστε μια ανακοίνωση Re ή Kontra.","A quick example":"Ένα γρήγορο παράδειγμα","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Σε ένα κανονικό παιχνίδι, οι δύο παίκτες που έχουν μια βασίλισσα του συλλόγου είναι ο Re. Εάν ένας παίκτης έχει και τα δύο, ξεκινά ένας γάμος: ο πρώτος άλλος παίκτης που θα κερδίσει ένα κόλπο στα τρία πρώτα γίνεται σύντροφός τους.","How to play":"Πώς να παίξετε","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Το παιχνίδι μοιράζει κάρτες 48: δύο αντίγραφα άσου, δέκα, king, queen, jack και εννέα σε κάθε χρώμα. Κάθε μία από τις τέσσερις θέσεις παίρνει κάρτες 12. Η παραγγελία Τραμπ ξεκινά με την καρδιά δέκα, μετά οι βασίλισσες και οι γρύλοι με τη σειρά των κοστουμιών, ακολουθούμενες από τις διαμαντένιες κάρτες. Ένα κόλπο κερδίζεται από το υψηλότερο ατού ή το υψηλότερο φύλλο του led χρώματος εάν δεν παιχτεί ατού. Το παιχνίδι έχει μάτια κάρτας 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","How many cards and players are there?":"Πόσα φύλλα και παίκτες υπάρχουν;\nΤο","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf παίζεται εδώ με τέσσερις θέσεις και κάρτες 48: δύο αντίγραφα από κάθε μία από τις όψεις των καρτών 24. Κάθε θέση λαμβάνει κάρτες 12.","How are the teams found?":"Πώς βρίσκονται οι ομάδες;","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Σε ένα κανονικό παιχνίδι, οι δύο θέσεις που κρατούν μια βασίλισσα του συλλόγου σχηματίζουν το Re. τα άλλα δύο σχηματίζουν το Kontra. Εάν η μία θέση χωράει και τις δύο βασίλισσες του κλαμπ, ο κανόνας του γάμου βρίσκει έναν σύντροφο στα τρία πρώτα κόλπα.","What happens during a wedding?":"Τι συμβαίνει κατά τη διάρκεια ενός γάμου;","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Η πρώτη άλλη θέση που κέρδισε ένα από τα τρία πρώτα κόλπα έρχεται στο Re. Εάν το κάθισμα του γάμου κερδίσει και τα τρία, το παιχνίδι συνεχίζεται ως σόλο διαμάντι ενός παίκτη.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Ποιο φύλλο είναι το πιο δυνατό ατού;","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Η καρδιά δέκα είναι η υψηλότερη. Ακολουθούν οι βασίλισσες σε κλαμπ, φτυάρι, καρδιά, σειρά διαμαντιών, μετά βαλέδες με την ίδια σειρά, μετά ο άσος με διαμάντια, δέκα, βασιλιάς και εννέα.","Must I follow suit?":"Πρέπει να ακολουθήσω το παράδειγμά μου;","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ναι. Εάν ένα κοστούμι που δεν είναι ατού είναι led, παίξτε αυτό το κοστούμι όταν μπορείτε. Εάν οδηγείτε ένα ατού, παίξτε ένα ατού όταν μπορείτε. Διαφορετικά, επιλέξτε οποιαδήποτε κάρτα.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Τι σημαίνουν τα Re και Kontra;","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Είναι τα ονόματα των δύο ομάδων. Κατά τη διάρκεια του επιτρεπόμενου ανοίγματος, ένας παίκτης μπορεί να ανακοινώσει την ομάδα του μία φορά. Η κλήση είναι ορατή και αλλάζει το όριο νίκης και τους πόντους παιχνιδιού.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Είναι αυτό το πλήρες σύνολο κανόνων τουρνουά;","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Αρ. Αυτή είναι μια τοπική πρακτική έκδοση του κανονικού παιχνιδιού με τις κλήσεις Re/Kontra και τον κανόνα του γάμου. Αφήνει έξω τα σόλο που επιλέγονται πριν από το παιχνίδι, τις αρνήσεις, τις ποινές τουρνουά και πολλούς κανόνες σπιτιού.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Μπορώ να παίξω με τρεις φίλους στο διαδίκτυο;","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Αρ. Οι τρεις αντίπαλοί σας είναι απλοί τοπικοί παίκτες υπολογιστών. Δεν υπάρχει λογαριασμός, matchmaking ή online multiplayer.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Η συμφωνία μου έχει μεταφορτωθεί ή αποθηκευτεί στο διαδίκτυο;","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Δεν έχουν μεταφορτωθεί δεδομένα παιχνιδιού. Η τρέχουσα συμφωνία σας αποθηκεύεται αυτόματα σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή, ώστε να μπορείτε να τη συνεχίσετε αργότερα.","Rules and limitations":"Κανόνες και περιορισμοί","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Πρόκειται για ένα απλό τοπικό παιχνίδι πρακτικής, όχι διαδικτυακό παιχνίδι για πολλούς παίκτες, τζόγο, πελάτη τουρνουά ή ειδικός λύτης. Χρησιμοποιεί τη σειρά καρτών κανονικού παιχνιδιού DDV, τις κλήσεις Re/Kontra και την ανάλυση γάμου, αλλά δεν εφαρμόζει επιλέξιμα σόλο, αρνήσεις όπως το keine 90, ποινές τουρνουά, όλους τους ειδικούς κανόνες τραπεζιού ή πιστοποιημένη βαθμολογία τουρνουά. Οι τρεις CPU χρησιμοποιούν απλές ευρετικές νομικές κινήσεις και ενδέχεται να λαμβάνουν αδύναμες αποφάσεις.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Δωρεάν παιχνίδι. Οι κάρτες και οι βαθμολογίες παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. δεν μεταφορτώνονται δεδομένα παιχνιδιού.","Play Doppelkopf":"Παίξτε Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Language":"Γλώσσα","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Όλα τα εργαλεία","New deal":"Νέα προσφορά","Resume saved deal":"Συνέχιση αποθηκευμένης συμφωνίας","Delete saved deal":"Διαγραφή αποθηκευμένης συμφωνίας","Choose New deal to begin.":"Επιλέξτε Νέα συμφωνία για να ξεκινήσετε.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Ξεκινήστε μια νέα συμφωνία ή συνεχίστε το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι σας.","You":"Εσείς","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Κάθισμα","Your hand":"Το χέρι σου","Current trick":"Τρέχον κόλπο","Turn":"Στροφή","Re eyes":"Ρε μάτια","Kontra eyes":"Κόντρα μάτια","Re tricks":"Εκ νέου κόλπα","Kontra tricks":"Κόντρα κόλπα","Match points":"Πόντοι αγώνα","Announce Re":"Ανακοίνωση Re","Announce Kontra":"Ανακοινώστε το Kontra","Play selected card":"Παίξτε επιλεγμένη κάρτα","Select a card":"Επιλέξτε μια κάρτα","Re":"Απ","Kontra":"Κόντρα","Team not yet known":"Η ομάδα δεν είναι ακόμη γνωστή","Trick table":"Τραπέζι κόλπο","Clubs":"Συλλόγους","Spades":"Μπαστούνια","Hearts":"Καρδιές","Diamonds":"Διαμάντια","Nine":"Εννέα","Jack":"Βύσμα","Queen":"Βασίλισσα","King":"Βασιλιάς","Ten":"Δέκα","Ace":"Άσσος","second copy":"δεύτερο αντίγραφο","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Σειρά σου. Επιλέξτε μια νόμιμη κάρτα.","A computer player is thinking…":"Ένας παίκτης υπολογιστή σκέφτεται…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Έτοιμη η νέα προσφορά. Οδηγείτε αυτόν τον γύρο εξάσκησης.","Selected card":"Επιλεγμένη κάρτα","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Αυτό το παιχνίδι δεν είναι νόμιμο. Ακολουθήστε το παράδειγμα ή τον ατού όταν είναι δυνατόν.","Deal saved on this device.":"Η προσφορά αποθηκεύτηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Η τοπική αποθήκευση δεν είναι διαθέσιμη σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.","Saved deal resumed.":"Η αποθηκευμένη συμφωνία συνεχίστηκε.","Saved deal deleted.":"Η αποθηκευμένη συμφωνία διαγράφηκε.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση της αποθηκευμένης συμφωνίας. Διαγράψτε το και ξεκινήστε ξανά.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Γάμος: ο πρώτος άλλος παίκτης που θα κερδίσει μέσα σε τρία κόλπα γίνεται ο συνεργάτης.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Ο γάμος λύθηκε: ο νικητής του κόλπου είναι ο σύντροφος.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Ο παίκτης του γάμου κέρδισε τα τρία πρώτα κόλπα. Η συμφωνία είναι πλέον ένα σόλο διαμάντι.","Re announced.":"Ανακοινώθηκε ξανά.\nΑνακοινώθηκε το","Kontra announced.":"Kontra.\nΤο","Re wins the deal.":"Re κερδίζει τη συμφωνία.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Η Kontra κερδίζει τη συμφωνία.","Final eyes":"Τελικά μάτια","Game points":"Πόντοι παιχνιδιού","Teams":"Ομάδες","Start another deal to play again.":"Ξεκινήστε μια άλλη συμφωνία για να παίξετε ξανά.","Rules reference":"Αναφορά κανόνων","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Γερμανική Ένωση Doppelkopf · Κανόνες τουρνουά, 21 Φεβ 2026","Card":"Κάρτα","eyes":"μάτια"},"es":{"Doppelkopf":"Cabeza doble","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Juego de cartas local gratuito","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Juega un juego de práctica Doppelkopf de cuatro asientos contra tres jugadores de computadora locales. Aprenda equipos, triunfos, bazas y cantos de Re/Kontra. Gratis, sin cuenta.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Juega un juego Doppelkopf local de cuatro asientos. Siga el palo liderado o triunfe cuando pueda, encuentre el equipo Re a través de las reinas de trebol e intente un anuncio Re o Kontra.","A quick example":"Un ejemplo rápido","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"En un juego normal, los dos jugadores que tienen una dama de trebol son Re. Si un jugador tiene ambos, comienza una boda: el primer otro jugador que gane una baza de los tres primeros se convierte en su compañero.","How to play":"Cómo jugar","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"El juego reparte cartas 48: dos copias de as, diez, rey, reina, sota y nueve de cada palo. Cada uno de los cuatro asientos recibe tarjetas 12. El orden de triunfo comienza con el diez de corazón, luego las reinas y las jotas en orden de palo, seguido de las cartas de diamantes. Una baza se gana con el triunfo más alto, o con la carta más alta del palo liderado si no se juega ningún triunfo. El juego tiene ojos de cartas 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","How many cards and players are there?":"¿Cuántas cartas y jugadores hay?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf se juega aquí con cuatro asientos y cartas 48: dos copias de cada una de las caras de las cartas 24. Cada asiento recibe tarjetas 12.","How are the teams found?":"¿Cómo se encuentran los equipos?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"En un juego normal, los dos asientos que tienen una reina de trébol forman Re; los otros dos forman Kontra. Si un asiento tiene ambas reinas de trébol, la regla de la boda encuentra una pareja durante las primeras tres bazas.","What happens during a wedding?":"¿Qué pasa durante una boda?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"El primer otro asiento en ganar una de las tres primeras bazas se une a Re. Si el asiento nupcial gana los tres, el juego continúa como un solo diamante para un jugador.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"¿Qué carta es el triunfo más fuerte?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"El diez del corazón es el más alto. Las reinas siguen en orden de trébol, espada, corazón, diamante, luego las jotas en el mismo orden de palo, luego el as de diamante, el diez, el rey y el nueve.","Must I follow suit?":"¿Debo hacer lo mismo?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Sí. Si se sale de un palo que no es de triunfo, juegue ese palo cuando pueda. Si se juega un triunfo, juegue un triunfo cuando pueda. De lo contrario, elige cualquier tarjeta.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"¿Qué significan Re y Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Son los nombres de los dos equipos. Durante la ventana de apertura permitida, un jugador puede anunciar su equipo una vez. La llamada es visible y cambia el umbral de ganancias y los puntos del juego.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"¿Es este el conjunto de reglas completo del torneo?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"No. Esta es una versión de práctica local del juego normal con llamadas de Re/Kontra y la regla de la boda. Deja de lado los solos elegidos antes del juego, los rechazos, las sanciones del torneo y muchas reglas de la casa.","Can I play with three friends online?":"¿Puedo jugar con tres amigos online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"No. Tus tres oponentes son simples jugadores de computadora locales. No hay cuenta, emparejamiento ni multijugador en línea.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"¿Mi oferta se carga o guarda en línea?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"No se cargan datos del juego. Su oferta actual se guarda automáticamente en este navegador en este dispositivo para que pueda reanudarla más tarde.","Rules and limitations":"Reglas y limitaciones","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Este es un juego de práctica local informal, no un modo multijugador en línea, juegos de azar, un cliente de torneos o un solucionador experto. Utiliza el orden de cartas del juego normal DDV, las llamadas Re/Kontra y la resolución de bodas, pero no implementa solos seleccionables, rechazos como keine 90, penalizaciones de torneo, todas las reglas especiales de mesa o puntuación de torneo certificada. Las tres CPU utilizan heurísticas simples de movimientos legales y pueden tomar decisiones débiles.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis para jugar. Las tarjetas y las puntuaciones permanecen en este navegador en este dispositivo; no se cargan datos del juego.","Play Doppelkopf":"Reproducir Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Verso útil","All tools":"Todas las herramientas","New deal":"Nuevo acuerdo","Resume saved deal":"Reanudar oferta guardada","Delete saved deal":"Eliminar oferta guardada","Choose New deal to begin.":"Elija Nuevo acuerdo para comenzar.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Inicia un nuevo trato o reanuda tu juego guardado.","You":"Tú","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Asiento","Your hand":"Tu mano","Current trick":"Truco actual","Turn":"Girar","Re eyes":"Re ojos","Kontra eyes":"Ojos contrastantes","Re tricks":"Re trucos","Kontra tricks":"Trucos de Kontra","Match points":"Puntos de partido","Announce Re":"Anunciar Re","Announce Kontra":"Anuncie Kontra","Play selected card":"Jugar la carta seleccionada","Select a card":"Seleccione una tarjeta","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Contra","Team not yet known":"Equipo aún no conocido","Trick table":"Tabla de trucos","Clubs":"Palos","Spades":"Espadas","Hearts":"Corazones","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Nine":"Nueve","Jack":"Conector","Queen":"Reina","King":"Rey","Ten":"Diez","Ace":"As","second copy":"segunda copia","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Tu turno. Elija una tarjeta legal.","A computer player is thinking…":"Un jugador de computadora está pensando…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nuevo acuerdo listo. Tú diriges esta ronda de práctica.","Selected card":"Tarjeta seleccionada","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Esa jugada no es legal. Haga lo mismo o triunfe cuando sea posible.","Deal saved on this device.":"Oferta guardada en este dispositivo.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"El guardado local no está disponible en este navegador.","Saved deal resumed.":"Se reanudó el acuerdo guardado.","Saved deal deleted.":"Oferta guardada eliminada.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"No se pudo leer el trato guardado. Bórralo y comienza de nuevo.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Boda: el primer otro jugador que gane en tres bazas se convierte en compañero.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Boda resuelta: el ganador del truco es el socio.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"El jugador de la boda ganó las tres primeras bazas. El acuerdo es ahora un solo diamante.","Re announced.":"Re anunciado.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra anunciado.","Re wins the deal.":"Re gana el trato.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra gana el trato.","Final eyes":"Ojos finales","Game points":"Puntos de juego","Teams":"Equipos","Start another deal to play again.":"Iniciar otro trato para volver a jugar.","Rules reference":"Referencia de reglas","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Asociación Alemana Doppelkopf · Reglas del torneo, 21 febrero 2026","Card":"Tarjeta","eyes":"ojos"},"fa":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — بازی کارت محلی رایگان","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"یک بازی تمرینی Doppelkopf چهار نفره را با سه بازیکن کامپیوتر محلی انجام دهید. تیم ها، ترمپ ها، ترفندها و تماس های Re/Kontra را بیاموزید. رایگان، بدون حساب.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"بازی محلی Doppelkopf چهار صندلی را انجام دهید. تا زمانی که می توانید از لباس led یا ترامپ پیروی کنید، تیم Re را از طریق ملکه های باشگاه پیدا کنید و اعلامیه Re یا Kontra را امتحان کنید.","A quick example":"یک مثال سریع","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"در یک بازی معمولی، دو بازیکنی که یک ملکه کلاب دارند، Re هستند. اگر یکی از بازیکنان هر دو را نگه دارد، عروسی شروع می شود: اولین بازیکن دیگری که در سه بازی اول ترفند را برنده می شود، شریک زندگی آنها می شود.","How to play":"نحوه بازی","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"این بازی کارت های 48 را می فروشد: دو کپی از ACE، ده، پادشاه، ملکه، جک و نه در هر لباس. هر چهار صندلی کارت 12 دریافت می کند. دستور ترامپ با قلب ده شروع می شود، سپس ملکه ها و جک ها به ترتیب کت و شلوار و سپس کارت های الماس. یک ترفند توسط بالاترین ترامپ برنده می شود، یا بالاترین کارت لباس رهبری شده در صورتی که ترامپ بازی نشود. این بازی دارای چشم کارت 240 است.","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","How many cards and players are there?":"چند کارت و بازیکن وجود دارد؟","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf در اینجا با چهار صندلی و کارت‌های 48 بازی می‌شود: دو نسخه از هر یک از چهره‌های کارت 24. هر صندلی کارت 12 دریافت می کند.","How are the teams found?":"تیم ها چگونه پیدا می شوند؟","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"در یک بازی معمولی، دو صندلی که یک ملکه باشگاه را در دست دارند، Re را تشکیل می دهند. دو نفر دیگر کنترا را تشکیل می دهند. اگر یک صندلی هر دو ملکه باشگاه را در خود جای دهد، قانون عروسی در طول سه ترفند اول یک شریک پیدا می کند.","What happens during a wedding?":"در طول یک عروسی چه اتفاقی می افتد؟","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"اولین صندلی دیگری که یکی از سه ترفند اول را برنده می شود به Re می پیوندد. اگر صندلی عروسی هر سه را برد، بازی به صورت تک نفره الماس ادامه می یابد.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"کدام کارت قوی ترین برنده است؟","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"قلب ده بالاترین است. ملکه‌ها به ترتیب کلوپ، بیل، قلب، ترتیب الماس، سپس جک‌ها به ترتیب کت و شلوار، سپس آس الماس، ده، کینگ و نه دنبال می‌شوند.","Must I follow suit?":"آیا باید از آن پیروی کنم؟","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"بله. اگر کت و شلوار غیر ترامپی هدایت می شود، آن کت و شلوار را تا زمانی که می توانید بنوازید. اگر ترامپ رهبری می شود، هر وقت که می توانید یک ترامپ بازی کنید. در غیر این صورت، هر کارتی را انتخاب کنید.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re و Kontra به چه معناست؟","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"اسامی دو تیم است. در طول پنجره باز مجاز، یک بازیکن می تواند یک بار تیم خود را اعلام کند. تماس قابل مشاهده است و آستانه برد و امتیاز بازی را تغییر می دهد.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"آیا این مجموعه قوانین کامل مسابقات است؟","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"شماره. این یک نسخه تمرین محلی از بازی معمولی با تماس های Re/Kontra و قانون عروسی است. سولوهای انتخاب شده قبل از بازی، امتناع، جریمه مسابقات و بسیاری از قوانین خانه را کنار می گذارد.","Can I play with three friends online?":"آیا می توانم با سه دوست آنلاین بازی کنم؟","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"شماره. سه حریف شما بازیکنان ساده کامپیوتر محلی هستند. هیچ حساب کاربری، خواستگاری یا چند نفره آنلاین وجود ندارد.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"آیا معامله من به صورت آنلاین آپلود شده یا ذخیره شده است؟","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"هیچ داده بازی آپلود نشده است. قرارداد فعلی شما به طور خودکار در این مرورگر در این دستگاه ذخیره می شود تا بتوانید بعداً آن را از سر بگیرید.","Rules and limitations":"قوانین و محدودیت ها","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"این یک بازی تمرین محلی معمولی است، نه چند نفره آنلاین، قمار، مشتری مسابقات یا حل کننده متخصص. از ترتیب کارت بازی معمولی DDV، تماس‌های Re/Kontra و وضوح عروسی استفاده می‌کند، اما تک‌نفره‌های قابل انتخاب، امتناع‌هایی مانند Keine 90، جریمه‌های مسابقات، همه قوانین جدول ویژه یا امتیازدهی مسابقات معتبر را اجرا نمی‌کند. سه CPU از اکتشافی حرکت قانونی ساده استفاده می کنند و ممکن است تصمیمات ضعیفی بگیرند.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"بازی رایگان. کارت ها و امتیازات در این مرورگر در این دستگاه باقی می مانند. هیچ داده بازی آپلود نمی شود.","Play Doppelkopf":"بازی Doppelkopf","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"کلیه ابزار","New deal":"فروش جدید","Resume saved deal":"ازسرگیری معامله ذخیره شده","Delete saved deal":"حذف معامله ذخیره شده","Choose New deal to begin.":"برای شروع معامله جدید را انتخاب کنید.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"یک معامله جدید شروع کنید یا بازی ذخیره شده خود را از سر بگیرید.","You":"شما","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"صندلی","Your hand":"دست تو","Current trick":"ترفند فعلی","Turn":"پیچ","Re eyes":"باز چشم","Kontra eyes":"چشم های کنترا","Re tricks":"ترفندهای دوباره","Kontra tricks":"ترفندهای کنترا","Match points":"امتیاز مطابقت","Announce Re":"اعلام Re","Announce Kontra":"کنترا را اعلام کنید","Play selected card":"بازی کارت انتخابی","Select a card":"یک کارت را انتخاب کنید","Re":"Re","Kontra":"کنترا","Team not yet known":"تیم هنوز مشخص نیست","Trick table":"میز ترفند","Clubs":"باشگاه","Spades":"بیل","Hearts":"قلب","Diamonds":"الماس","Nine":"نه","Jack":"جک","Queen":"ملکه","King":"پادشاه","Ten":"ده","Ace":"آس","second copy":"نسخه دوم","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"نوبت شماست. کارت حقوقی را انتخاب کنید.","A computer player is thinking…":"یک پخش کننده کامپیوتر در حال فکر کردن به…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"فروش جدید آماده است. شما این دور تمرین را رهبری می کنید.","Selected card":"کارت انتخابی","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"این بازی قانونی نیست. در صورت امکان از همین روش یا ترامپ پیروی کنید.","Deal saved on this device.":"معامله در این دستگاه ذخیره شد.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"ذخیره محلی در این مرورگر در دسترس نیست.","Saved deal resumed.":"معامله ذخیره شده از سر گرفته شد.","Saved deal deleted.":"معامله ذخیره شده حذف شد.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"قرارداد ذخیره شده قابل خواندن نیست. آن را حذف کنید و دوباره شروع کنید.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"عروسی: اولین بازیکن دیگری که در سه ترفند برنده می شود شریک می شود.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"عروسی حل شد: برنده حقه شریک است.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"بازیکن عروسی سه ترفند اول را برد. این معامله اکنون به صورت تکی الماس است.","Re announced.":"Re اعلام شد.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra اعلام شد.","Re wins the deal.":"Re برنده معامله است.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra برنده معامله است.","Final eyes":"چشم های نهایی","Game points":"امتیاز بازی","Teams":"تیم ها","Start another deal to play again.":"برای بازی دوباره معامله دیگری را شروع کنید.","Rules reference":"مرجع قوانین","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"انجمن Doppelkopf آلمان · قوانین مسابقات، 21 فوریه 2026","Card":"کارت","eyes":"چشم"},"fr":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Jeu de cartes local gratuit","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Jouez à un jeu d'entraînement Doppelkopf à quatre places contre trois joueurs informatiques locaux. Apprenez les équipes, les atouts, les astuces et les appels Re/Kontra. Gratuit, sans compte.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Jouez à un jeu Doppelkopf local à quatre places. Suivez le costume mené ou l'atout lorsque vous le pouvez, trouvez l'équipe Re via les reines du club et essayez une annonce Re ou Kontra.","A quick example":"Un exemple rapide","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Dans une partie normale, les deux joueurs qui détiennent une reine de trèfle sont Re. Si un joueur possède les deux, un mariage commence : le premier autre joueur à remporter un pli parmi les trois premiers devient son partenaire.","How to play":"Comment jouer","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Le jeu distribue des cartes 48 : deux exemplaires de l'as, du dix, du roi, de la dame, du valet et du neuf dans chaque couleur. Chacun des quatre sièges reçoit des cartes 12. L'ordre Trump commence par le cœur dix, puis les dames et les valets dans l'ordre des couleurs, suivis des cartes carreau. Un pli est gagné par l'atout le plus élevé, ou par la carte la plus élevée de la couleur menée si aucun atout n'est joué. Le jeu a des yeux de carte 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","How many cards and players are there?":"Combien de cartes et de joueurs y a-t-il ?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf se joue ici avec quatre sièges et des cartes 48 : deux copies de chacune des faces des cartes 24. Chaque siège reçoit des cartes 12.","How are the teams found?":"Comment les équipes sont-elles trouvées ?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Dans une partie normale, les deux sièges détenant une reine de club forment Re ; les deux autres forment Kontra. Si un siège contient les deux reines du club, la règle du mariage trouve un partenaire lors des trois premiers tours.","What happens during a wedding?":"Que se passe-t-il lors d'un mariage ?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Le premier autre siège à remporter l'un des trois premiers tours rejoint Re. Si le siège du mariage remporte les trois, le jeu continue comme un solo de diamant à un joueur.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Quelle carte est l'atout le plus fort ?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Le cœur dix est le plus élevé. Les reines suivent dans l'ordre trèfle, pique, cœur, carreau, puis les valets dans le même ordre de couleur, puis l'as, le dix, le roi et le neuf carreau.","Must I follow suit?":"Dois-je emboîter le pas ?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Oui. Si une couleur autre que l'atout est menée, jouez cette couleur quand vous le pouvez. Si un atout est mené, jouez un atout quand vous le pouvez. Sinon, choisissez n'importe quelle carte.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Que signifient Re et Kontra ?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Ce sont les noms des deux équipes. Pendant la fenêtre d'ouverture autorisée, un joueur peut annoncer son équipe une fois. L'appel est visible et modifie le seuil de gain et les points de jeu.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Est-ce le règlement complet du tournoi ?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Non. Il s'agit d'une version pratique locale du jeu normal avec les appels Re/Kontra et la règle du mariage. Il laisse de côté les solos choisis avant le jeu, les refus, les pénalités du tournoi et de nombreuses règles maison.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Puis-je jouer avec trois amis en ligne ?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Non. Vos trois adversaires sont de simples joueurs informatiques locaux. Il n'y a pas de compte, de matchmaking ou de multijoueur en ligne.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Mon offre est-elle téléchargée ou enregistrée en ligne ?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Aucune donnée de jeu n'est téléchargée. Votre offre actuelle est enregistrée automatiquement dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil afin que vous puissiez la reprendre plus tard.","Rules and limitations":"Règles et limitations","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Il s'agit d'un jeu d'entraînement local décontracté, et non d'un jeu multijoueur en ligne, d'un jeu de hasard, d'un client de tournoi ou d'un solveur expert. Il utilise l'ordre normal des cartes de jeu DDV, les appels Re/Kontra et la résolution de mariage, mais n'implémente pas de solos sélectionnables, de refus tels que keine 90, de pénalités de tournoi, de toutes les règles de table spéciales ou de notation de tournoi certifiée. Les trois processeurs utilisent des heuristiques simples de mouvements légaux et peuvent prendre des décisions faibles.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Jeu gratuit. Les cartes et les scores restent dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil ; aucune donnée de jeu n'est téléchargée.","Play Doppelkopf":"Jouer à Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Outils associés","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Language":"Langue","UsefulVerse":"Verse utile","All tools":"Tous les outils","New deal":"Nouvelle offre","Resume saved deal":"Reprendre l'offre enregistrée","Delete saved deal":"Supprimer l'offre enregistrée","Choose New deal to begin.":"Choisissez Nouvelle offre pour commencer.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Démarrez une nouvelle donne ou reprenez votre partie sauvegardée.","You":"Vous","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Siège","Your hand":"Votre main","Current trick":"Astuce actuelle","Turn":"Tourner","Re eyes":"Re yeux","Kontra eyes":"Yeux Kontra","Re tricks":"Re astuces","Kontra tricks":"Astuces Kontra","Match points":"Points de match","Announce Re":"Annonce","Announce Kontra":"Annoncez Kontra","Play selected card":"Jouer la carte sélectionnée","Select a card":"Sélectionner une carte","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Contrat","Team not yet known":"Équipe pas encore connue","Trick table":"Tableau d'astuces","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Pique","Hearts":"Cœurs","Diamonds":"Diamants","Nine":"Neuf","Jack":"Prise","Queen":"Reine","King":"Très grand lit","Ten":"Dix","Ace":"As","second copy":"deuxième copie","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"À votre tour. Choisissez une carte légale.","A computer player is thinking…":"Un lecteur informatique pense…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nouvelle offre prête. Vous dirigez ce cycle d’entraînement.","Selected card":"Carte sélectionnée","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Ce jeu n'est pas légal. Faites de même ou l’emportez lorsque cela est possible.","Deal saved on this device.":"Offre enregistrée sur cet appareil.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"L'enregistrement local n'est pas disponible dans ce navigateur.","Saved deal resumed.":"L'accord enregistré a repris.","Saved deal deleted.":"Offre enregistrée supprimée.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"L'offre enregistrée n'a pas pu être lue. Supprimez-le et recommencez.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Mariage : le premier autre joueur à gagner en trois tours devient le partenaire.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Mariage résolu : le gagnant du tour est le partenaire.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Le joueur du mariage a remporté les trois premiers tours. L’affaire est désormais un solo de diamant.","Re announced.":"Ré-annoncé.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra annoncé.","Re wins the deal.":"Re remporte l'affaire.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra remporte l'affaire.","Final eyes":"Yeux finaux","Game points":"Points de jeu","Teams":"Équipes","Start another deal to play again.":"Démarrez une autre donne pour rejouer.","Rules reference":"Référence aux règles","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Association allemande Doppelkopf · Règles du tournoi, 21 février 2026","Card":"Carte","eyes":"yeux"},"gu":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf ઓનલાઇન — મફત લોકલ કાર્ડ ગેમ","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"ત્રણ સ્થાનિક કોમ્પ્યુટર ખેલાડીઓ સામે ચાર સીટની ડોપ્પેલકોપ પ્રેક્ટિસ ગેમ રમો. ટીમો, ટ્રમ્પ, યુક્તિઓ અને રી/કોન્ટ્રા કોલ્સ શીખો. મફત, કોઈ ખાતું નથી.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"સ્થાનિક ચાર-સીટની ડોપ્પેલકોપ ગેમ રમો. જ્યારે તમે કરી શકો ત્યારે લીડ સૂટ અથવા ટ્રમ્પને અનુસરો, ક્લબ ક્વીન્સ દ્વારા રે ટીમને શોધો અને રે અથવા કોન્ટ્રા જાહેરાતનો પ્રયાસ કરો.","A quick example":"એક ઝડપી ઉદાહરણ","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"સામાન્ય રમતમાં, જે બે ખેલાડીઓ ક્લબ ક્વીન ધરાવે છે તેઓ રે. જો એક ખેલાડી બંને ધરાવે છે, તો લગ્ન શરૂ થાય છે: પ્રથમ ત્રણમાં યુક્તિ જીતનાર પ્રથમ અન્ય ખેલાડી તેમનો ભાગીદાર બને છે.","How to play":"કેવી રીતે રમવું","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"ગેમ 48 કાર્ડનો સોદો કરે છે: દરેક પોશાકમાં ACE, દસ, રાજા, રાણી, જેક અને નવની બે નકલો. ચાર બેઠકોમાંથી દરેકને 12 કાર્ડ મળે છે. ટ્રમ્પ ઓર્ડર હાર્ટ ટેનથી શરૂ થાય છે, પછી રાણીઓ અને જેક્સ સૂટ ક્રમમાં, ત્યારબાદ ડાયમંડ કાર્ડ્સ આવે છે. યુક્તિ સર્વોચ્ચ ટ્રમ્પ દ્વારા જીતવામાં આવે છે, અથવા જો કોઈ ટ્રમ્પ રમવામાં ન આવે તો લીડ સૂટનું સૌથી વધુ કાર્ડ જીતવામાં આવે છે. રમતમાં 240 કાર્ડ આંખો છે.","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","How many cards and players are there?":"કેટલા કાર્ડ અને ખેલાડીઓ છે?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf અહીં ચાર સીટ અને 48 કાર્ડ્સ સાથે રમવામાં આવે છે: 24 કાર્ડના દરેક ચહેરાની બે નકલો. દરેક સીટ 12 કાર્ડ મેળવે છે.","How are the teams found?":"ટીમો કેવી રીતે મળી?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"સામાન્ય રમતમાં, ક્લબ ક્વીન ધરાવતી બે બેઠકો રે સ્વરૂપે છે; અન્ય બે ફોર્મ કોન્ટ્રા. જો એક સીટ બંને ક્લબ રાણીઓ ધરાવે છે, તો લગ્નનો નિયમ પ્રથમ ત્રણ યુક્તિઓ દરમિયાન ભાગીદાર શોધે છે.","What happens during a wedding?":"લગ્ન દરમિયાન શું થાય છે?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"પ્રથમ ત્રણ યુક્તિઓમાંથી એક જીતનાર પ્રથમ અન્ય સીટ રે સાથે જોડાય છે. જો લગ્નની બેઠક ત્રણેય જીતી જાય, તો રમત એક-ખેલાડી ડાયમંડ સોલો તરીકે ચાલુ રહે છે.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"કયું કાર્ડ સૌથી મજબૂત ટ્રમ્પ છે?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"હૃદય દસ સૌથી વધુ છે. ક્વીન્સ ક્લબ, સ્પેડ, હાર્ટ, હીરાના ક્રમમાં અનુસરે છે, પછી તે જ સૂટના ક્રમમાં જેક, પછી ડાયમંડ એસ, ટેન, કિંગ અને નવ.","Must I follow suit?":"શું મારે તેને અનુસરવું જોઈએ?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"હા. જો બિન-ટ્રમ્પ સૂટ દોરી જાય, તો જ્યારે તમે કરી શકો ત્યારે તે સૂટ રમો. જો ટ્રમ્પનું નેતૃત્વ કરવામાં આવે, તો જ્યારે તમે કરી શકો ત્યારે ટ્રમ્પ વગાડો. નહિંતર, કોઈપણ કાર્ડ પસંદ કરો.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"રે અને કોન્ટ્રાનો અર્થ શું છે?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"તે બે ટીમોના નામ છે. મંજૂર ઓપનિંગ વિન્ડો દરમિયાન, ખેલાડી તેમની ટીમની એકવાર જાહેરાત કરી શકે છે. કૉલ દૃશ્યમાન છે અને જીતની થ્રેશોલ્ડ અને ગેમ પોઈન્ટમાં ફેરફાર કરે છે.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"શું આ સંપૂર્ણ ટુર્નામેન્ટ નિયમો છે?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"નં. આ રે/કોન્ટ્રા કૉલ્સ અને લગ્નના નિયમ સાથે સામાન્ય રમતનું સ્થાનિક પ્રેક્ટિસ વર્ઝન છે. તે રમત પહેલા પસંદ કરેલા સોલો, ઇનકાર, ટુર્નામેન્ટ દંડ અને ઘરના ઘણા નિયમોને છોડી દે છે.","Can I play with three friends online?":"શું હું ત્રણ મિત્રો સાથે ઑનલાઇન રમી શકું?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"નં. તમારા ત્રણ વિરોધીઓ સરળ સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર ખેલાડીઓ છે. ત્યાં કોઈ એકાઉન્ટ, મેચમેકિંગ અથવા ઑનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર નથી.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"શું મારો સોદો ઓનલાઈન અપલોડ કે સાચવવામાં આવ્યો છે?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"કોઈ રમત ડેટા અપલોડ કરવામાં આવ્યો નથી. તમારો વર્તમાન સોદો આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં આપમેળે સાચવવામાં આવે છે જેથી તમે તેને પછીથી ફરી શરૂ કરી શકો.","Rules and limitations":"નિયમો અને મર્યાદાઓ","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"આ એક કેઝ્યુઅલ સ્થાનિક પ્રેક્ટિસ ગેમ છે, ઓનલાઈન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર, જુગાર, ટુર્નામેન્ટ ક્લાયન્ટ અથવા નિષ્ણાત સોલ્વર નથી. તે DDV નોર્મલ-ગેમ કાર્ડ ઓર્ડર, રી/કોન્ટ્રા કૉલ્સ અને વેડિંગ રિઝોલ્યુશનનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે, પરંતુ પસંદ કરી શકાય તેવા સોલો, ઇનકાર જેમ કે કીન 90, ટુર્નામેન્ટ પેનલ્ટી, તમામ વિશેષ ટેબલ નિયમો અથવા પ્રમાણિત ટુર્નામેન્ટ સ્કોરિંગનો અમલ કરતું નથી. ત્રણ સીપીયુ સરળ કાનૂની-મૂવ હ્યુરિસ્ટિક્સનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે અને નબળા નિર્ણયો લઈ શકે છે.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"રમવા માટે મફત. કાર્ડ્સ અને સ્કોર્સ આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે; કોઈ રમત ડેટા અપલોડ કરવામાં આવ્યો નથી.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf રમો","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Language":"ભાષા","UsefulVerse":"ઉપયોગી પદ્ય","All tools":"તમામ સાધનો","New deal":"નવી ડીલ","Resume saved deal":"સેવ કરેલ ડીલ ફરી શરૂ કરો","Delete saved deal":"સાચવેલ સોદો કાઢી નાખો","Choose New deal to begin.":"શરૂ કરવા માટે નવો સોદો પસંદ કરો.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"નવો સોદો શરૂ કરો અથવા તમારી સાચવેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ કરો.","You":"તમે","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"સીટ","Your hand":"તમારો હાથ","Current trick":"વર્તમાન યુક્તિ","Turn":"ટર્ન","Re eyes":"રી આંખો","Kontra eyes":"કોન્ત્રા આંખો","Re tricks":"રી યુક્તિઓ","Kontra tricks":"કોન્ટ્રા યુક્તિઓ","Match points":"મેચ પોઈન્ટ","Announce Re":"પુનઃ જાહેરાત કરો","Announce Kontra":"કોન્ટ્રાની જાહેરાત કરો","Play selected card":"પસંદ કરેલ કાર્ડ રમો","Select a card":"કાર્ડ પસંદ કરો","Re":"રી","Kontra":"કોન્ત્રા","Team not yet known":"ટીમ હજુ સુધી જાણીતી નથી","Trick table":"ટ્રીક ટેબલ","Clubs":"ક્લબ્સ","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"હાર્ટ્સ","Diamonds":"હીરા","Nine":"નવ","Jack":"જેક","Queen":"ક્વીન","King":"કિંગ","Ten":"દસ","Ace":"એસ","second copy":"સેકન્ડ કોપી","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"તમારો વારો. કાનૂની કાર્ડ પસંદ કરો.","A computer player is thinking…":"કોમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર વિચારી રહ્યો છે…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"નવી ડીલ તૈયાર. તમે આ પ્રેક્ટિસ રાઉન્ડનું નેતૃત્વ કરો છો.","Selected card":"પસંદ કરેલ કાર્ડ","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"તે નાટક કાયદેસર નથી. જ્યારે શક્ય હોય ત્યારે દાવો અથવા ટ્રમ્પને અનુસરો.","Deal saved on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર ડીલ સાચવવામાં આવી છે.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"સ્થાનિક બચત આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં અનુપલબ્ધ છે.","Saved deal resumed.":"સાચવેલ સોદો ફરી શરૂ થયો.","Saved deal deleted.":"સાચવેલ સોદો કાઢી નાખ્યો.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"સાચવેલ સોદો વાંચી શકાયો નથી. તેને કાઢી નાખો અને ફરી શરૂ કરો.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"વેડિંગ: ત્રણ યુક્તિઓમાં જીતનાર પ્રથમ અન્ય ખેલાડી ભાગીદાર બને છે.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"લગ્ન ઉકેલાઈ ગયા: યુક્તિ વિજેતા ભાગીદાર છે.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"લગ્ન ખેલાડીએ પ્રથમ ત્રણ યુક્તિઓ જીતી. આ સોદો હવે ડાયમંડ સોલો છે.","Re announced.":"ફરી જાહેરાત.","Kontra announced.":"કોન્ત્રાએ જાહેરાત કરી.","Re wins the deal.":"Re એ સોદો જીત્યો.","Kontra wins the deal.":"કોન્ત્રા ડીલ જીતે છે.","Final eyes":"અંતિમ આંખો","Game points":"ગેમ પોઈન્ટ","Teams":"ટીમો","Start another deal to play again.":"ફરીથી રમવા માટે બીજી ડીલ શરૂ કરો.","Rules reference":"નિયમો સંદર્ભ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"જર્મન ડોપ્પેલકોપ એસોસિયેશન · ટુર્નામેન્ટ નિયમો, 21 ફેબ્રુઆરી 2026","Card":"કાર્ડ","eyes":"આંખો"},"ha":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online - Wasan Katin Gida Kyauta","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Yi wasan motsa jiki na kujeru huɗu Doppelkopf da 'yan wasan kwamfuta na gida uku. Koyi ƙungiyoyi, trumps, dabaru da Sake kira na Kontra. Kyauta, babu asusu.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Yi wasan Doppelkopf mai kujeru huɗu na gida. Bi jagorar kwat da wando ko trump lokacin da za ku iya, nemo ƙungiyar Re ta cikin sarauniyar kulab, kuma gwada sanarwar Re ko Kontra.","A quick example":"Misali mai sauri","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"A wasa na yau da kullun, 'yan wasan biyu da ke rike da sarauniyar kulob sune Re. Idan dan wasa daya ya rike duka biyun, bikin aure zai fara: dan wasa na farko da ya ci dabara a cikin ukun farko ya zama abokin tarayya.","How to play":"Yadda ake wasa","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Wasan yana ba da katunan 48: kwafi biyu na ace, goma, sarki, sarauniya, jack da tara a cikin kowane kwat da wando. Kowane kujeru huɗu yana samun katunan 12. Umurnin Trump yana farawa da zuciya goma, sannan sarauniya da jacks a cikin tsari, sannan katunan lu'u-lu'u. Dabarar tana samun nasara ta babban ƙaho, ko mafi girman kati na kwat da wando idan ba a buga trump ba. Wasan yana da idanun katin 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","How many cards and players are there?":"Katuna nawa da 'yan wasa ke akwai?\nAna buga","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf a nan tare da kujeru hudu da katunan 48: kwafi biyu na kowane fuskokin katin 24. Kowane wurin zama yana karɓar katunan 12.","How are the teams found?":"Yaya ake samun ƙungiyoyin?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"A cikin wasa na yau da kullun, kujeru biyu masu rike da sarauniyar kulab din Re; sauran biyun sun zama Kontra. Idan wurin zama ɗaya yana riƙe da sarauniyar kulab biyu, dokar bikin aure ta sami abokin tarayya a lokacin dabaru uku na farko.","What happens during a wedding?":"Me ke faruwa yayin bikin aure?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Wata kujera ta farko da ta ci ɗaya daga cikin dabaru uku na farko ya shiga Re. Idan kujerar bikin aure ta yi nasara duka ukun, wasan yana ci gaba da zama solo na lu'u-lu'u mai dan wasa daya.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Wanne kati ne mafi ƙarfi?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Zuciya goma ita ce mafi girma. Queens suna bin kulob, spade, zuciya, odar lu'u-lu'u, sannan jacks a cikin tsari iri ɗaya, sai lu'u-lu'u ace, goma, sarki da tara.","Must I follow suit?":"Dole ne in bi?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ee. Idan an jagoranci rigar da ba trump ba, kunna wannan kwat ɗin lokacin da za ku iya. Idan aka jagoranci trump, kunna trump lokacin da za ku iya. In ba haka ba, zaɓi kowane kati.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Me ake nufi da Re da Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Su ne sunayen ƙungiyoyin biyu. A lokacin da aka yarda taga taga, dan wasa zai iya sanar da tawagar su sau daya. Kiran yana bayyane kuma yana canza madaidaicin nasara da maki game.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Shin wannan shine cikakken ka'idojin gasar?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"No. Wannan sigar al'ada ce ta gida ta wasa ta al'ada tare da kiran Re/Kontra da ka'idar bikin aure. Yana barin solos ɗin da aka zaɓa kafin wasa, ƙi, hukuncin gasa da dokokin gida da yawa.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Zan iya yin wasa da abokai uku akan layi?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"A'a. Abokan adawar ku guda uku 'yan wasan kwamfuta ne masu sauƙi. Babu asusu, daidaitawa ko masu wasa da yawa akan layi.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"An ɗora wa yarjejeniyar tawa ko adanawa akan layi?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Babu bayanan wasan da aka ɗora. Ana ajiye cinikin ku na yanzu ta atomatik a cikin wannan mazuruftan na'urar don ku iya ci gaba da ita daga baya.","Rules and limitations":"Dokoki da iyakancewa","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Wannan wasan motsa jiki ne na gida na yau da kullun, ba masu wasa da yawa na kan layi ba, caca, abokin ciniki gasa ko ƙwararren mai warwarewa. Yana amfani da odar katin wasa na al'ada na DDV, kiran Re/Kontra da ƙudurin bikin aure, amma baya aiwatar da zaɓaɓɓun solos, ƙin yarda kamar keine 90, hukunce-hukuncen gasar, duk ƙa'idodin tebur na musamman ko ƙwararrun ƙwallon ƙafa. CPUs guda uku suna amfani da ilimin motsa jiki mai sauƙi na doka kuma suna iya yanke shawara mara ƙarfi.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kyauta don yin wasa. Katuna da maki suna tsayawa a cikin wannan mai binciken akan wannan na'urar; ba a ɗora bayanan wasan ba.","Play Doppelkopf":"Kunna Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · Yana Gudu A CIKIN browsing","Language":"Harshe","UsefulVerse":"Verse Mai Amfani","All tools":"Duk kayan aikin","New deal":"Sabuwar yarjejeniya","Resume saved deal":"Ci gaba da ajiyar ciniki","Delete saved deal":"Share cinikin da aka adana","Choose New deal to begin.":"Zaɓi Sabuwar yarjejeniya don farawa.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Fara sabuwar yarjejeniya ko ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye.","You":"Ku","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Wurin zama","Your hand":"Hannun ku","Current trick":"Dabarar yanzu","Turn":"Juya","Re eyes":"Re idanu","Kontra eyes":"Kontra idanu","Re tricks":"Re dabaru","Kontra tricks":"Dabarun Kontra","Match points":"Matsalar daidaitawa","Announce Re":"Sanarwa Re","Announce Kontra":"Sanar da Kontra","Play selected card":"Kunna zaɓin katin","Select a card":"Zaɓi kati","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Har yanzu ba a san ƙungiyar ba","Trick table":"Tebur dabara","Clubs":"Kungiyoyi","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"Zukatai","Diamonds":"Diamonds","Nine":"Tara","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Sarauniya","King":"Sarki","Ten":"Goma","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"kwafi na biyu","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Juyin ku. Zaɓi katin doka.","A computer player is thinking…":"Mai kunna kwamfuta yana tunanin…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Sabuwar yarjejeniya tana shirye. Kuna jagorantar wannan aikin zagaye.","Selected card":"Katin da aka zaɓa","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Wannan wasan bai halatta ba. Bi kwatance ko trump idan zai yiwu.","Deal saved on this device.":"Ajiye ciniki akan wannan na'urar.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Babu ajiyar gida a cikin wannan mazugi.","Saved deal resumed.":"An ci gaba da ciniki.","Saved deal deleted.":"An share yarjejeniyar da aka adana.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Ba a iya karanta yarjejeniyar da aka adana ba. Share shi kuma sake farawa.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Bikin aure: ɗan wasa na farko da ya ci nasara a cikin dabaru uku ya zama abokin tarayya.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Bikin aure ya warware: wanda ya ci nasara shine abokin tarayya.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Dan wasan bikin ya lashe dabaru uku na farko. Yarjejeniyar yanzu ita ce lu'u-lu'u solo.","Re announced.":"Sake sanar.\nAn sanar da","Kontra announced.":"Kontra.","Re wins the deal.":"Sake lashe yarjejeniyar.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra ya sami nasarar cinikin.","Final eyes":"Idanun ƙarshe","Game points":"Makin Wasanni","Teams":"Kungiyoyi","Start another deal to play again.":"Fara wata yarjejeniya don sake kunnawa.","Rules reference":"Ma'anar Dokokin","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Ƙungiyar Doppelkopf ta Jamus · Dokokin Gasar, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"Katin","eyes":"idanu"},"hi":{"Doppelkopf":"डोपेलकोफ","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf ऑनलाइन — निःशुल्क स्थानीय कार्ड गेम","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"तीन स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ियों के खिलाफ चार सीटों वाला डोपेलकोफ अभ्यास गेम खेलें। टीमें, ट्रम्प, ट्रिक्स और रे/कॉन्ट्रा कॉल सीखें। मुफ़्त, कोई खाता नहीं.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"स्थानीय चार सीटों वाला डोपेलकोफ गेम खेलें। जब संभव हो तो एलईडी सूट या ट्रम्प का अनुसरण करें, क्लब क्वीन्स के माध्यम से रे टीम ढूंढें, और रे या कॉन्ट्रा घोषणा का प्रयास करें।","A quick example":"एक त्वरित उदाहरण","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"एक सामान्य खेल में, क्लब क्वीन रखने वाले दो खिलाड़ी एक रुपये के होते हैं। यदि एक खिलाड़ी दोनों को पकड़ लेता है, तो शादी शुरू हो जाती है: पहले तीन में ट्रिक जीतने वाला पहला अन्य खिलाड़ी उनका साथी बन जाता है।","How to play":"कैसे खेलें","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"गेम 48 कार्ड प्रदान करता है: प्रत्येक सूट में इक्का, दस, किंग, क्वीन, जैक और नौ की दो प्रतियां। चार सीटों में से प्रत्येक में 12 कार्ड मिलते हैं। ट्रम्प का ऑर्डर हार्ट टेन से शुरू होता है, फिर क्वीन्स और जैक सूट ऑर्डर में, उसके बाद डायमंड कार्ड। यदि कोई ट्रम्प नहीं खेला जाता है तो एक ट्रिक उच्चतम ट्रम्प, या एलईडी सूट के उच्चतम कार्ड द्वारा जीती जाती है। गेम में 240 कार्ड आंखें हैं।","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","How many cards and players are there?":"कितने कार्ड और खिलाड़ी हैं?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf यहां चार सीटों और 48 कार्डों के साथ खेला जाता है: प्रत्येक 24 कार्ड चेहरों की दो प्रतियां। प्रत्येक सीट पर 12 कार्ड प्राप्त होते हैं।","How are the teams found?":"टीमें कैसे पाई जाती हैं?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"एक सामान्य गेम में, क्लब क्वीन वाली दो सीटें Re का निर्माण करती हैं; अन्य दो कॉन्ट्रा का निर्माण करते हैं। यदि एक सीट पर दोनों क्लब रानियाँ बैठती हैं, तो विवाह नियम के अनुसार पहली तीन चालों के दौरान एक साथी मिल जाता है।","What happens during a wedding?":"शादी के दौरान क्या होता है?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"पहली तीन चालों में से एक जीतने वाली पहली अन्य सीट पुनः जुड़ती है। यदि विवाह की सीट तीनों जीत जाती है, तो खेल एक-खिलाड़ी डायमंड सोलो के रूप में जारी रहता है।","Which card is the strongest trump?":"कौन सा कार्ड सबसे मजबूत ट्रम्प है?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"हृदय दस सबसे ऊंचा है। रानियाँ क्लब, स्पैड, हार्ट, डायमंड क्रम में अनुसरण करती हैं, फिर जैक उसी सूट क्रम में, फिर डायमंड इक्का, दस, किंग और नौ।","Must I follow suit?":"क्या मुझे इसका अनुसरण करना चाहिए?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"हाँ। यदि एक गैर-ट्रम्प सूट का नेतृत्व किया जाता है, तो जब भी संभव हो उस सूट को बजाएं। यदि ट्रम्प का नेतृत्व किया जा रहा है, तो जब भी संभव हो ट्रम्प बजाएँ। अन्यथा, कोई भी कार्ड चुनें.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"रे और कॉन्ट्रा का क्या मतलब है?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"ये दोनों टीमों के नाम हैं। स्वीकृत ओपनिंग विंडो के दौरान, एक खिलाड़ी एक बार अपनी टीम की घोषणा कर सकता है। कॉल दृश्यमान है और जीत सीमा और गेम पॉइंट को बदल देती है।","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"क्या यह पूर्ण टूर्नामेंट नियम है?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"नहीं। यह रे/कॉन्ट्रा कॉल और विवाह नियम के साथ सामान्य खेल का एक स्थानीय अभ्यास संस्करण है। इसमें खेल से पहले चुने गए एकल, इनकार, टूर्नामेंट दंड और कई घरेलू नियम शामिल नहीं हैं।","Can I play with three friends online?":"क्या मैं तीन दोस्तों के साथ ऑनलाइन खेल सकता हूँ?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"नहीं। आपके तीन प्रतिद्वंद्वी साधारण स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ी हैं। कोई खाता, मंगनी या ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर नहीं है।","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"क्या मेरा सौदा ऑनलाइन अपलोड या सहेजा गया है?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"कोई गेम डेटा अपलोड नहीं किया गया है। आपका वर्तमान सौदा इस डिवाइस के ब्राउज़र में स्वचालित रूप से सहेजा गया है ताकि आप इसे बाद में फिर से शुरू कर सकें।","Rules and limitations":"नियम और सीमाएँ","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"यह एक कैज़ुअल स्थानीय अभ्यास गेम है, न कि ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर, जुआ, टूर्नामेंट क्लाइंट या विशेषज्ञ सॉल्वर। यह डीडीवी सामान्य-गेम कार्ड ऑर्डर, रे/कॉन्ट्रा कॉल और विवाह रिज़ॉल्यूशन का उपयोग करता है, लेकिन चयन योग्य सोलो, कीन 90, टूर्नामेंट दंड, सभी विशेष टेबल नियम या प्रमाणित टूर्नामेंट स्कोरिंग जैसे रिफ्यूज़ल को लागू नहीं करता है। तीन सीपीयू सरल कानूनी-चाल अनुमान का उपयोग करते हैं और कमजोर निर्णय ले सकते हैं।","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"खेलने के लिए निःशुल्क। कार्ड और स्कोर इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में रहते हैं; कोई गेम डेटा अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Play Doppelkopf":"डोपेलकोफ खेलें","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी श्लोक","All tools":"सभी उपकरण","New deal":"नई डील","Resume saved deal":"सहेजी गई डील फिर से शुरू करें","Delete saved deal":"सहेजी गई डील हटाएं","Choose New deal to begin.":"शुरू करने के लिए नई डील चुनें।","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"एक नया सौदा शुरू करें या अपना सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू करें।","You":"आप","CPU":"सीपीयू","Seat":"सीट","Your hand":"आपका हाथ","Current trick":"वर्तमान चाल","Turn":"बारी","Re eyes":"रे आँखें","Kontra eyes":"कॉन्ट्रा आँखें","Re tricks":"रे ट्रिक्स","Kontra tricks":"कॉन्ट्रा ट्रिक्स","Match points":"मैच अंक","Announce Re":"पुनः घोषणा करें","Announce Kontra":"कॉन्ट्रा की घोषणा करें","Play selected card":"चयनित कार्ड चलायें","Select a card":"एक कार्ड चुनें","Re":"रे","Kontra":"कॉन्ट्रा","Team not yet known":"टीम अभी ज्ञात नहीं है","Trick table":"ट्रिक टेबल","Clubs":"क्लब","Spades":"हुकुम","Hearts":"दिल","Diamonds":"हीरे","Nine":"नौ","Jack":"जैक","Queen":"रानी","King":"राजा","Ten":"दस","Ace":"ऐस","second copy":"दूसरी प्रति","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"आपकी बारी। एक कानूनी कार्ड चुनें.","A computer player is thinking…":"एक कंप्यूटर प्लेयर सोच रहा है...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"नई डील तैयार। आप इस अभ्यास दौर का नेतृत्व करें।","Selected card":"चयनित कार्ड","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"वह नाटक कानूनी नहीं है। जब संभव हो तो सूट या ट्रम्प का अनुसरण करें।","Deal saved on this device.":"इस डिवाइस पर डील सेव हो गई।","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"इस ब्राउज़र में स्थानीय बचत उपलब्ध नहीं है।","Saved deal resumed.":"सहेजा गया सौदा फिर से शुरू हुआ।","Saved deal deleted.":"सहेजा गया सौदा हटा दिया गया।","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"सहेजा गया सौदा पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। इसे हटाएं और फिर से प्रारंभ करें.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"शादी: तीन चालों के भीतर जीतने वाला पहला अन्य खिलाड़ी भागीदार बन जाता है।","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"शादी सुलझ गई: ट्रिक विजेता भागीदार है।","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"शादी के खिलाड़ी ने पहली तीन चालें जीतीं। यह डील अब डायमंड सोलो है।","Re announced.":"पुनः घोषणा की गई।","Kontra announced.":"कॉन्ट्रा ने घोषणा की।","Re wins the deal.":"Re ने सौदा जीता।","Kontra wins the deal.":"कॉन्ट्रा ने सौदा जीता।","Final eyes":"अंतिम आंखें","Game points":"गेम पॉइंट","Teams":"टीमें","Start another deal to play again.":"फिर से खेलने के लिए एक और डील शुरू करें।","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"जर्मन डोपेलकोफ एसोसिएशन · टूर्नामेंट नियम, 21 फरवरी 2026","Card":"कार्ड","eyes":"आँखें"},"id":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Permainan Kartu Lokal Gratis","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Mainkan permainan latihan Doppelkopf empat kursi melawan tiga pemain komputer lokal. Pelajari tim, kartu truf, trik, dan panggilan Re/Kontra. Gratis, tanpa akun.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Mainkan permainan Doppelkopf empat kursi lokal. Ikuti setelan yang dipimpin atau truf bila Anda bisa, temukan tim Re melalui ratu klub, dan coba pengumuman Re atau Kontra.","A quick example":"Contoh singkat","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Dalam permainan normal, dua pemain yang memegang ratu klub adalah Re. Jika salah satu pemain memegang keduanya, pernikahan dimulai: pemain lain pertama yang memenangkan trik di tiga trik pertama menjadi pasangannya.","How to play":"Cara bermain","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Permainan ini memberikan kartu 48: dua salinan kartu as, sepuluh, raja, ratu, jack, dan sembilan di setiap jenis. Masing-masing dari empat kursi mendapat kartu 12. Urutan Trump dimulai dengan hati sepuluh, kemudian ratu dan jack dalam urutan jas, diikuti dengan kartu berlian. Sebuah trik dimenangkan oleh kartu truf tertinggi, atau kartu tertinggi dari jenis yang dipimpin jika tidak ada kartu truf yang dimainkan. Permainan ini memiliki mata kartu 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","How many cards and players are there?":"Ada berapa kartu dan pemain?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf dimainkan di sini dengan empat kursi dan kartu 48: dua salinan dari masing-masing permukaan kartu 24. Setiap kursi menerima kartu 12.","How are the teams found?":"Bagaimana tim ditemukan?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Dalam permainan normal, dua kursi yang menampung ratu klub membentuk Re; dua lainnya membentuk Kontra. Jika satu kursi menampung kedua ratu klub, aturan pernikahan menemukan pasangan selama tiga trik pertama.","What happens during a wedding?":"Apa yang terjadi saat pernikahan?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Kursi pertama yang memenangkan salah satu dari tiga trik pertama bergabung dengan Re. Jika kursi pernikahan memenangkan ketiganya, permainan dilanjutkan sebagai solo berlian satu pemain.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Kartu manakah yang merupakan kartu truf terkuat?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Sepuluh hati adalah yang tertinggi. Ratu mengikuti urutan tongkat, sekop, hati, berlian, lalu jack dengan urutan setelan yang sama, lalu kartu as berlian, sepuluh, raja, dan sembilan.","Must I follow suit?":"Haruskah saya mengikutinya?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ya. Jika setelan non-truf dipilih, mainkan setelan itu kapan pun Anda bisa. Jika truf dipimpin, mainkan truf bila Anda bisa. Jika tidak, pilih kartu apa saja.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan Re dan Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Itulah nama kedua tim. Selama jendela pembukaan yang diizinkan, pemain dapat mengumumkan timnya satu kali. Panggilan tersebut terlihat dan mengubah ambang kemenangan dan poin permainan.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Apakah ini aturan turnamen selengkapnya?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Tidak. Ini adalah versi latihan lokal dari permainan normal dengan panggilan Re/Kontra dan aturan pernikahan. Itu tidak termasuk solo yang dipilih sebelum bermain, penolakan, penalti turnamen, dan banyak peraturan rumah.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Bisakah saya bermain dengan tiga teman secara online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Tidak. Ketiga lawan Anda adalah pemain komputer lokal sederhana. Tidak ada akun, perjodohan, atau multipemain online.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Apakah transaksi saya diunggah atau disimpan secara online?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Tidak ada data game yang diunggah. Transaksi Anda saat ini disimpan secara otomatis di browser pada perangkat ini sehingga Anda dapat melanjutkannya nanti.","Rules and limitations":"Aturan dan batasan","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Ini adalah permainan latihan lokal kasual, bukan multipemain daring, perjudian, klien turnamen, atau pemecah ahli. Ini menggunakan urutan kartu permainan normal DDV, panggilan Re/Kontra dan resolusi pernikahan, tetapi tidak menerapkan solo yang dapat dipilih, penolakan seperti keine 90, penalti turnamen, semua aturan meja khusus atau skor turnamen bersertifikat. Ketiga CPU tersebut menggunakan heuristik pergerakan hukum yang sederhana dan mungkin membuat keputusan yang lemah.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis dimainkan. Kartu dan skor tetap berada di browser pada perangkat ini; tidak ada data game yang diunggah.","Play Doppelkopf":"Mainkan Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Alat terkait","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alat","New deal":"Kesepakatan baru","Resume saved deal":"Lanjutkan kesepakatan yang disimpan","Delete saved deal":"Hapus kesepakatan tersimpan","Choose New deal to begin.":"Pilih Kesepakatan baru untuk memulai.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Mulai kesepakatan baru atau lanjutkan permainan simpanan Anda.","You":"Kamu","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Kursi","Your hand":"Tanganmu","Current trick":"Trik kekinian","Turn":"Putar","Re eyes":"Re mata","Kontra eyes":"Mata kontra","Re tricks":"Re trik","Kontra tricks":"Trik kontra","Match points":"Poin pertandingan","Announce Re":"Umumkan Re","Announce Kontra":"Umumkan Kontra","Play selected card":"Mainkan kartu yang dipilih","Select a card":"Pilih kartu","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Tim belum diketahui","Trick table":"Meja trik","Clubs":"Klub","Spades":"Sekop","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Nine":"Sembilan","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Ratu","King":"Raja","Ten":"Sepuluh","Ace":"As","second copy":"salinan kedua","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Giliran Anda. Pilih kartu resmi.","A computer player is thinking…":"Seorang pemain komputer sedang berpikir…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Kesepakatan baru siap. Anda memimpin putaran latihan ini.","Selected card":"Kartu yang dipilih","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Permainan itu tidak sah. Ikuti atau truf jika memungkinkan.","Deal saved on this device.":"Penawaran disimpan di perangkat ini.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Penyimpanan lokal tidak tersedia di browser ini.","Saved deal resumed.":"Kesepakatan tersimpan dilanjutkan.","Saved deal deleted.":"Kesepakatan tersimpan dihapus.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Kesepakatan yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Hapus dan mulai lagi.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Pernikahan: pemain pertama yang menang dalam tiga trik menjadi partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Pernikahan terselesaikan: pemenang trik adalah pasangannya.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Pemain pernikahan memenangkan tiga trik pertama. Kesepakatannya sekarang menjadi berlian solo.","Re announced.":"Diumumkan kembali.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra diumumkan.","Re wins the deal.":"Re memenangkan kesepakatan.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra memenangkan kesepakatan.","Final eyes":"Mata terakhir","Game points":"Poin permainan","Teams":"Tim","Start another deal to play again.":"Mulai kesepakatan lain untuk bermain lagi.","Rules reference":"Referensi aturan","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Asosiasi Doppelkopf Jerman · Peraturan Turnamen, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"Kartu","eyes":"mata"},"it":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Gioco di carte locale gratuito","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Gioca a una partita di allenamento Doppelkopf a quattro posti contro tre giocatori del computer locale. Impara squadre, briscole, trucchi e chiamate Re/Kontra. Gratuito, nessun account.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Gioca a un gioco Doppelkopf locale a quattro posti. Segui il seme principale o la briscola quando puoi, trova la squadra Re attraverso le regine dei fiori e prova un annuncio Re o Kontra.","A quick example":"Un rapido esempio","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"In una partita normale, i due giocatori che hanno in mano una Donna di fiori sono Re. Se un giocatore le possiede entrambe, inizia un matrimonio: il primo altro giocatore a vincere una presa nelle prime tre diventa il suo partner.","How to play":"Come si gioca","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Il gioco distribuisce le carte 48: due copie di asso, dieci, re, regina, fante e nove in ciascun seme. Ciascuno dei quattro posti riceve le carte 12. L'ordine di Trump inizia con il dieci di cuori, poi le regine e i jack in ordine di seme, seguiti dalle carte di quadri. Una presa viene vinta dalla briscola più alta o dalla carta più alta del seme principale se non viene giocata alcuna briscola. Il gioco ha gli occhi delle carte 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","How many cards and players are there?":"Quante carte e giocatori ci sono?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf qui si gioca con quattro posti e carte 48: due copie di ciascuna faccia delle carte 24. Ogni posto riceve carte 12.","How are the teams found?":"Come vengono trovate le squadre?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"In un gioco normale, i due posti che tengono una regina di fiori formano Re; gli altri due formano Kontra. Se un posto occupa entrambe le regine di fiori, la regola del matrimonio trova un partner durante le prime tre prese.","What happens during a wedding?":"Cosa succede durante un matrimonio?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Il primo altro posto a vincere una delle prime tre prese si unisce a Re. Se il posto nuziale vince tutti e tre, il gioco continua come un solitario diamante per un giocatore.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Quale carta è la briscola più forte?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Il dieci a cuori è il più alto. Seguono le regine in ordine di fiori, picche, cuori, quadri, poi i jack nello stesso ordine dei semi, poi l'asso di quadri, il dieci, il re e il nove.","Must I follow suit?":"Devo seguire l'esempio?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Sì. Se viene aperto un seme non di briscola, gioca quel seme quando puoi. Se viene guidata una briscola, giocala quando puoi. Altrimenti, scegli una carta qualsiasi.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Cosa significano Re e Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Sono i nomi delle due squadre. Durante la finestra di apertura consentita, un giocatore può annunciare la propria squadra una volta. La chiamata è visibile e modifica la soglia di vincita e i punti di gioco.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Questo è il regolamento completo del torneo?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"N. Questa è una versione pratica locale del gioco normale con chiamate Re/Kontra e la regola del matrimonio. Tralascia gli assoli scelti prima del gioco, i rifiuti, le penalità del torneo e molte regole della casa.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Posso giocare online con tre amici?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"N. I tuoi tre avversari sono semplici giocatori del computer locale. Non sono presenti account, matchmaking o multiplayer online.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"La mia offerta è caricata o salvata online?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Nessun dato di gioco caricato. La tua offerta attuale viene salvata automaticamente nel browser di questo dispositivo in modo che tu possa riprenderla in seguito.","Rules and limitations":"Regole e limitazioni","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Questo è un gioco di pratica locale casuale, non multiplayer online, giochi d'azzardo, un client di torneo o un risolutore esperto. Utilizza l'ordine delle carte del gioco normale DDV, le chiamate Re/Kontra e la risoluzione del matrimonio, ma non implementa assoli selezionabili, rifiuti come keine 90, penalità di torneo, tutte le regole speciali del tavolo o punteggio di torneo certificato. Le tre CPU utilizzano semplici euristiche di mossa legale e possono prendere decisioni deboli.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Giocare gratuitamente. Le carte e i punteggi rimangono in questo browser su questo dispositivo; non vengono caricati dati di gioco.","Play Doppelkopf":"Gioca a Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Language":"Lingua","UsefulVerse":"UtileVersetto","All tools":"Tutti gli strumenti","New deal":"Nuovo affare","Resume saved deal":"Riprendi l'offerta salvata","Delete saved deal":"Elimina offerta salvata","Choose New deal to begin.":"Scegli Nuovo affare per iniziare.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Inizia una nuova partita o riprendi la partita salvata.","You":"Tu","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Sedile","Your hand":"La tua mano","Current trick":"Trucco attuale","Turn":"Gira","Re eyes":"Re occhi","Kontra eyes":"Occhi Kontra","Re tricks":"Ri trucchi","Kontra tricks":"Trucchi Kontra","Match points":"Punti di corrispondenza","Announce Re":"Annuncia Re","Announce Kontra":"Annuncia Kontra","Play selected card":"Gioca la carta selezionata","Select a card":"Seleziona una carta","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Contra","Team not yet known":"Squadra non ancora conosciuta","Trick table":"Tavolo dei trucchi","Clubs":"Club","Spades":"Picche","Hearts":"Cuori","Diamonds":"Diamanti","Nine":"Nove","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Regina","King":"Re","Ten":"Dieci","Ace":"Asso","second copy":"seconda copia","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"È il tuo turno. Scegli una carta legale.","A computer player is thinking…":"Un giocatore di computer sta pensando...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nuovo affare pronto. Conduci tu questa pratica.","Selected card":"Carta selezionata","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Quel gioco non è legale. Segui l'esempio o trionfa quando possibile.","Deal saved on this device.":"Offerta salvata su questo dispositivo.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Il salvataggio locale non è disponibile in questo browser.","Saved deal resumed.":"Offerta salvata ripresa.","Saved deal deleted.":"Offerta salvata eliminata.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Impossibile leggere l'offerta salvata. Eliminalo e ricomincia.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Matrimonio: il primo altro giocatore a vincere entro tre prese diventa il partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Matrimonio risolto: il vincitore del trucco è il partner.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Il giocatore del matrimonio ha vinto le prime tre prese. L'accordo ora è un assolo di diamanti.","Re announced.":"Ri annunciato.","Kontra announced.":"Annunciato Kontra.","Re wins the deal.":"Re vince l'affare.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra vince l'affare.","Final eyes":"Occhi finali","Game points":"Punti del gioco","Teams":"Squadre","Start another deal to play again.":"Inizia un altro accordo per giocare di nuovo.","Rules reference":"Riferimento alle regole","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Associazione tedesca Doppelkopf · Regolamento del torneo, 21 feb 2026","Card":"Scheda","eyes":"occhi"},"ja":{"Doppelkopf":"ドッペルコップフ","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"ドッペルコップ オンライン — 無料のローカル カード ゲーム","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"4 人乗りのドッペルコップフ練習ゲームを 3 人のローカル コンピューター プレーヤーと対戦します。チーム、トランプ、トリック、Re/Kontra コールを学びましょう。無料、アカウントなし。","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"ローカルの 4 人乗りのドッペルコップ ゲームをプレイします。可能な場合は、導かれたスーツまたはトランプに従い、クラブのクイーンを通じて Re チームを見つけて、Re または Kontra のアナウンスを試してください。","A quick example":"簡単な例","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"通常のゲームでは、クラブの女王を保持している 2 人のプレーヤーは Re です。 1 人のプレイヤーが両方を保持している場合、結婚式が始まります。最初の 3 つでトリックを獲得した最初の他のプレイヤーがパートナーになります。","How to play":"遊び方","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"ゲームでは 48 カードが配られます。エース、テン、キング、クイーン、ジャック、各スートに 9 枚のコピーが 2 枚ずつあります。 4 つの座席にはそれぞれ 12 カードが割り当てられます。トランプの順番はハートの 10 から始まり、スーツの順にクイーンとジャック、そしてダイヤモンドのカードが続きます。トリックは最も高いトランプ、またはトランプがプレイされなかった場合はリードされたスートの最も高いカードによって勝ちとなります。ゲームには240のカードアイがあります。","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","How many cards and players are there?":"カードとプレイヤーは何枚ありますか?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"ドッペルコップフは、ここでは 4 つのシートと 48 カード (24 カード面の各 2 枚) でプレイされます。各座席には 12 カードが配られます。","How are the teams found?":"チームはどのようにして見つけられますか?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"通常のゲームでは、クラブ女王を保持する 2 つの席が Re を形成します。残りの2人はコントラを形成します。 1 つの席に両方のクラブ クイーンが座っている場合、結婚式のルールにより、最初の 3 つのトリックの間にパートナーが見つかります。","What happens during a wedding?":"結婚式中に何が起こるのでしょうか?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"最初の 3 つのトリックのうち 1 つを獲得した最初の他のシートが Re に加わります。結婚式の席が 3 つすべてに勝った場合、ゲームは 1 プレイヤーのダイヤモンド ソロとして続行されます。","Which card is the strongest trump?":"最も強い切り札はどれですか?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"ハートテンが最高です。クイーンがクラブ、スペード、ハート、ダイヤモンドの順序で続き、次にジャックが同じスートの順序で続き、次にダイヤモンドのエース、テン、キング、ナインの順になります。","Must I follow suit?":"私もそれに従わなければなりませんか?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"はい。切り札以外のスーツがリードされている場合は、可能な限りそのスーツをプレイしてください。トランプがリードされている場合は、可能な限りトランプを出します。それ以外の場合は、任意のカードを選択します。","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re と Kontra とはどういう意味ですか?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"それらは 2 つのチームの名前です。許可された開始ウィンドウ中に、プレーヤーは自分のチームを 1 回発表できます。コールは表示され、勝利のしきい値とゲームポイントを変更します。","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"これは完全なトーナメント ルールセットですか?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"いいえ。これは、Re/Kontra コールとウェディング ルールを使用した通常のプレイのローカル練習バージョンです。これにより、プレー前に選択されたソロ、拒否、トーナメントのペナルティ、および多くのハウスルールが除外されます。","Can I play with three friends online?":"オンラインで 3 人の友達とプレイできますか?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"いいえ。 3 人の対戦相手は単純なローカル コンピューター プレイヤーです。アカウント、マッチメイキング、オンライン マルチプレイヤーはありません。","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"私の取引はオンラインでアップロードまたは保存されていますか?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"ゲーム データがアップロードされていません。現在の取引はこのデバイスのこのブラウザに自動的に保存されるため、後で再開できます。","Rules and limitations":"ルールと制限事項","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"これはカジュアルなローカル練習ゲームであり、オンライン マルチプレイヤー、ギャンブル、トーナメント クライアント、またはエキスパート ソルバーではありません。これは、DDV の通常ゲームのカード順序、Re/Kontra コール、および結婚式の決議を使用しますが、選択可能なソロ、Keine 90 などの拒否、トーナメント ペナルティ、すべての特別なテーブル ルール、または認定トーナメント スコアリングは実装していません。 3 つの CPU は単純な合法的な動きのヒューリスティックを使用しており、弱い決定を下す可能性があります。","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"無料でプレイできます。カードとスコアはこのデバイスのこのブラウザーに残ります。ゲームデータはアップロードされません。","Play Doppelkopf":"ドッペルコップをプレイ","Related tools":"関連ツール","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Language":"言語","UsefulVerse":"便利な詩","All tools":"すべてのツール","New deal":"新規取引","Resume saved deal":"保存された取引を再開","Delete saved deal":"保存された取引を削除する","Choose New deal to begin.":"新規取引を選択して開始してください。","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"新しい取引を開始するか、保存したゲームを再開します。","You":"あなた","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"シート","Your hand":"あなたの手","Current trick":"現在のトリック","Turn":"ターン","Re eyes":"Re 目","Kontra eyes":"コントラの目","Re tricks":"再トリック","Kontra tricks":"コントラのトリック","Match points":"マッチ ポイント","Announce Re":"再発表","Announce Kontra":"コントラを発表","Play selected card":"選択したカードをプレイする","Select a card":"カードを選択してください","Re":"Re","Kontra":"コントラ","Team not yet known":"チームはまだ不明です","Trick table":"トリックテーブル","Clubs":"クラブ","Spades":"スペード","Hearts":"ハート","Diamonds":"ダイヤモンド","Nine":"ナイン","Jack":"ジャック","Queen":"女王","King":"キング","Ten":"テン","Ace":"エース","second copy":"2 番目のコピー","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"あなたの番です。正規のカードを選択してください。","A computer player is thinking…":"コンピューター プレーヤーが考えています…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"新規取引の準備ができました。あなたはこの練習ラウンドをリードします。","Selected card":"選択されたカード","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"その遊びは合法ではありません。可能であれば、後追いかトランプに従う。","Deal saved on this device.":"このデバイスに取引が保存されました。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"このブラウザではローカル保存を使用できません。","Saved deal resumed.":"保存された取引が再開されました。","Saved deal deleted.":"保存された取引が削除されました。","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"保存された取引を読み取れませんでした。削除してやり直してください。","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"ウェディング: 3 トリック以内に最初に勝った他のプレイヤーがパートナーになります。","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"結婚式は解決しました: トリックの勝者はパートナーです。","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"ウェディング プレイヤーが最初の 3 トリックで勝利しました。この契約は現在、ダイヤモンドソロです。","Re announced.":"Reが発表されました。","Kontra announced.":"コントラが発表。","Re wins the deal.":"Re が取引を獲得しました。","Kontra wins the deal.":"コントラが取引を勝ち取りました。","Final eyes":"最後の目","Game points":"ゲームポイント","Teams":"チーム","Start another deal to play again.":"もう一度プレイするには別の取引を開始してください。","Rules reference":"ルールリファレンス","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"ドイツ ドッペルコップフ協会 · トーナメント ルール、21 2 月 2026","Card":"カード","eyes":"目"},"ko":{"Doppelkopf":"도펠코프","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf 온라인 — 무료 로컬 카드 게임","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"3명의 로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어를 상대로 4인승 Doppelkopf 연습 게임을 플레이하세요. 팀, 트럼프, 트릭 및 Re/Kontra 호출에 대해 알아보세요. 무료이며 계정이 없습니다.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"로컬 4인승 Doppelkopf 게임을 플레이하세요. 가능하면 리드슈트나 트럼프를 따르고, 클럽 퀸즈를 통해 Re 팀을 찾고, Re 또는 Kontra 발표를 시도해 보세요.","A quick example":"빠른 예","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"일반 게임에서 클럽 퀸을 보유한 두 플레이어는 Re입니다. 한 플레이어가 둘 다 보유하면 결혼식이 시작됩니다. 처음 세 개 중 먼저 트릭을 획득한 다른 플레이어가 파트너가 됩니다.","How to play":"플레이 방법","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"이 게임은 48 카드를 처리합니다: 에이스, 10, 킹, 퀸, 잭 2개와 각 무늬 9개. 4개의 좌석 각각에 12 카드가 제공됩니다. 트럼프 순서는 하트 10부터 시작하고, 퀸과 잭 순서로, 다이아몬드 카드 순서로 진행됩니다. 트릭은 가장 높은 트럼프 또는 트럼프가 사용되지 않는 경우 리드 슈트의 가장 높은 카드에 의해 승리됩니다. 이 게임에는 240 카드 눈이 있습니다.","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","How many cards and players are there?":"카드와 플레이어는 몇 명입니까?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf는 여기에서 4개의 시트와 48 카드(24 카드 앞면 각각 2개씩)로 플레이됩니다. 각 좌석에는 12 카드가 제공됩니다.","How are the teams found?":"팀은 어떻게 찾나요?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"일반 게임에서 클럽 퀸을 보유한 두 좌석은 Re를 형성합니다. 나머지 두 개는 Kontra를 형성합니다. 한 좌석에 두 클럽 퀸이 모두 있는 경우 결혼 규칙에 따라 처음 세 가지 트릭 중에 파트너를 찾습니다.","What happens during a wedding?":"결혼식 중에 무슨 일이 일어나나요?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"처음 세 가지 트릭 중 하나를 획득한 첫 번째 다른 좌석이 Re에 합류했습니다. 결혼식 자리가 3개 모두 이기면 게임은 1인 다이아몬드 솔로로 계속된다.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"가장 강한 트럼프 카드는 무엇입니까?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"하트 10이 가장 높습니다. 퀸즈는 클럽, 스페이드, 하트, 다이아몬드 순서로 이어지며, 잭은 같은 수트 순서로, 그 다음은 다이아몬드 에이스, 10, 킹, 9 순으로 이어집니다.","Must I follow suit?":"내가 따라야 합니까?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"예. 트럼프가 아닌 슈트가 나오면 가능하면 그 슈트를 플레이하세요. 트럼프가 이끄는 경우 가능하면 트럼프를 연주하십시오. 그렇지 않으면 아무 카드나 선택하세요.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re와 Kontra는 무엇을 의미합니까?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"두 팀의 이름입니다. 허용된 시작 기간 동안 플레이어는 자신의 팀을 한 번 발표할 수 있습니다. 통화가 표시되고 승리 기준점과 게임 포인트가 변경됩니다.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"이것이 전체 토너먼트 규칙 세트입니까?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"아니요. Re/Kontra 콜과 웨딩 룰을 이용한 일반 플레이의 로컬 연습 버전입니다. 플레이 전에 선택한 솔로, 거부, 토너먼트 페널티 및 많은 하우스 규칙을 제외합니다.","Can I play with three friends online?":"친구 세 명과 온라인으로 플레이할 수 있나요?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"아니요. 세 명의 상대는 단순한 로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어입니다. 계정, 매치메이킹, 온라인 멀티플레이어가 없습니다.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"내 거래가 온라인에 업로드되거나 저장됩니까?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"게임 데이터가 업로드되지 않았습니다. 현재 거래는 이 기기의 이 브라우저에 자동으로 저장되므로 나중에 재개할 수 있습니다.","Rules and limitations":"규칙 및 제한 사항","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"이것은 온라인 멀티플레이어, 도박, 토너먼트 클라이언트 또는 전문 해결사가 아닌 캐주얼 로컬 연습 게임입니다. DDV 일반 게임 카드 순서, Re/Kontra 콜 및 웨딩 결의안을 사용하지만 선택 가능한 솔로, keine 90와 같은 거부, 토너먼트 페널티, 모든 특수 테이블 규칙 또는 인증된 토너먼트 득점을 구현하지 않습니다. 세 개의 CPU는 단순한 합법적 이동 경험적 방법을 사용하므로 약한 결정을 내릴 수 있습니다.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"무료로 플레이할 수 있습니다. 카드와 점수는 이 기기의 브라우저에 그대로 유지됩니다. 게임 데이터가 업로드되지 않습니다.","Play Doppelkopf":"도펠코프 재생","Related tools":"관련 도구","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Language":"언어","UsefulVerse":"유용한 절","All tools":"모든 도구","New deal":"새로운 거래","Resume saved deal":"저장된 거래 재개","Delete saved deal":"저장된 거래 삭제","Choose New deal to begin.":"시작하려면 새 거래를 선택하세요.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"새 거래를 시작하거나 저장된 게임을 재개하세요.","You":"당신","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"좌석","Your hand":"당신의 손","Current trick":"현재 트릭","Turn":"턴","Re eyes":"리눈","Kontra eyes":"콘트라 아이즈","Re tricks":"재 트릭","Kontra tricks":"콘트라 트릭","Match points":"매치 포인트","Announce Re":"다시 발표","Announce Kontra":"콘트라 발표","Play selected card":"선택한 카드 재생","Select a card":"카드를 선택하세요","Re":"Re","Kontra":"콘트라","Team not yet known":"아직 알려지지 않은 팀","Trick table":"트릭 테이블","Clubs":"클럽","Spades":"스페이드","Hearts":"하트","Diamonds":"다이아몬드","Nine":"나인","Jack":"잭","Queen":"여왕","King":"킹","Ten":"10","Ace":"에이스","second copy":"두 번째 사본","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"당신 차례입니다. 합법적인 카드를 선택하세요.","A computer player is thinking…":"컴퓨터 플레이어가 생각하고 있습니다…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"새로운 거래가 준비되었습니다. 당신이 이 연습 라운드를 주도하고 있습니다.","Selected card":"선택한 카드","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"그 플레이는 합법적이지 않습니다. 가능하면 소송이나 트럼프를 따르십시오.","Deal saved on this device.":"이 장치에 거래가 저장되었습니다.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"이 브라우저에서는 로컬 저장을 사용할 수 없습니다.","Saved deal resumed.":"저장된 거래가 재개되었습니다.","Saved deal deleted.":"저장된 거래가 삭제되었습니다.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"저장된 거래를 읽을 수 없습니다. 삭제하고 다시 시작해 보세요.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"결혼식: 세 가지 트릭 내에서 먼저 승리하는 다른 플레이어가 파트너가 됩니다.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"결혼식 해결됨: 트릭 승자는 파트너입니다.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"웨딩 플레이어가 처음 세 가지 트릭을 획득했습니다. 거래는 이제 다이아몬드 솔로입니다.","Re announced.":"Re가 발표되었습니다.","Kontra announced.":"콘트라가 발표했습니다.","Re wins the deal.":"Re가 거래에서 승리했습니다.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra가 거래에서 승리했습니다.","Final eyes":"최종 눈","Game points":"게임 포인트","Teams":"팀","Start another deal to play again.":"다시 플레이하려면 다른 거래를 시작하세요.","Rules reference":"규칙 참조","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"독일 도펠코프 협회 · 토너먼트 규칙, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"카드","eyes":"눈"},"mr":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf ऑनलाइन — मोफत लोकल कार्ड गेम","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"तीन स्थानिक संगणक खेळाडूंविरुद्ध चार आसनी डॉपेलकोप सराव खेळ खेळा. संघ, ट्रम्प, युक्त्या आणि री/कॉन्ट्रा कॉल जाणून घ्या. मोफत, खाते नाही.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"स्थानिक चार-आसनांचा Doppelkopf गेम खेळा. जेव्हा तुम्हाला शक्य असेल तेव्हा नेतृत्वाखालील सूट किंवा ट्रम्पचे अनुसरण करा, क्लब क्वीन्सद्वारे रे टीम शोधा आणि रे किंवा कॉन्ट्रा घोषणा वापरून पहा.","A quick example":"एक द्रुत उदाहरण","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"सामान्य खेळात, क्लब क्वीन असलेले दोन खेळाडू म्हणजे रे. जर एका खेळाडूने दोन्ही धारण केले तर लग्न सुरू होते: पहिल्या तीनमध्ये युक्ती जिंकणारा पहिला दुसरा खेळाडू त्यांचा जोडीदार बनतो.","How to play":"कसे खेळायचे","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"गेममध्ये 48 कार्डे आहेत: ace च्या दोन प्रती, दहा, राजा, राणी, जॅक आणि प्रत्येक सूटमध्ये नऊ. चार जागांपैकी प्रत्येकाला 12 कार्ड मिळतात. ट्रम्प ऑर्डर हार्ट टेनने सुरू होते, त्यानंतर राणी आणि जॅक सूट क्रमाने, त्यानंतर डायमंड कार्डे. ट्रंप खेळला नाही तर सर्वात जास्त ट्रंप किंवा लीड सूटचे सर्वोच्च कार्ड जिंकले जाते. गेममध्ये 240 कार्ड डोळे आहेत.","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","How many cards and players are there?":"किती कार्ड आणि खेळाडू आहेत?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf येथे चार सीट आणि 48 कार्ड्ससह खेळला जातो: 24 कार्ड चेहर्यांच्या प्रत्येकी दोन प्रती. प्रत्येक सीटला 12 कार्ड मिळतात.","How are the teams found?":"संघ कसे सापडतात?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"सामान्य खेळात, क्लब क्वीन धारण केलेल्या दोन जागा रे बनतात; इतर दोन कोंट्रा फॉर्म. जर एका सीटवर दोन्ही क्लब क्वीन्स असतील, तर लग्नाचा नियम पहिल्या तीन युक्त्यांमध्ये जोडीदार शोधतो.","What happens during a wedding?":"लग्नात काय होते?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"पहिल्या तीन युक्त्यांपैकी एक जिंकणारी पहिली दुसरी सीट Re मध्ये सामील होते. लग्नाचे आसन तिन्ही जिंकल्यास, गेम एक-खेळाडू डायमंड सोलो म्हणून सुरू राहील.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"कोणते कार्ड सर्वात मजबूत ट्रम्प आहे?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"हृदय दहा सर्वात जास्त आहे. क्वीन्स क्लब, कुदळ, हृदय, डायमंड ऑर्डर, नंतर त्याच सूट क्रमाने जॅक, नंतर डायमंड एस, टेन, किंग आणि नऊ असे अनुसरण करतात.","Must I follow suit?":"मी त्याचे अनुसरण केले पाहिजे का?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"होय. जर नॉन-ट्रम्प सूट नेत असेल तर, जेव्हा शक्य असेल तेव्हा तो सूट वाजवा. जर एखाद्या ट्रम्पचे नेतृत्व केले असेल तर, शक्य असेल तेव्हा ट्रम्प वाजवा. अन्यथा, कोणतेही कार्ड निवडा.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re आणि Kontra चा अर्थ काय?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"ती दोन संघांची नावे आहेत. परवानगी असलेल्या उघडण्याच्या विंडोदरम्यान, खेळाडू एकदाच त्यांच्या संघाची घोषणा करू शकतो. कॉल दृश्यमान आहे आणि विजय थ्रेशोल्ड आणि गेम पॉइंट बदलतो.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"हा संपूर्ण स्पर्धेचा नियम आहे का?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"नं. रे/कॉन्ट्रा कॉल आणि लग्नाच्या नियमांसह सामान्य खेळाची ही स्थानिक सराव आवृत्ती आहे. यात खेळापूर्वी निवडलेले सोलो, नकार, स्पर्धेचे दंड आणि घराचे अनेक नियम सोडले जातात.","Can I play with three friends online?":"मी तीन मित्रांसोबत ऑनलाइन खेळू शकतो का?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"नं. तुमचे तीन विरोधक साधे स्थानिक संगणक खेळाडू आहेत. कोणतेही खाते, मॅचमेकिंग किंवा ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर नाही.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"माझा करार ऑनलाइन अपलोड किंवा सेव्ह केला आहे?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"कोणताही गेम डेटा अपलोड केलेला नाही. तुमची वर्तमान डील या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये स्वयंचलितपणे जतन केली जाते जेणेकरून तुम्ही ते नंतर पुन्हा सुरू करू शकता.","Rules and limitations":"नियम आणि मर्यादा","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"हा एक प्रासंगिक स्थानिक सराव खेळ आहे, ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर, जुगार, टूर्नामेंट क्लायंट किंवा तज्ञ सॉल्व्हर नाही. हे DDV नॉर्मल-गेम कार्ड ऑर्डर, Re/Kontra कॉल आणि वेडिंग रिझोल्यूशन वापरते, परंतु निवडण्यायोग्य सोलो, नकार जसे की केइन 90, टूर्नामेंट दंड, सर्व विशेष टेबल नियम किंवा प्रमाणित टूर्नामेंट स्कोअरिंग लागू करत नाही. तीन सीपीयू साधे कायदेशीर-मूव्ह ह्युरिस्टिक्स वापरतात आणि कमकुवत निर्णय घेऊ शकतात.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"खेळण्यासाठी विनामूल्य. कार्ड आणि स्कोअर या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात; कोणताही गेम डेटा अपलोड केलेला नाही.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf खेळा","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी वचन","All tools":"सर्व साधने","New deal":"नवीन डील","Resume saved deal":"सेव्ह केलेला करार पुन्हा सुरू करा","Delete saved deal":"सेव्ह केलेला करार हटवा","Choose New deal to begin.":"सुरु करण्यासाठी नवीन डील निवडा.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"नवीन डील सुरू करा किंवा तुमचा सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा.","You":"तुम्ही","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"आसन","Your hand":"तुमचा हात","Current trick":"सध्याची युक्ती","Turn":"वळण","Re eyes":"पुन्हा डोळे","Kontra eyes":"कोन्ट्रा डोळे","Re tricks":"पुन्हा युक्त्या","Kontra tricks":"कॉन्ट्रा ट्रिक्स","Match points":"मॅच पॉइंट्स","Announce Re":"पुन्हा घोषणा करा","Announce Kontra":"Kontra ची घोषणा करा","Play selected card":"निवडलेले कार्ड खेळा","Select a card":"एक कार्ड निवडा","Re":"पुन्हा","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"टीम अद्याप ज्ञात नाही","Trick table":"ट्रिक टेबल","Clubs":"क्लब","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"हृदय","Diamonds":"हिरे","Nine":"नऊ","Jack":"जॅक","Queen":"क्वीन","King":"राजा","Ten":"दहा","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"दुसरी प्रत","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"तुमची पाळी. कायदेशीर कार्ड निवडा.","A computer player is thinking…":"एक संगणक प्लेयर विचार करत आहे…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"नवीन डील तयार आहे. तुम्ही या सराव फेरीचे नेतृत्व करा.","Selected card":"निवडलेले कार्ड","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"ते नाटक कायदेशीर नाही. शक्य असेल तेव्हा खटला किंवा ट्रम्पचे अनुसरण करा.","Deal saved on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर डील सेव्ह केली आहे.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"स्थानिक बचत या ब्राउझरमध्ये अनुपलब्ध आहे.","Saved deal resumed.":"जतन केलेला करार पुन्हा सुरू झाला.","Saved deal deleted.":"सेव्ह केलेला करार हटवला.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"जतन केलेला करार वाचता आला नाही. ते हटवा आणि पुन्हा सुरू करा.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"वेडिंग: तीन युक्त्यांमध्ये जिंकणारा पहिला दुसरा खेळाडू भागीदार बनतो.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"लग्नाचे निराकरण झाले: युक्तीचा विजेता भागीदार आहे.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"लग्नातील खेळाडूने पहिल्या तीन युक्त्या जिंकल्या. हा करार आता डायमंड सोलो झाला आहे.","Re announced.":"पुन्हा घोषित केले.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra ने घोषणा केली.","Re wins the deal.":"Re ने करार जिंकला.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra ने करार जिंकला.","Final eyes":"अंतिम डोळे","Game points":"गेम पॉइंट","Teams":"टीम","Start another deal to play again.":"पुन्हा खेळण्यासाठी दुसरी डील सुरू करा.","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"जर्मन डॉपेलकोफ असोसिएशन · स्पर्धेचे नियम, 21 फेब्रुवारी 2026","Card":"कार्ड","eyes":"डोळे"},"ms":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Permainan Kad Tempatan Percuma","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Mainkan permainan latihan Doppelkopf empat tempat duduk menentang tiga pemain komputer tempatan. Pelajari pasukan, trump, helah dan panggilan Re/Kontra. Percuma, tiada akaun.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Mainkan permainan Doppelkopf empat tempat duduk tempatan. Ikuti sut utama atau trump apabila anda boleh, cari pasukan Re melalui permaisuri kelab, dan cuba pengumuman Re atau Kontra.","A quick example":"Contoh pantas","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Dalam permainan biasa, dua pemain yang memegang ratu kelab ialah Re. Jika seorang pemain memegang kedua-duanya, perkahwinan bermula: pemain lain yang pertama memenangi helah dalam tiga yang pertama menjadi pasangan mereka.","How to play":"Cara bermain","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Permainan ini memperkatakan kad 48: dua salinan ace, sepuluh, raja, ratu, bicu dan sembilan dalam setiap sut. Setiap empat tempat duduk mendapat kad 12. Perintah Trump bermula dengan hati sepuluh, kemudian ratu dan bicu dalam susunan sut, diikuti dengan kad berlian. Helah dimenangi oleh trump tertinggi, atau kad tertinggi sut yang dipimpin jika tiada trump dimainkan. Permainan ini mempunyai mata kad 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","How many cards and players are there?":"Berapa jumlah kad dan pemain yang ada?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf dimainkan di sini dengan empat tempat duduk dan kad 48: dua salinan setiap muka kad 24. Setiap tempat duduk menerima kad 12.","How are the teams found?":"Bagaimana pasukan ditemui?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Dalam permainan biasa, dua kerusi yang memegang ratu kelab membentuk Re; dua lagi membentuk Kontra. Jika satu kerusi memegang kedua-dua ratu kelab, peraturan perkahwinan mencari pasangan semasa tiga helah pertama.","What happens during a wedding?":"Apakah yang berlaku semasa perkahwinan?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Kerusi lain pertama yang memenangi salah satu daripada tiga helah pertama menyertai Re. Jika kerusi perkahwinan memenangi ketiga-tiganya, permainan diteruskan sebagai solo berlian satu pemain.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Kad manakah yang paling kuat?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Jantung sepuluh adalah tertinggi. Ratu mengikut susunan kelab, spade, jantung, berlian, kemudian bicu dalam susunan sut yang sama, kemudian ace berlian, sepuluh, raja dan sembilan.","Must I follow suit?":"Mestikah saya mengikut jejak?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ya. Jika saman bukan trump diketuai, mainkan saman itu apabila anda boleh. Jika trump dipimpin, mainkan trump apabila anda boleh. Jika tidak, pilih mana-mana kad.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Apakah maksud Re dan Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Mereka adalah nama kedua-dua pasukan. Semasa tingkap pembukaan yang dibenarkan, pemain boleh mengumumkan pasukan mereka sekali. Panggilan boleh dilihat dan menukar ambang kemenangan dan mata permainan.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Adakah ini set peraturan penuh kejohanan?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"No. Ini ialah versi latihan tempatan permainan biasa dengan panggilan Re/Kontra dan peraturan perkahwinan. Ia meninggalkan pilihan solo sebelum bermain, penolakan, penalti kejohanan dan banyak peraturan rumah.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Bolehkah saya bermain dengan tiga rakan dalam talian?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"No. Tiga lawan anda adalah pemain komputer tempatan yang mudah. Tiada akaun, mencari jodoh atau berbilang pemain dalam talian.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Adakah tawaran saya dimuat naik atau disimpan dalam talian?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Tiada data permainan dimuat naik. Tawaran semasa anda disimpan secara automatik dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini supaya anda boleh menyambung semula kemudian.","Rules and limitations":"Peraturan dan had","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Ini ialah permainan latihan tempatan kasual, bukan berbilang pemain dalam talian, perjudian, pelanggan kejohanan atau penyelesai pakar. Ia menggunakan susunan kad permainan biasa DDV, panggilan Re/Kontra dan resolusi perkahwinan, tetapi tidak melaksanakan solo boleh pilih, penolakan seperti keine 90, penalti kejohanan, semua peraturan meja khas atau pemarkahan kejohanan yang diperakui. Ketiga-tiga CPU menggunakan heuristik pergerakan undang-undang yang mudah dan mungkin membuat keputusan yang lemah.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Percuma untuk dimainkan. Kad dan markah kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini; tiada data permainan dimuat naik.","Play Doppelkopf":"Main Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alatan","New deal":"Tawaran baharu","Resume saved deal":"Sambung semula perjanjian yang disimpan","Delete saved deal":"Padamkan perjanjian yang disimpan","Choose New deal to begin.":"Pilih tawaran baharu untuk bermula.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Mulakan tawaran baharu atau sambung semula permainan anda yang disimpan.","You":"Anda","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Tempat duduk","Your hand":"Tangan anda","Current trick":"Helah semasa","Turn":"Pusing","Re eyes":"Mata semula","Kontra eyes":"Mata kontra","Re tricks":"Helah semula","Kontra tricks":"Helah Kontra","Match points":"Mata perlawanan","Announce Re":"Umumkan Semula","Announce Kontra":"Umumkan Kontra","Play selected card":"Mainkan kad yang dipilih","Select a card":"Pilih kad","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Pasukan belum diketahui","Trick table":"Jadual helah","Clubs":"Kelab","Spades":"Penyodok","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Nine":"Sembilan","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Permaisuri","King":"Raja","Ten":"Sepuluh","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"salinan kedua","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Giliran anda. Pilih kad yang sah.","A computer player is thinking…":"Seorang pemain komputer sedang berfikir…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Tawaran baharu sedia. Anda mengetuai pusingan latihan ini.","Selected card":"Kad yang dipilih","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Lakonan itu tidak sah. Ikuti kesesuaian atau trump apabila boleh.","Deal saved on this device.":"Tawaran disimpan pada peranti ini.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Penyimpanan setempat tidak tersedia dalam penyemak imbas ini.","Saved deal resumed.":"Perjanjian tersimpan disambung semula.","Saved deal deleted.":"Tawaran yang disimpan dipadamkan.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Perjanjian yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Padamkannya dan mulakan semula.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Perkahwinan: pemain lain pertama yang menang dalam tiga helah menjadi rakan kongsi.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Perkahwinan diselesaikan: pemenang helah adalah pasangan.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Pemain perkahwinan itu memenangi tiga helah pertama. Perjanjian itu kini solo berlian.","Re announced.":"Re diumumkan.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra diumumkan.","Re wins the deal.":"Re memenangi perjanjian itu.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra memenangi perjanjian itu.","Final eyes":"Mata akhir","Game points":"Mata permainan","Teams":"Pasukan","Start another deal to play again.":"Mulakan perjanjian lain untuk bermain semula.","Rules reference":"Rujukan peraturan","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Persatuan Doppelkopf Jerman · Peraturan Kejohanan, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"Kad","eyes":"mata"},"nb":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Gratis lokalt kortspill","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Spill et fireseters Doppelkopf-treningsspill mot tre lokale dataspillere. Lær lag, trumfer, triks og Re/Kontra-kall. Gratis, ingen konto.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Spill et lokalt fireseters Doppelkopf-spill. Følg den ledede fargen eller trumf når du kan, finn Re-laget gjennom klubbdronningene, og prøv en Re- eller Kontra-kunngjøring.","A quick example":"Et raskt eksempel","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"I et normalt spill er de to spillerne som har en klubbdronning Re. Hvis en spiller har begge, starter et bryllup: den første andre spilleren som vinner et triks i de tre første blir deres partner.","How to play":"Slik spiller du","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Spillet deler ut 48-kort: to kopier av ess, ti, konge, dame, knekt og ni i hver farge. Hvert av fire seter får 12-kort. Trumf-rekkefølgen starter med hjertet ti, deretter dronningene og knektene i fargerekkefølge, etterfulgt av ruterkortene. Et stikk vinnes av den høyeste trumf, eller det høyeste kortet i ledet farge hvis ingen trumf spilles. Spillet har 240 kortøyne.","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","How many cards and players are there?":"Hvor mange kort og spillere er det?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf spilles her med fire seter og 48-kort: to kopier av hvert av 24-kortflatene. Hvert sete mottar 12-kort.","How are the teams found?":"Hvordan blir lagene funnet?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"I et normalt spill danner de to setene som har en klubbdronning Re; de to andre utgjør Kontra. Hvis ett sete har begge klubbdronningene, finner bryllupsregelen en partner under de tre første triksene.","What happens during a wedding?":"Hva skjer under et bryllup?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Det første andre setet som vinner et av de tre første triksene blir med Re. Hvis bryllupssetet vinner alle tre, fortsetter spillet som en enspillers diamantsolo.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Hvilket kort er den sterkeste trumf?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Hjertet ti er høyest. Damer følger i kløver, spar, hjerte, ruterekkefølge, deretter knekt i samme fargerekkefølge, deretter ruter ess, ti, konge og ni.","Must I follow suit?":"Må jeg følge etter?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ja. Hvis en ikke-trumf farge ledes, spill den fargen når du kan. Hvis en trumf ledes, spill en trumf når du kan. Ellers velger du et hvilket som helst kort.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Hva betyr Re og Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"De er navnene på de to lagene. Under det tillatte åpningsvinduet kan en spiller annonsere laget sitt én gang. Samtalen er synlig og endrer gevinstterskel og spillepoeng.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Er dette hele turneringsregelsettet?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Nr. Dette er en lokal øvingsversjon av vanlig lek med Re/Kontra-anrop og bryllupsregelen. Det utelater soloer valgt før spill, avslag, turneringsstraff og mange husregler.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Kan jeg spille med tre venner online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Nr. Dine tre motstandere er enkle lokale dataspillere. Det er ingen konto, matchmaking eller online flerspiller.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Er avtalen min lastet opp eller lagret på nettet?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Ingen spilldata er lastet opp. Din nåværende avtale lagres automatisk i denne nettleseren på denne enheten, slik at du kan gjenoppta den senere.","Rules and limitations":"Regler og begrensninger","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Dette er et uformelt lokalt treningsspill, ikke online flerspiller, gambling, en turneringsklient eller en ekspertløser. Den bruker DDV-kortrekkefølgen for normalspill, Re/Kontra-samtaler og bryllupsoppløsning, men implementerer ikke valgbare soloer, avslag som keine 90, turneringsstraff, alle spesielle bordregler eller sertifisert turneringsscore. De tre CPU-ene bruker enkel heuristikk for lovlige bevegelser og kan ta svake avgjørelser.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis å spille. Kort og poeng forblir i denne nettleseren på denne enheten; ingen spilldata lastes opp.","Play Doppelkopf":"Spill Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"NyttigVerse","All tools":"Alle verktøy","New deal":"Ny avtale","Resume saved deal":"Fortsett lagret avtale","Delete saved deal":"Slett lagret avtale","Choose New deal to begin.":"Velg Ny avtale for å begynne.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Start en ny avtale eller gjenoppta det lagrede spillet.","You":"Du","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Sete","Your hand":"Din hånd","Current trick":"Gjeldende triks","Turn":"Sving","Re eyes":"Re øyne","Kontra eyes":"Kontra øyne","Re tricks":"Re triks","Kontra tricks":"Kontra triks","Match points":"Samsvar poeng","Announce Re":"Kunngjør Re","Announce Kontra":"Kunngjør Kontra","Play selected card":"Spill det valgte kortet","Select a card":"Velg et kort","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Team ennå ikke kjent","Trick table":"Triksbord","Clubs":"Klubber","Spades":"Spader","Hearts":"hjerter","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Nine":"Ni","Jack":"Jekk","Queen":"Dronning","King":"King","Ten":"Ti","Ace":"Ess","second copy":"andre kopi","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Din tur. Velg et lovlig kort.","A computer player is thinking…":"En dataspiller tenker...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Ny avtale klar. Du leder denne øvingsrunden.","Selected card":"Valgt kort","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Den leken er ikke lovlig. Følg farge eller trumf når det er mulig.","Deal saved on this device.":"Avtalen er lagret på denne enheten.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Lokal lagring er utilgjengelig i denne nettleseren.","Saved deal resumed.":"Lagret avtale gjenopptatt.","Saved deal deleted.":"Lagret avtale slettet.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Den lagrede avtalen kunne ikke leses. Slett den og start på nytt.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Bryllup: den første andre spilleren som vinner innen tre triks blir partneren.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Bryllup løst: triksvinneren er partneren.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Bryllupsspilleren vant de tre første triksene. Avtalen er nå en diamantsolo.","Re announced.":"Re annonsert.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra annonsert.","Re wins the deal.":"Re vinner avtalen.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra vinner avtalen.","Final eyes":"Siste øyne","Game points":"Spillpoeng","Teams":"Lag","Start another deal to play again.":"Start en annen avtale for å spille igjen.","Rules reference":"Referanse til regler","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Tysk Doppelkopf Association · Turneringsregler, 21 feb. 2026","Card":"Kort","eyes":"øyne"},"nl":{"Doppelkopf":"Dubbelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Gratis lokaal kaartspel","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Speel een Doppelkopf-oefenwedstrijd met vier zitplaatsen tegen drie lokale computerspelers. Leer teams, troeven, trucs en Re/Kontra-oproepen. Gratis, geen account.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Speel een lokaal Doppelkopf-spel met vier zitplaatsen. Volg de led-reeks of troef wanneer je kunt, vind het Re-team via de clubkoninginnen en probeer een Re- of Kontra-aankondiging.","A quick example":"Een snel voorbeeld","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"In een normaal spel zijn de twee spelers met een klaverenkoningin Re. Als een speler beide in zijn bezit heeft, begint een bruiloft: de eerste andere speler die een slag wint in de eerste drie, wordt zijn partner.","How to play":"Hoe te spelen","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Het spel deelt 48-kaarten: twee exemplaren van aas, tien, heer, vrouw, boer en negen in elke reeks. Elk van de vier stoelen krijgt 12-kaarten. De Trump-volgorde begint met de harten tien, daarna de vrouwen en boeren in reeksvolgorde, gevolgd door de ruitenkaarten. Een slag wordt gewonnen door de hoogste troef, of de hoogste kaart van de led-reeks als er geen troef wordt gespeeld. Het spel heeft 240-kaartogen.","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","How many cards and players are there?":"Hoeveel kaarten en spelers zijn er?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf wordt hier gespeeld met vier zitplaatsen en 48-kaarten: twee exemplaren van elk van de 24-kaartvlakken. Elke stoel ontvangt 12-kaarten.","How are the teams found?":"Hoe worden de teams gevonden?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"In een normaal spel zijn de twee stoelen met een clubkoningin van Re; de andere twee vormen Kontra. Als één stoel beide clubkoninginnen bevat, vindt de huwelijksregel een partner tijdens de eerste drie slagen.","What happens during a wedding?":"Wat gebeurt er tijdens een bruiloft?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"De eerste andere stoel die een van de eerste drie slagen wint, voegt zich bij Re. Als de trouwplaats alle drie wint, gaat het spel verder als een diamanten solo voor één speler.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Welke kaart is de sterkste troef?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"De hart tien is het hoogst. Vrouwen volgen in de volgorde klaveren, schoppen, harten en ruiten, dan boeren in dezelfde kleurvolgorde, daarna de ruiten aas, tien, heer en negen.","Must I follow suit?":"Moet ik dit voorbeeld volgen?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ja. Als een niet-troefkleur wordt voorgespeeld, speel dan die kleur wanneer je kunt. Als er een troef wordt geleid, speel dan een troef wanneer je kunt. Kies anders een kaart.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Wat betekenen Re en Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Dit zijn de namen van de twee teams. Tijdens de toegestane openingsperiode kan een speler zijn team één keer aankondigen. De oproep is zichtbaar en verandert de winstdrempel en spelpunten.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Is dit de volledige toernooiregelset?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Nr. Dit is een lokale oefenversie van normaal spel met Re/Kontra-oproepen en de huwelijksregel. Het laat de vóór het spelen gekozen solo's, weigeringen, toernooistraffen en veel huisregels buiten beschouwing.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Kan ik online met drie vrienden spelen?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Nr. Je drie tegenstanders zijn eenvoudige lokale computerspelers. Er is geen account, matchmaking of online multiplayer.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Wordt mijn deal online geüpload of opgeslagen?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Er worden geen spelgegevens geüpload. Je huidige deal wordt automatisch in deze browser op dit apparaat opgeslagen, zodat je deze later kunt hervatten.","Rules and limitations":"Regels en beperkingen","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Dit is een informeel lokaal oefenspel, geen online multiplayer, gokspel, een toernooiclient of een deskundige oplosser. Het gebruikt de DDV-kaartvolgorde voor normaal spel, de Re/Kontra-oproepen en huwelijksresolutie, maar implementeert geen selecteerbare solo's, weigeringen zoals keine 90, toernooistraffen, alle speciale tafelregels of gecertificeerde toernooiscores. De drie CPU's gebruiken eenvoudige heuristieken voor legale zetten en kunnen zwakke beslissingen nemen.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis te spelen. Kaarten en scores blijven in deze browser op dit apparaat; er worden geen spelgegevens geüpload.","Play Doppelkopf":"Speel Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Language":"Taal","UsefulVerse":"Handig vers","All tools":"Alle gereedschappen","New deal":"Nieuwe deal","Resume saved deal":"Opgeslagen deal hervatten","Delete saved deal":"Opgeslagen deal verwijderen","Choose New deal to begin.":"Kies Nieuwe deal om te beginnen.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Start een nieuwe deal of hervat je opgeslagen spel.","You":"Jij","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Zadel","Your hand":"Je hand","Current trick":"Huidige truc","Turn":"Draai","Re eyes":"Re ogen","Kontra eyes":"Kontra-ogen","Re tricks":"Re trucs","Kontra tricks":"Kontra-trucs","Match points":"Matchpunten","Announce Re":"Aankondiging Re","Announce Kontra":"Kontra aankondigen","Play selected card":"Speel geselecteerde kaart","Select a card":"Selecteer een kaart","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Team nog niet bekend","Trick table":"Structafel","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Schoppen","Hearts":"Harten","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Nine":"Negen","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Koningin","King":"Koning","Ten":"Tien","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"tweede exemplaar","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Jouw beurt. Kies een legale kaart.","A computer player is thinking…":"Een computerspeler denkt...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nieuwe deal klaar. Jij leidt deze oefenronde.","Selected card":"Geselecteerde kaart","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Dat spel is niet legaal. Volg het voorbeeld of troef indien mogelijk.","Deal saved on this device.":"Deal opgeslagen op dit apparaat.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Lokaal opslaan is niet beschikbaar in deze browser.","Saved deal resumed.":"Opgeslagen deal hervat.","Saved deal deleted.":"Opgeslagen deal verwijderd.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"De opgeslagen deal kon niet worden gelezen. Verwijder het en begin opnieuw.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Bruiloft: de eerste andere speler die binnen drie slagen wint, wordt de partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Bruiloft opgelost: de winnaar van de truc is de partner.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"De bruiloftsspeler won de eerste drie slagen. De deal is nu een diamanten solo.","Re announced.":"Opnieuw aangekondigd.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra aangekondigd.","Re wins the deal.":"Re wint de deal.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra wint de deal.","Final eyes":"Einde ogen","Game points":"Spelpunten","Teams":"Teams","Start another deal to play again.":"Start een nieuwe deal om opnieuw te spelen.","Rules reference":"Regelreferentie","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Duitse Doppelkopf Vereniging · Toernooiregels, 21 februari 2026","Card":"Kaart","eyes":"ogen"},"pl":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — bezpłatna lokalna gra karciana","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Zagraj w czteromiejscową grę treningową Doppelkopf przeciwko trzem lokalnym graczom komputerowym. Naucz się drużyn, atutów, trików i rozmów Re/Kontra. Za darmo, bez konta.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Zagraj w lokalną grę Doppelkopf dla czterech miejsc. Jeśli możesz, podążaj za liderem lub atutem, znajdź drużynę Re poprzez królowe klubów i wypróbuj ogłoszenie Re lub Kontra.","A quick example":"Krótki przykład","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"W normalnej grze dwaj gracze posiadający hetmana to Re. Jeśli jeden z graczy posiada oba, rozpoczyna się wesele: pierwszy inny gracz, który wygra lewę w pierwszych trzech, zostaje jego partnerem.","How to play":"Jak grać","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Gra rozdaje karty 48: dwie kopie asa, dziesiątki, króla, damy, waleta i dziewiątki w każdym kolorze. Każde z czterech miejsc otrzymuje karty 12. Kolejność Trumpa zaczyna się od dziesiątki serca, następnie damy i walety w kolejności kolorów, a następnie karty karo. Lewę wygrywa najwyższy atut lub najwyższa karta w kolorze wiodącym, jeśli nie zostanie zagrany żaden atut. Gra posiada oczy karty 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","How many cards and players are there?":"Ile jest kart i graczy?\nW","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf gra się tutaj czterema miejscami i kartami 48: po dwie kopie każdej z awersów kart 24. Każde miejsce otrzymuje karty 12.","How are the teams found?":"Jak znaleźć zespoły?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"W normalnej grze dwa miejsca trzymające hetmana tworzą Re; pozostałe dwa tworzą Kontra. Jeśli na jednym miejscu znajdują się obie królowe trefl, zasada ślubu znajdzie partnera podczas pierwszych trzech lew.","What happens during a wedding?":"Co dzieje się podczas ślubu?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Pierwszy inny gracz, który wygra jedną z trzech pierwszych lew, dołącza do Re. Jeśli miejsce weselne wygra wszystkie trzy, gra będzie kontynuowana jako diamentowe solo dla jednego gracza.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Która karta jest najsilniejszym atutem?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Serce dziesięć jest najwyższe. Następują damy w kolejności trefl, pik, kier i karo, następnie walety w tej samej kolejności kolorów, następnie karo-as, dziesiątka, król i dziewiątka.","Must I follow suit?":"Czy muszę naśladować?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Tak. Jeśli prowadzony jest kolor inny niż atutowy, graj w tym kolorze, kiedy tylko możesz. Jeśli zostanie wyprowadzony atut, zagraj atut, kiedy tylko możesz. W przeciwnym razie wybierz dowolną kartę.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Co oznaczają Re i Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"To są nazwy obu zespołów. W dozwolonym oknie otwarcia gracz może jednokrotnie ogłosić swoją drużynę. Połączenie jest widoczne i zmienia próg wygranej oraz punkty gry.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Czy to pełny zestaw zasad turnieju?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Nie. Jest to lokalna, ćwiczeniowa wersja normalnej gry z wezwaniami Re/Kontra i zasadą ślubu. Pomija solówki wybrane przed grą, odmowy, kary turniejowe i wiele zasad obowiązujących w domu.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Czy mogę grać z trzema znajomymi online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Nie. Twoi trzej przeciwnicy to zwykli lokalni gracze komputerowi. Nie ma konta, dobierania graczy ani trybu wieloosobowego online.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Czy moja transakcja została przesłana lub zapisana online?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Nie przesłano żadnych danych gry. Twoja bieżąca oferta jest automatycznie zapisywana w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu, dzięki czemu możesz ją później wznowić.","Rules and limitations":"Zasady i ograniczenia","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"To zwykła gra lokalna, a nie gra wieloosobowa online, hazard, klient turniejowy czy specjalista w rozwiązywaniu problemów. Wykorzystuje kolejność kart DDV w normalnej grze, wezwania Re/Kontra i uchwałę weselną, ale nie implementuje wybieralnych solówek, odmów takich jak keine 90, kar turniejowych, wszystkich specjalnych zasad stołów ani certyfikowanej punktacji turniejowej. Trzy procesory wykorzystują prostą heurystykę legalnych ruchów i mogą podejmować słabe decyzje.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Darmowa gra. Karty i wyniki pozostają w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu; żadne dane gry nie są przesyłane.","Play Doppelkopf":"Odtwórz Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Language":"Język","UsefulVerse":"Przydatny werset","All tools":"Wszystkie narzędzia","New deal":"Nowa oferta","Resume saved deal":"Wznów zapisaną transakcję","Delete saved deal":"Usuń zapisaną transakcję","Choose New deal to begin.":"Wybierz opcję Nowa transakcja, aby rozpocząć.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Rozpocznij nową transakcję lub wznów zapisaną grę.","You":"Ty","CPU":"Procesor","Seat":"Siedzenie","Your hand":"Twoja dłoń","Current trick":"Aktualna sztuczka","Turn":"Obrót","Re eyes":"Re oczy","Kontra eyes":"Oczy Kontra","Re tricks":"Re-sztuczki","Kontra tricks":"Sztuczki z Kontrą","Match points":"Dopasuj punkty","Announce Re":"Ogłoś Re","Announce Kontra":"Ogłoś Kontra","Play selected card":"Zagraj w wybraną kartę","Select a card":"Wybierz kartę","Re":"Dot","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Zespół jeszcze nieznany","Trick table":"Stół do trików","Clubs":"Kluby","Spades":"Piki","Hearts":"Serca","Diamonds":"Diamenty","Nine":"Dziewięć","Jack":"Gniazdo","Queen":"Królowa","King":"Król","Ten":"Dziesięć","Ace":"As","second copy":"druga kopia","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Twoja kolej. Wybierz legalną kartę.","A computer player is thinking…":"Gracz komputerowy myśli…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Nowa oferta gotowa. Prowadzisz tę rundę ćwiczeń.","Selected card":"Wybrana karta","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Ta gra jest nielegalna. Podążaj za tym przykładem lub atutuj, jeśli to możliwe.","Deal saved on this device.":"Oferta zapisana na tym urządzeniu.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Zapisywanie lokalne jest niedostępne w tej przeglądarce.","Saved deal resumed.":"Zapisana transakcja została wznowiona.","Saved deal deleted.":"Zapisana transakcja została usunięta.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Nie można odczytać zapisanej transakcji. Usuń go i zacznij od nowa.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Ślub: partnerem zostaje pierwszy inny gracz, który wygra w ciągu trzech lew.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Ślub rozwiązany: zwycięzcą lewy jest partner.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Weselny gracz wygrał pierwsze trzy lewy. Transakcja jest teraz diamentową solówką.","Re announced.":"Ponownie ogłoszono.\nOgłoszono","Kontra announced.":"Kontra.","Re wins the deal.":"Re wygrywa przetarg.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra wygrywa przetarg.","Final eyes":"Oczy końcowe","Game points":"Punkty w grze","Teams":"Zespoły","Start another deal to play again.":"Rozpocznij kolejną transakcję, aby zagrać ponownie.","Rules reference":"Odniesienie do zasad","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Niemieckie Stowarzyszenie Doppelkopf · Regulamin turnieju, 21 luty 2026","Card":"Karta","eyes":"oczy"},"pt":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online – Jogo de cartas local gratuito","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Jogue um jogo de treino Doppelkopf de quatro lugares contra três jogadores de computador locais. Aprenda equipes, trunfos, truques e chamadas Re/Kontra. Gratuito, sem conta.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Jogue um jogo Doppelkopf local de quatro lugares. Siga o naipe ou trunfo quando puder, encontre o time Re por meio das rainhas do clube e tente um anúncio de Re ou Kontra.","A quick example":"Um exemplo rápido","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Em uma partida normal, os dois jogadores que possuem uma dama de paus são Re. Se um jogador conseguir ambos, um casamento começa: o primeiro jogador a vencer uma vaza nas três primeiras torna-se seu parceiro.","How to play":"Como jogar","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"O jogo distribui cartas 48: duas cópias de ás, dez, rei, rainha, valete e nove em cada naipe. Cada um dos quatro assentos recebe cartões 12. A ordem de Trump começa com o dez de copas, depois as damas e os valetes em ordem de naipes, seguidos pelas cartas de diamantes. Uma vaza é ganha pelo trunfo mais alto ou pela carta mais alta do naipe principal, se nenhum trunfo for jogado. O jogo tem olhos de cartão 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","How many cards and players are there?":"Quantas cartas e jogadores existem?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf é jogado aqui com quatro assentos e cartas 48: duas cópias de cada face da carta 24. Cada assento recebe cartões 12.","How are the teams found?":"Como são encontradas as equipes?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Em um jogo normal, os dois assentos contendo uma rainha do clube formam Re; os outros dois formam Kontra. Se um assento tiver as duas rainhas do clube, a regra do casamento encontra um parceiro durante as três primeiras vazas.","What happens during a wedding?":"O que acontece durante um casamento?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"O primeiro outro lugar a ganhar uma das três primeiras vazas junta-se a Re. Se o assento do casamento ganhar todos os três, o jogo continua como um diamante solo para um jogador.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Qual carta é o trunfo mais forte?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"O dez coração é o mais alto. Damas seguem na ordem de paus, espadas, copas, ouros, depois valetes na mesma ordem de naipes, depois o ás de ouros, dez, rei e nove.","Must I follow suit?":"Devo seguir o exemplo?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Sim. Se um naipe que não seja de trunfo for jogado, jogue-o quando puder. Se um trunfo for liderado, jogue um trunfo quando puder. Caso contrário, escolha qualquer cartão.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"O que significam Re e Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"São os nomes das duas equipes. Durante a janela de abertura permitida, um jogador pode anunciar seu time uma vez. A chamada fica visível e altera o limite de vitória e os pontos do jogo.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Este é o conjunto completo de regras do torneio?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Não. Esta é uma versão prática local do jogo normal com chamadas Re/Kontra e a regra do casamento. Deixa de fora solos escolhidos antes do jogo, recusas, penalidades de torneio e muitas regras da casa.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Posso jogar com três amigos online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Não. Seus três oponentes são simples jogadores locais de computador. Não há conta, matchmaking ou multijogador online.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Minha oferta foi carregada ou salva on-line?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Nenhum dado do jogo foi carregado. Sua oferta atual é salva automaticamente neste navegador e neste dispositivo para que você possa retomá-la mais tarde.","Rules and limitations":"Regras e limitações","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Este é um jogo casual de prática local, não multijogador online, jogos de azar, cliente de torneio ou solucionador especializado. Ele usa a ordem de cartas do jogo normal DDV, as chamadas Re/Kontra e a resolução de casamento, mas não implementa solos selecionáveis, recusas como keine 90, penalidades de torneio, todas as regras especiais da mesa ou pontuação certificada de torneio. As três CPUs usam heurísticas simples de movimento legal e podem tomar decisões fracas.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Grátis para jogar. Cartões e pontuações permanecem neste navegador neste dispositivo; nenhum dado do jogo é carregado.","Play Doppelkopf":"Jogar Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Versoútil","All tools":"Todas as ferramentas","New deal":"Novo acordo","Resume saved deal":"Retomar negócio salvo","Delete saved deal":"Excluir negócio salvo","Choose New deal to begin.":"Escolha Novo acordo para começar.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Inicie um novo acordo ou retome o jogo salvo.","You":"Você","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Assento","Your hand":"Sua mão","Current trick":"Truque atual","Turn":"Turno","Re eyes":"Re olhos","Kontra eyes":"Contra olhos","Re tricks":"Retruques","Kontra tricks":"Truques de contraste","Match points":"Pontos de correspondência","Announce Re":"Anunciar Re","Announce Kontra":"Anunciar Kontra","Play selected card":"Jogar a carta selecionada","Select a card":"Selecione um cartão","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Contra","Team not yet known":"Equipe ainda não conhecida","Trick table":"Tabela de truques","Clubs":"Clubes","Spades":"Espadas","Hearts":"Corações","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Nine":"Nove","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Rainha","King":"Rei","Ten":"Dez","Ace":"Ás","second copy":"segunda cópia","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Sua vez. Escolha um cartão legal.","A computer player is thinking…":"Um jogador de computador está pensando…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Novo negócio pronto. Você lidera esta rodada de prática.","Selected card":"Cartão selecionado","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Essa jogada não é legal. Siga o exemplo ou trunfo quando possível.","Deal saved on this device.":"Oferta salva neste dispositivo.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"O salvamento local não está disponível neste navegador.","Saved deal resumed.":"Negócio salvo retomado.","Saved deal deleted.":"Negócio salvo excluído.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"O negócio salvo não pôde ser lido. Exclua-o e comece novamente.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Casamento: o primeiro outro jogador a vencer em três vazas torna-se o parceiro.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Casamento resolvido: o vencedor da brincadeira é o parceiro.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"O jogador do casamento venceu as três primeiras vazas. O acordo agora é um solo de diamante.","Re announced.":"Reanunciado.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra anunciado.","Re wins the deal.":"Re ganha o negócio.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra ganha o negócio.","Final eyes":"Olhos finais","Game points":"Pontos de jogo","Teams":"Equipes","Start another deal to play again.":"Inicie outro acordo para jogar novamente.","Rules reference":"Referência de regras","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Associação Alemã Doppelkopf · Regras do Torneio, 21 Fev 2026","Card":"Cartão","eyes":"olhos"},"ru":{"Doppelkopf":"Доппелькопф","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Бесплатная локальная карточная игра","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Сыграйте в тренировочную игру Doppelkopf для четырех человек против трех местных компьютерных игроков. Изучите команды, козыри, трюки и вызовы Re/Kontra. Бесплатно, без аккаунта.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Поиграйте в местную четырехместную игру Doppelkopf. Следуйте ведущей масти или козырю, когда можете, найдите команду Re через трефовых дам и попробуйте объявление Re или Kontra.","A quick example":"Краткий пример","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"В обычной игре два игрока, у которых есть трефовый ферзь, — это Re. Если у одного игрока есть обе, начинается свадьба: их партнером становится тот, кто первым выиграет взятку из первых трех.","How to play":"Как играть","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"В игре раздаются карты 48: по две копии туза, десятки, короля, дамы, валета и девятки в каждой масти. На каждое из четырех мест выдаются карты 12. Порядок козырей начинается с червовой десятки, затем дамы и валеты в порядке масти, за которыми следуют бубновые карты. Взятку выигрывает старший козырь или старшая карта ведущей масти, если козырь не разыгран. В игре есть карточные глаза 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","How many cards and players are there?":"Сколько здесь карт и игроков?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf здесь разыгрывается с четырьмя местами и картами 48: по две копии каждой лицевой стороны карты 24. На каждое место выдаются карты 12.","How are the teams found?":"Как находятся команды?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"В обычной игре два места, на которых находится трефовая королева, образуют Re; два других образуют Контру. Если на одном месте находятся обе трефовые королевы, правило свадьбы находит партнера во время первых трех взяток.","What happens during a wedding?":"Что происходит во время свадьбы?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Первое место, выигравшее одну из первых трех взяток, присоединится к Re. Если место на свадьбе выиграет все три, игра продолжается как бриллиантовое соло для одного игрока.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Какая карта самый сильный козырь?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Червовая десятка – высшая. Далее следуют дамы в порядке трефы, пики, червы, бубны, затем валеты в том же порядке мастей, затем бубновый туз, десятка, король и девятка.","Must I follow suit?":"Должен ли я последовать этому примеру?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Да. Если идет некозырная масть, разыгрывайте ее, когда можете. Если идет козырь, играйте козырем, когда можете. В противном случае выберите любую карту.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Что означают Ре и Контра?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Это названия двух команд. В течение разрешенного окна открытия игрок может объявить свою команду один раз. Вызов виден и меняет порог выигрыша и игровые очки.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Это полный свод правил турнира?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Нет. Это местная тренировочная версия обычной игры с вызовами Ре/Контры и правилом свадьбы. В нем не учитываются соло, выбранные перед игрой, отказы, турнирные штрафы и многие внутренние правила.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Могу ли я играть с тремя друзьями по сети?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Нет. Трое ваших противников — простые местные компьютерные игроки. Здесь нет учетной записи, подбора игроков или многопользовательской онлайн-игры.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Моя сделка загружена или сохранена в Интернете?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Данные игры не загружаются. Ваша текущая сделка автоматически сохраняется в браузере на этом устройстве, поэтому вы можете возобновить ее позже.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Это казуальная локальная тренировочная игра, а не многопользовательская онлайн-игра, азартные игры, турнирный клиент или экспертный решатель. Он использует порядок карт обычной игры DDV, вызовы Re / Kontra и разрешение свадьбы, но не реализует выбираемые соло, отказы, такие как keine 90, турнирные штрафы, все специальные правила стола или сертифицированный турнирный подсчет очков. Три процессора используют простую эвристику правильного хода и могут принимать слабые решения.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Играть можно бесплатно. Карты и результаты остаются в этом браузере на этом устройстве; никакие игровые данные не загружаются.","Play Doppelkopf":"Играть в Доппелькопф","Related tools":"Сопутствующие инструменты","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Language":"Язык","UsefulVerse":"Полезный стих","All tools":"Все инструменты","New deal":"Новая сделка","Resume saved deal":"Возобновить сохраненную сделку","Delete saved deal":"Удалить сохраненную сделку","Choose New deal to begin.":"Чтобы начать, выберите «Новая сделка».","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Начните новую сделку или возобновите сохраненную игру.","You":"Вы","CPU":"ЦП","Seat":"Сиденье","Your hand":"Ваша рука","Current trick":"Текущий трюк","Turn":"Поворот","Re eyes":"На глаза","Kontra eyes":"Контра глаза","Re tricks":"Повторные трюки","Kontra tricks":"Контра-трюки","Match points":"Матч-очки","Announce Re":"Объявить повторно","Announce Kontra":"Анонсировать Контру","Play selected card":"Разыграть выбранную карту","Select a card":"Выберите карту","Re":"Ре","Kontra":"Контра","Team not yet known":"Команда пока не известна","Trick table":"Трюк-стол","Clubs":"Клубы","Spades":"Пики","Hearts":"Сердца","Diamonds":"Бриллианты","Nine":"Девять","Jack":"Джек","Queen":"Королева","King":"Король","Ten":"Десять","Ace":"Ас","second copy":"вторая копия","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Твоя очередь. Выберите легальную карту.","A computer player is thinking…":"Компьютерный игрок думает…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Новая сделка готова. Вы проводите этот практический раунд.","Selected card":"Выбранная карта","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Эта игра незаконна. Следуйте их примеру или козырю, когда это возможно.","Deal saved on this device.":"Сделка сохранена на этом устройстве.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Локальное сохранение недоступно в этом браузере.","Saved deal resumed.":"Сохраненная сделка возобновлена.","Saved deal deleted.":"Сохраненная сделка удалена.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Сохраненную сделку невозможно прочитать. Удалите его и начните заново.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Свадьба: партнером становится тот, кто первым выиграет в пределах трех взяток.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Свадьба решена: победителем трюка становится партнер.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Свадебный игрок выиграл первые три взятки. Сделка теперь представляет собой бриллиантовое соло.","Re announced.":"Re объявлено.","Kontra announced.":"Контра анонсирована.","Re wins the deal.":"Re выигрывает сделку.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Контра выигрывает сделку.","Final eyes":"Последние глаза","Game points":"Игровые очки","Teams":"Команды","Start another deal to play again.":"Заключите еще одну сделку, чтобы сыграть снова.","Rules reference":"Справочник правил","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Немецкая ассоциация Doppelkopf · Правила турнира, 21 февраль 2026","Card":"Карта","eyes":"глаза"},"sv":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Gratis lokalt kortspel","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Spela ett Doppelkopf-träningsspel med fyra platser mot tre lokala datorspelare. Lär dig lag, trumf, trick och Re/Kontra synar. Gratis, inget konto.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Spela ett lokalt fyrsitsigt Doppelkopf-spel. Följ led-färgen eller trumf när du kan, hitta Re-laget genom klubbdrottningarna och prova ett Re- eller Kontra-meddelande.","A quick example":"Ett snabbt exempel","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"I ett normalt spel är de två spelarna som har en klubbdrottning Re. Om en spelare har båda startar ett bröllop: den första andra spelaren som vinner ett trick i de tre första blir deras partner.","How to play":"Hur man spelar","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Spelet delar ut 48-kort: två kopior av ess, tio, kung, dam, knekt och nio i varje färg. Var och en av fyra platser får 12-kort. Trump-ordningen börjar med hjärtat tio, sedan damerna och knektarna i färgordning, följt av diamantkorten. Ett stick vinner den högsta trumf, eller det högsta kortet i den led färgen om ingen trumf spelas. Spelet har 240 kortögon.","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","How many cards and players are there?":"Hur många kort och spelare finns det?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf spelas här med fyra platser och 48-kort: två kopior av var och en av 24-kortsidorna. Varje plats får 12-kort.","How are the teams found?":"Hur hittas lagen?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"I ett normalt spel bildar de två platserna med en klubbdrottning Re; de två andra bildar Kontra. Om en plats rymmer båda klubbdrottningarna, hittar bröllopsregeln en partner under de tre första sticken.","What happens during a wedding?":"Vad händer under ett bröllop?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Den första andra plats som vinner ett av de tre första tricken ansluter sig till Re. Om bröllopsplatsen vinner alla tre fortsätter spelet som ett diamantsolo för en spelare.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Vilket kort är det starkaste trumfet?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Hjärtat tio är högst. Damer följer i klöver, spader, hjärta, ruterordning, sedan knekt i samma färgordning, sedan ruter ess, tio, kung och nio.","Must I follow suit?":"Måste jag följa efter?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ja. Om en icke-trumf färg leds, spela den färgen när du kan. Om en trumf leds, spela en trumf när du kan. Annars väljer du vilket kort som helst.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Vad betyder Re och Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"De är namnen på de två lagen. Under det tillåtna öppningsfönstret kan en spelare meddela sitt lag en gång. Samtalet är synligt och ändrar vinstgränsen och spelpoäng.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Är detta hela turneringsreglerna?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Nr. Detta är en lokal övningsversion av normal lek med Re/Kontra-samtal och bröllopsregeln. Det utelämnar solon som valts före spel, avslag, turneringsstraff och många husregler.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Kan jag spela med tre vänner online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Nr. Dina tre motståndare är enkla lokala datorspelare. Det finns inget konto, matchmaking eller online multiplayer.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Har mitt erbjudande laddat upp eller sparat online?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Ingen speldata laddas upp. Ditt nuvarande erbjudande sparas automatiskt i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten så att du kan återuppta det senare.","Rules and limitations":"Regler och begränsningar","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Detta är ett avslappnat lokalt träningsspel, inte online multiplayer, hasardspel, en turneringsklient eller en expertlösare. Den använder DDV-kortordningen för normalspel, Re/Kontra-samtal och bröllopsupplösning, men implementerar inte valbara solon, avslag som keine 90, turneringsstraff, alla speciella bordsregler eller certifierade turneringspoäng. De tre processorerna använder enkel heuristik för legala rörelser och kan fatta svaga beslut.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis att spela. Kort och poäng stannar i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten; ingen speldata laddas upp.","Play Doppelkopf":"Spela Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN BLÄDDARE","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"Användbar vers","All tools":"Alla verktyg","New deal":"Ny affär","Resume saved deal":"Återuppta sparad affär","Delete saved deal":"Ta bort sparad affär","Choose New deal to begin.":"Välj Ny affär för att börja.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Starta en ny affär eller återuppta ditt sparade spel.","You":"Du","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Säte","Your hand":"Din hand","Current trick":"Aktuellt trick","Turn":"Vrid","Re eyes":"Re ögon","Kontra eyes":"Kontra ögon","Re tricks":"Re tricks","Kontra tricks":"Kontra-trick","Match points":"Matchpoäng","Announce Re":"Meddela Re","Announce Kontra":"Tillkännage Kontra","Play selected card":"Spela valt kort","Select a card":"Välj ett kort","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Team ännu inte känt","Trick table":"Trickbord","Clubs":"Klubbar","Spades":"Spader","Hearts":"Hjärtan","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Nine":"Nio","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Drottning","King":"Kung","Ten":"Tio","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"andra exemplaret","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Din tur. Välj ett lagligt kort.","A computer player is thinking…":"En datorspelare tänker...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Ny affär klar. Du leder denna träningsrunda.","Selected card":"Valgt kort","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Det spelet är inte lagligt. Följ färg eller trumf när det är möjligt.","Deal saved on this device.":"Affären sparad på den här enheten.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Lokal lagring är inte tillgänglig i den här webbläsaren.","Saved deal resumed.":"Sparad affär återupptas.","Saved deal deleted.":"Sparat erbjudande raderat.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Den sparade transaktionen kunde inte läsas. Ta bort den och börja om.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Bröllop: den första andra spelaren som vinner inom tre trick blir partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Bröllop löst: trickvinnaren är partnern.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Bröllopsspelaren vann de tre första sticken. Affären är nu ett diamantsolo.","Re announced.":"Re meddelat.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra meddelas.","Re wins the deal.":"Re vinner affären.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra vinner affären.","Final eyes":"Slutliga ögon","Game points":"Spelpoäng","Teams":"Team","Start another deal to play again.":"Starta en annan affär för att spela igen.","Rules reference":"Referens","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Tyska Doppelkopfförbundet · Turneringsregler, 21 feb 2026","Card":"Kort","eyes":"ögon"},"sw":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Mchezo Bila Malipo wa Kadi za Karibu","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Cheza mchezo wa mazoezi wa viti vinne wa Doppelkopf dhidi ya wachezaji watatu wa ndani wa kompyuta. Jifunze timu, tarumbeta, mbinu na simu za Re/Kontra. Bure, hakuna akaunti.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Cheza mchezo wa ndani wa Doppelkopf wa viti vinne. Fuata suti iliyoongozwa au tarumbeta unapoweza, tafuta timu ya Re kupitia klabu ya malkia, na ujaribu tangazo la Re au Kontra.","A quick example":"Mfano wa haraka","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Katika mchezo wa kawaida, wachezaji wawili wanaomiliki malkia wa klabu ni Re. Ikiwa mchezaji mmoja anashikilia wote wawili, harusi huanza: mchezaji mwingine wa kwanza kushinda hila katika tatu za kwanza anakuwa mpenzi wao.","How to play":"Jinsi ya kucheza","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Kadi za mchezo wa 48: nakala mbili za ace, kumi, mfalme, malkia, jack na tisa katika kila suti. Kila moja ya viti vinne hupata kadi za 12. Agizo la Trump huanza na moyo kumi, kisha malkia na Jacks kwa mpangilio wa suti, ikifuatiwa na kadi za almasi. Ujanja hushinda kwa tarumbeta ya juu zaidi, au kadi ya juu zaidi ya suti inayoongozwa ikiwa hakuna tarumbeta inayochezwa. Mchezo una macho ya kadi ya 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","How many cards and players are there?":"Je, kuna kadi na wachezaji wangapi?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf inachezwa hapa ikiwa na viti vinne na kadi 48: nakala mbili za kila nyuso za kadi 24. Kila kiti hupokea kadi za 12.","How are the teams found?":"Je, timu zinapatikanaje?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Katika mchezo wa kawaida, viti viwili vinavyoshikilia malkia wa klabu vinaunda Re; nyingine mbili zinaunda Kontra. Ikiwa kiti kimoja kinashikilia malkia wote wa klabu, sheria ya harusi hupata mpenzi wakati wa mbinu tatu za kwanza.","What happens during a wedding?":"Ni nini hufanyika wakati wa harusi?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Kiti kingine cha kwanza kushinda moja ya hila tatu za kwanza kinaungana na Re. Ikiwa kiti cha harusi kitashinda zote tatu, mchezo unaendelea kama solo ya almasi ya mchezaji mmoja.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Turufu kali zaidi ni kadi gani?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Moyo kumi ni wa juu zaidi. Queens hufuata kwa kilabu, jembe, moyo, mpangilio wa almasi, kisha jeki kwa mpangilio wa suti sawa, kisha almasi Ace, kumi, mfalme na tisa.","Must I follow suit?":"Je, ni lazima nifuate mfano huo?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Ndiyo. Ikiwa suti isiyo ya tarumbeta inaongozwa, cheza suti hiyo wakati unaweza. Ikiwa tarumbeta inaongozwa, piga tarumbeta unapoweza. Vinginevyo, chagua kadi yoyote.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re na Kontra wanamaanisha nini?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Ni majina ya timu hizo mbili. Wakati wa dirisha linaloruhusiwa la ufunguzi, mchezaji anaweza kutangaza timu yake mara moja. Simu inaonekana na kubadilisha kiwango cha kushinda na pointi za mchezo.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Je, hii ndiyo kanuni kamili ya mashindano?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Na. Hili ni toleo la mazoezi la ndani la uchezaji wa kawaida na simu za Re/Kontra na sheria ya harusi. Inaacha solo zilizochaguliwa kabla ya kucheza, kukataa, adhabu za mashindano na sheria nyingi za nyumbani.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Je, ninaweza kucheza na marafiki watatu mtandaoni?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Na. Wapinzani wako watatu ni wachezaji wa kawaida wa kompyuta. Hakuna akaunti, ulinganishaji au wachezaji wengi mtandaoni.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Je, ofa yangu imepakiwa au kuhifadhiwa mtandaoni?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Hakuna data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa. Ofa yako ya sasa itahifadhiwa kiotomatiki katika kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki ili uweze kuirejesha baadaye.","Rules and limitations":"Sheria na mapungufu","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Huu ni mchezo wa kawaida wa mazoezi ya ndani, si wachezaji wengi mtandaoni, kamari, mteja wa mashindano au mtaalamu wa kutatua. Inatumia mpangilio wa kadi ya mchezo wa kawaida wa DDV, simu za Re/Kontra na azimio la harusi, lakini haitekelezi pekee zinazoweza kuchaguliwa, kukataliwa kama vile keine 90, adhabu za mashindano, sheria zote za jedwali maalum au alama za mashindano zilizoidhinishwa. CPU tatu hutumia mbinu rahisi za kusogeza za kisheria na zinaweza kufanya maamuzi dhaifu.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Bila kucheza. Kadi na alama hukaa kwenye kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki; hakuna data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa.","Play Doppelkopf":"Cheza Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Zana zinazohusiana","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Language":"Lugha","UsefulVerse":"MuhimuVerse","All tools":"Vyombo vyote","New deal":"Mkataba mpya","Resume saved deal":"Rejesha mpango uliohifadhiwa","Delete saved deal":"Futa mpango uliohifadhiwa","Choose New deal to begin.":"Chagua ofa Mpya ili kuanza.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Anzisha ofa mpya au uendelee na mchezo wako uliouhifadhi.","You":"Wewe","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Kiti","Your hand":"Mkono wako","Current trick":"Ujanja wa sasa","Turn":"Washa","Re eyes":"Macho tena","Kontra eyes":"Macho ya Kontra","Re tricks":"Ujanja tena","Kontra tricks":"Ujanja wa Kontra","Match points":"Alama za mechi","Announce Re":"Tangaza Re","Announce Kontra":"Tangaza Kontra","Play selected card":"Cheza kadi iliyochaguliwa","Select a card":"Chagua kadi","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Timu bado haijajulikana","Trick table":"Jedwali la hila","Clubs":"Vilabu","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"Mioyo","Diamonds":"Almasi","Nine":"Tisa","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Malkia","King":"Mfalme","Ten":"Kumi","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"nakala ya pili","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Zamu yako. Chagua kadi ya kisheria.","A computer player is thinking…":"Mchezaji wa kompyuta anafikiria...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Ofa mpya tayari. Unaongoza mazoezi haya pande zote.","Selected card":"Kadi iliyochaguliwa","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Uchezaji huo si halali. Fuata suti au tarumbeta inapowezekana.","Deal saved on this device.":"Ofa imehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Uhifadhi wa ndani haupatikani katika kivinjari hiki.","Saved deal resumed.":"Mkataba uliohifadhiwa umeanza tena.","Saved deal deleted.":"Ofa iliyohifadhiwa imefutwa.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Ofa iliyohifadhiwa haikuweza kusomeka. Ifute na uanze tena.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Harusi: mchezaji mwingine wa kwanza kushinda ndani ya mbinu tatu anakuwa mshirika.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Harusi imetatuliwa: mshindi wa hila ni mshirika.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Mchezaji wa harusi alishinda mbinu tatu za kwanza. Mkataba huo sasa ni solo wa almasi.","Re announced.":"Imetangazwa tena.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra ilitangazwa.","Re wins the deal.":"Re atashinda mpango huo.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra atashinda mpango huo.","Final eyes":"Macho ya mwisho","Game points":"Pointi za mchezo","Teams":"Timu","Start another deal to play again.":"Anzisha dili lingine ili ucheze tena.","Rules reference":"Marejeleo ya Kanuni","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Chama cha Doppelkopf cha Ujerumani · Sheria za Mashindano, 21 Feb 2026","Card":"Kadi","eyes":"macho"},"ta":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf ஆன்லைன் — இலவச உள்ளூர் அட்டை விளையாட்டு","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"மூன்று உள்ளூர் கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர்களுக்கு எதிராக நான்கு இருக்கைகள் கொண்ட டாப்பெல்காப் பயிற்சி விளையாட்டை விளையாடுங்கள். அணிகள், டிரம்ப்கள், தந்திரங்கள் மற்றும் Re/Kontra அழைப்புகளைக் கற்றுக்கொள்ளுங்கள். இலவசம், கணக்கு இல்லை.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"உள்ளூர் நான்கு இருக்கைகள் கொண்ட Doppelkopf விளையாட்டை விளையாடுங்கள். உங்களால் முடிந்தவரை லெட் சூட் அல்லது டிரம்பைப் பின்தொடரவும், கிளப் குயின்ஸ் மூலம் ரீ அணியைக் கண்டுபிடித்து, ரீ அல்லது கான்ட்ரா அறிவிப்பை முயற்சிக்கவும்.","A quick example":"விரைவான உதாரணம்","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"ஒரு சாதாரண விளையாட்டில், ஒரு கிளப் ராணியை வைத்திருக்கும் இரண்டு வீரர்கள் ரீ. ஒரு வீரர் இரண்டையும் வைத்திருந்தால், ஒரு திருமணம் தொடங்குகிறது: முதல் மூன்றில் ஒரு தந்திரத்தை வென்ற முதல் மற்ற வீரர் அவர்களின் பங்குதாரராவார்.","How to play":"எப்படி விளையாடுவது","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"இந்த விளையாட்டு 48 கார்டுகளை வழங்குகிறது: ஒவ்வொரு உடையிலும் சீட்டு, பத்து, ராஜா, ராணி, பலா மற்றும் ஒன்பது ஆகியவற்றின் இரண்டு பிரதிகள். நான்கு இருக்கைகள் ஒவ்வொன்றும் 12 கார்டுகளைப் பெறுகின்றன. ட்ரம்ப் ஆர்டர் ஹார்ட் டென் என்று தொடங்குகிறது, பின்னர் ராணிகள் மற்றும் ஜாக்ஸ் சூட் வரிசையில், அதைத் தொடர்ந்து வைர அட்டைகள். ஒரு தந்திரம் அதிக டிரம்ப் அல்லது ட்ரம்ப் விளையாடவில்லை என்றால் லெட் சூட்டின் மிக உயர்ந்த அட்டையால் வெல்லப்படுகிறது. கேமில் 240 அட்டைக் கண்கள் உள்ளன.","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","How many cards and players are there?":"எத்தனை கார்டுகள் மற்றும் பிளேயர்கள் உள்ளன?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf இங்கே நான்கு இருக்கைகள் மற்றும் 48 கார்டுகளுடன் விளையாடப்படுகிறது: 24 அட்டை முகங்களின் ஒவ்வொன்றின் இரண்டு நகல்களும். ஒவ்வொரு இருக்கையும் 12 கார்டுகளைப் பெறுகிறது.","How are the teams found?":"அணிகள் எவ்வாறு கண்டறியப்படுகின்றன?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"ஒரு சாதாரண விளையாட்டில், ஒரு கிளப் ராணியை வைத்திருக்கும் இரண்டு இருக்கைகள் ரீவை உருவாக்குகின்றன; மற்ற இரண்டும் கான்ட்ராவை உருவாக்குகின்றன. ஒரு இருக்கையில் இரண்டு கிளப் ராணிகளும் இருந்தால், திருமண விதி முதல் மூன்று தந்திரங்களின் போது ஒரு கூட்டாளரைக் கண்டுபிடிக்கும்.","What happens during a wedding?":"திருமணத்தின் போது என்ன நடக்கிறது?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"முதல் மூன்று தந்திரங்களில் ஒன்றை வென்ற முதல் மற்ற இருக்கை ரீ. திருமண இருக்கை மூன்றிலும் வெற்றி பெற்றால், விளையாட்டு ஒரு வீரர் வைர தனிப்பாடலாக தொடரும்.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"எந்த அட்டை வலிமையான டிரம்ப்?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"இதயம் பத்து உயர்ந்தது. ராணிகள் கிளப், ஸ்பேட், ஹார்ட், டயமண்ட் ஆர்டரைப் பின்தொடர்கிறார்கள், பின்னர் அதே சூட் வரிசையில் ஜாக்ஸ், பின்னர் வைர சீட்டு, பத்து, கிங் மற்றும் ஒன்பது.","Must I follow suit?":"நான் இதைப் பின்பற்ற வேண்டுமா?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"ஆம். டிரம்ப் அல்லாத சூட் அணிவகுத்தால், உங்களால் முடிந்தவரை அந்த உடையை விளையாடுங்கள். ஒரு டிரம்ப் வழிநடத்தப்பட்டால், உங்களால் முடிந்தவரை டிரம்பை விளையாடுங்கள். இல்லையெனில், எந்த அட்டையையும் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"ரீ மற்றும் கான்ட்ரா என்றால் என்ன?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"அவை இரண்டு அணிகளின் பெயர்கள். அனுமதிக்கப்பட்ட தொடக்க சாளரத்தின் போது, ​​ஒரு வீரர் தனது அணியை ஒருமுறை அறிவிக்கலாம். அழைப்பு தெரியும் மற்றும் வெற்றி வரம்பு மற்றும் விளையாட்டு புள்ளிகளை மாற்றுகிறது.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"இது முழு போட்டி விதியா?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"எண். இது ரீ/கான்ட்ரா அழைப்புகள் மற்றும் திருமண விதியுடன் கூடிய சாதாரண விளையாட்டின் உள்ளூர் நடைமுறைப் பதிப்பாகும். இது விளையாடுவதற்கு முன் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட தனிப்பாடல்கள், மறுப்புகள், போட்டித் தண்டனைகள் மற்றும் பல வீட்டு விதிகளை விட்டுவிடுகிறது.","Can I play with three friends online?":"மூன்று நண்பர்களுடன் ஆன்லைனில் விளையாடலாமா?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"எண். உங்கள் மூன்று எதிரிகளும் எளிய உள்ளூர் கணினி பிளேயர்கள். கணக்கு, மேட்ச்மேக்கிங் அல்லது ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர் எதுவும் இல்லை.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"எனது ஒப்பந்தம் ஆன்லைனில் பதிவேற்றப்பட்டதா அல்லது சேமிக்கப்பட்டதா?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"கேம் தரவு பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை. உங்களின் தற்போதைய ஒப்பந்தம் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் உள்ள இந்த உலாவியில் தானாகச் சேமிக்கப்படும், எனவே நீங்கள் அதை பின்னர் தொடரலாம்.","Rules and limitations":"விதிகளும் வரம்புகளும்","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"இது ஒரு சாதாரண உள்ளூர் பயிற்சி விளையாட்டு, ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர், சூதாட்டம், ஒரு டோர்னமென்ட் கிளையன்ட் அல்லது நிபுணத்துவம் வாய்ந்த தீர்வு அல்ல. இது DDV நார்மல்-கேம் கார்டு ஆர்டர், ரீ/கான்ட்ரா அழைப்புகள் மற்றும் திருமணத் தீர்மானம் ஆகியவற்றைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது, ஆனால் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய தனிப்பாடல்கள், கெய்ன் 90, போட்டித் தண்டனைகள், அனைத்து சிறப்பு அட்டவணை விதிகள் அல்லது சான்றளிக்கப்பட்ட போட்டி ஸ்கோரிங் போன்ற மறுப்புகளைச் செயல்படுத்தாது. மூன்று CPUகள் எளிமையான சட்ட-மூவ் ஹூரிஸ்டிக்ஸைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன மற்றும் பலவீனமான முடிவுகளை எடுக்கலாம்.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"இலவசமாக விளையாடலாம். கார்டுகளும் மதிப்பெண்களும் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்; விளையாட்டு தரவு பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf விளையாடு","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Language":"மொழி","UsefulVerse":"பயனுள்ள வசனம்","All tools":"அனைத்து கருவிகளும்","New deal":"புதிய ஒப்பந்தம்","Resume saved deal":"சேமித்த ஒப்பந்தத்தை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","Delete saved deal":"சேமித்த ஒப்பந்தத்தை நீக்கவும்","Choose New deal to begin.":"தொடங்க புதிய ஒப்பந்தத்தைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"புதிய ஒப்பந்தத்தைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேமித்த விளையாட்டை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","You":"நீங்கள்","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"இருக்கை","Your hand":"உங்கள் கை","Current trick":"தற்போதைய தந்திரம்","Turn":"திருப்பு","Re eyes":"ரீ கண்கள்","Kontra eyes":"கான்ட்ரா கண்கள்","Re tricks":"ரீ ட்ரிக்ஸ்","Kontra tricks":"கான்ட்ரா தந்திரங்கள்","Match points":"மேட்ச் புள்ளிகள்","Announce Re":"அறிவிக்கவும்","Announce Kontra":"கான்ட்ராவை அறிவிக்கவும்","Play selected card":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கார்டை இயக்கவும்","Select a card":"கார்டைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்","Re":"Re","Kontra":"கான்ட்ரா","Team not yet known":"அணி இன்னும் தெரியவில்லை","Trick table":"தந்திர அட்டவணை","Clubs":"கிளப்புகள்","Spades":"ஸ்பேட்ஸ்","Hearts":"இதயங்கள்","Diamonds":"வைரங்கள்","Nine":"ஒன்பது","Jack":"ஜாக்","Queen":"ராணி","King":"ராஜா","Ten":"பத்து","Ace":"ஏஸ்","second copy":"இரண்டாம் நகல்","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"உங்கள் முறை. சட்ட அட்டையைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","A computer player is thinking…":"ஒரு கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர் யோசிக்கிறார்...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"புதிய ஒப்பந்தம் தயாராக உள்ளது. இந்த பயிற்சியை நீங்கள் வழிநடத்துங்கள்.","Selected card":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட அட்டை","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"அந்த நாடகம் சட்டப்பூர்வமானது அல்ல. முடிந்தால் சூட் அல்லது டிரம்பை பின்பற்றவும்.","Deal saved on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் ஒப்பந்தம் சேமிக்கப்பட்டது.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"உள்ளூர் சேமிப்பு இந்த உலாவியில் இல்லை.","Saved deal resumed.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட ஒப்பந்தம் மீண்டும் தொடங்கப்பட்டது.","Saved deal deleted.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட ஒப்பந்தம் நீக்கப்பட்டது.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"சேமித்த ஒப்பந்தத்தைப் படிக்க முடியவில்லை. அதை நீக்கிவிட்டு மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"திருமணம்: மூன்று தந்திரங்களுக்குள் வெற்றிபெறும் முதல் மற்ற வீரர் பங்குதாரராவார்.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"திருமணம் தீர்க்கப்பட்டது: தந்திர வெற்றியாளர் பங்குதாரர்.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"திருமண வீரர் முதல் மூன்று தந்திரங்களை வென்றார். ஒப்பந்தம் இப்போது ஒரு வைரம் தனி.","Re announced.":"Re அறிவித்தது.","Kontra announced.":"கான்ட்ரா அறிவித்தது.","Re wins the deal.":"ரீ ஒப்பந்தத்தை வென்றார்.","Kontra wins the deal.":"கான்ட்ரா ஒப்பந்தத்தை வென்றார்.","Final eyes":"இறுதிக் கண்கள்","Game points":"கேம் புள்ளிகள்","Teams":"அணிகள்","Start another deal to play again.":"மீண்டும் விளையாட மற்றொரு ஒப்பந்தத்தைத் தொடங்கவும்.","Rules reference":"விதிகளின் குறிப்பு","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"ஜெர்மன் டாப்பெல்காப் அசோசியேஷன் · போட்டி விதிகள், 21 பிப்ரவரி 2026","Card":"அட்டை","eyes":"கண்கள்"},"te":{"Doppelkopf":"డోపెల్‌కాఫ్","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf ఆన్‌లైన్ — ఉచిత స్థానిక కార్డ్ గేమ్","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"ముగ్గురు స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్‌లతో నాలుగు సీట్ల డోపెల్‌కాఫ్ ప్రాక్టీస్ గేమ్ ఆడండి. జట్లు, ట్రంప్‌లు, ట్రిక్స్ మరియు రీ/కాంట్రా కాల్‌లను నేర్చుకోండి. ఉచితం, ఖాతా లేదు.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"స్థానిక నాలుగు-సీట్ల డోపెల్‌కాఫ్ గేమ్ ఆడండి. మీకు వీలైనప్పుడు లీడ్ సూట్ లేదా ట్రంప్‌ను అనుసరించండి, క్లబ్ క్వీన్స్ ద్వారా రీ టీమ్‌ను కనుగొని, రీ లేదా కాంట్రా ప్రకటనను ప్రయత్నించండి.","A quick example":"సత్వర ఉదాహరణ","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"ఒక సాధారణ గేమ్‌లో, క్లబ్ క్వీన్‌ను కలిగి ఉన్న ఇద్దరు క్రీడాకారులు రీ. ఒక ఆటగాడు రెండింటినీ పట్టుకున్నట్లయితే, వివాహం ప్రారంభమవుతుంది: మొదటి మూడింటిలో ట్రిక్ గెలిచిన మొదటి ఇతర ఆటగాడు వారి భాగస్వామి అవుతాడు.","How to play":"ఎలా ఆడాలి","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"ఆట 48 కార్డ్‌లను డీల్ చేస్తుంది: ప్రతి సూట్‌లో ఏస్, పది, రాజు, రాణి, జాక్ మరియు తొమ్మిది యొక్క రెండు కాపీలు. ప్రతి నాలుగు సీట్లు 12 కార్డ్‌లను పొందుతాయి. ట్రంప్ ఆర్డర్ గుండె పదితో మొదలవుతుంది, తర్వాత క్వీన్స్ మరియు జాక్‌లు సూట్ ఆర్డర్‌లో ఉంటాయి, తర్వాత డైమండ్ కార్డ్‌లు ఉంటాయి. ఒక ట్రిక్ అత్యధిక ట్రంప్ ద్వారా గెలుపొందుతుంది, లేదా ట్రంప్ ఆడకపోతే లెడ్ సూట్ యొక్క అత్యధిక కార్డ్. గేమ్ 240 కార్డ్ కళ్ళు కలిగి ఉంది.","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","How many cards and players are there?":"ఎన్ని కార్డ్‌లు మరియు ప్లేయర్‌లు ఉన్నాయి?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf ఇక్కడ నాలుగు సీట్లు మరియు 48 కార్డ్‌లతో ప్లే చేయబడుతుంది: 24 కార్డ్ ఫేసెస్‌లో ఒక్కొక్కటి రెండు కాపీలు. ప్రతి సీటు 12 కార్డ్‌లను అందుకుంటుంది.","How are the teams found?":"జట్లు ఎలా కనుగొనబడ్డాయి?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"ఒక సాధారణ గేమ్‌లో, క్లబ్ క్వీన్‌ను కలిగి ఉన్న రెండు సీట్లు Re రూపంలో ఉంటాయి; మిగిలిన రెండు కాంట్రాను ఏర్పరుస్తాయి. ఒక సీటు రెండు క్లబ్ క్వీన్‌లను కలిగి ఉంటే, వివాహ నియమం మొదటి మూడు ట్రిక్స్ సమయంలో భాగస్వామిని కనుగొంటుంది.","What happens during a wedding?":"పెళ్లి సమయంలో ఏమి జరుగుతుంది?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"మొదటి మూడు ట్రిక్స్‌లలో ఒకదానిని గెలుచుకున్న మొదటి ఇతర సీటు రీలో చేరింది. పెళ్లి సీటు మూడింటిలో గెలిస్తే, గేమ్ వన్-ప్లేయర్ డైమండ్ సోలోగా కొనసాగుతుంది.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"బలమైన ట్రంప్ ఏ కార్డ్?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"హృదయం పది ఎత్తైనది. క్వీన్స్ క్లబ్, స్పేడ్, హార్ట్, డైమండ్ ఆర్డర్, తర్వాత అదే సూట్ ఆర్డర్‌లో జాక్‌లు, ఆ తర్వాత డైమండ్ ఏస్, టెన్, కింగ్ మరియు నైన్‌లను అనుసరిస్తారు.","Must I follow suit?":"నేను దానిని అనుసరించాలా?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"అవును. నాన్-ట్రంప్ సూట్ లీడ్ అయితే, మీకు వీలైనప్పుడు ఆ సూట్ ఆడండి. ఒక ట్రంప్ నాయకత్వం వహిస్తే, మీకు వీలైనప్పుడు ట్రంప్ వాయించండి. లేకపోతే, ఏదైనా కార్డును ఎంచుకోండి.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"రే మరియు కాంట్రా అంటే ఏమిటి?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"అవి రెండు జట్ల పేర్లు. అనుమతించబడిన ప్రారంభ విండో సమయంలో, ఆటగాడు వారి జట్టును ఒకసారి ప్రకటించవచ్చు. కాల్ కనిపిస్తుంది మరియు విన్ థ్రెషోల్డ్ మరియు గేమ్ పాయింట్‌లను మారుస్తుంది.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"ఇది పూర్తి టోర్నమెంట్ రూల్ సెట్ కాదా?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"నం. ఇది రీ/కాంట్రా కాల్‌లు మరియు వివాహ నియమంతో సాధారణ ఆట యొక్క స్థానిక అభ్యాస వెర్షన్. ఇది ఆట, తిరస్కరణలు, టోర్నమెంట్ పెనాల్టీలు మరియు అనేక గృహ నియమాలకు ముందు ఎంపిక చేయబడిన సోలోలను వదిలివేస్తుంది.","Can I play with three friends online?":"నేను ముగ్గురు స్నేహితులతో ఆన్‌లైన్‌లో ఆడవచ్చా?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"నం. మీ ముగ్గురు ప్రత్యర్థులు సాధారణ స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్‌లు. ఖాతా, మ్యాచ్ మేకింగ్ లేదా ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్ లేదు.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"నా డీల్ ఆన్‌లైన్‌లో అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడిందా లేదా సేవ్ చేయబడిందా?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"గేమ్ డేటా అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు. మీ ప్రస్తుత ఒప్పందం ఈ పరికరంలోని ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్వయంచాలకంగా సేవ్ చేయబడుతుంది కాబట్టి మీరు దీన్ని తర్వాత పునఃప్రారంభించవచ్చు.","Rules and limitations":"నియమాలు మరియు పరిమితులు","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"ఇది సాధారణ స్థానిక ప్రాక్టీస్ గేమ్, ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్, జూదం, టోర్నమెంట్ క్లయింట్ లేదా నిపుణులైన సాల్వర్ కాదు. ఇది DDV సాధారణ-గేమ్ కార్డ్ ఆర్డర్, Re/Kontra కాల్‌లు మరియు వివాహ రిజల్యూషన్‌ని ఉపయోగిస్తుంది, కానీ ఎంపిక చేసుకోదగిన సోలోలు, కీన్ 90 వంటి తిరస్కరణలు, టోర్నమెంట్ పెనాల్టీలు, అన్ని ప్రత్యేక పట్టిక నియమాలు లేదా ధృవీకరించబడిన టోర్నమెంట్ స్కోరింగ్‌లను అమలు చేయదు. మూడు CPUలు సాధారణ చట్టపరమైన-మూవ్ హ్యూరిస్టిక్‌లను ఉపయోగిస్తాయి మరియు బలహీనమైన నిర్ణయాలు తీసుకోవచ్చు.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ప్లే చేయడానికి ఉచితం. కార్డ్‌లు మరియు స్కోర్‌లు ఈ పరికరంలో ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి; గేమ్ డేటా అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf ప్లే చేయండి","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Language":"భాష","UsefulVerse":"ఉపయోగకరమైన పద్యం","All tools":"అన్ని సాధనాలు","New deal":"కొత్త డీల్","Resume saved deal":"సేవ్ చేసిన ఒప్పందాన్ని పునఃప్రారంభించండి","Delete saved deal":"సేవ్ చేసిన ఒప్పందాన్ని తొలగించండి","Choose New deal to begin.":"ప్రారంభించడానికి కొత్త ఒప్పందాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"కొత్త డీల్‌ని ప్రారంభించండి లేదా మీరు సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను పునఃప్రారంభించండి.","You":"మీరు","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"సీటు","Your hand":"మీ చేతి","Current trick":"ప్రస్తుత ట్రిక్","Turn":"మలుపు","Re eyes":"రీ కళ్ళు","Kontra eyes":"కాంట్రా కళ్ళు","Re tricks":"రీ ట్రిక్స్","Kontra tricks":"కాంట్రా ట్రిక్స్","Match points":"మ్యాచ్ పాయింట్లు","Announce Re":"ప్రకటించండి","Announce Kontra":"కాంట్రాను ప్రకటించండి","Play selected card":"ఎంచుకున్న కార్డ్‌ని ప్లే చేయండి","Select a card":"కార్డ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి","Re":"Re","Kontra":"కాంట్రా","Team not yet known":"జట్టు ఇంకా తెలియదు","Trick table":"ట్రిక్ టేబుల్","Clubs":"క్లబ్‌లు","Spades":"స్పేడ్స్","Hearts":"హార్ట్స్","Diamonds":"డైమండ్స్","Nine":"తొమ్మిది","Jack":"జాక్","Queen":"క్వీన్","King":"రాజు","Ten":"పది","Ace":"ఏస్","second copy":"రెండవ కాపీ","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"మీ వంతు. చట్టపరమైన కార్డ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","A computer player is thinking…":"ఒక కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్ ఆలోచిస్తున్నాడు...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"కొత్త డీల్ సిద్ధంగా ఉంది. మీరు ఈ ప్రాక్టీస్ రౌండ్‌కు నాయకత్వం వహించండి.","Selected card":"ఎంచుకున్న కార్డ్","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"ఆ ఆట చట్టపరమైనది కాదు. సాధ్యమైనప్పుడు సూట్ లేదా ట్రంప్‌ని అనుసరించండి.","Deal saved on this device.":"ఈ పరికరంలో డీల్ సేవ్ చేయబడింది.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్థానిక సేవింగ్ అందుబాటులో లేదు.","Saved deal resumed.":"సేవ్ చేసిన డీల్ మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Saved deal deleted.":"సేవ్ చేసిన డీల్ తొలగించబడింది.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"సేవ్ చేసిన డీల్ చదవడం సాధ్యం కాలేదు. దాన్ని తొలగించి మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించండి.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"పెళ్లి: మూడు ఉపాయాలలో గెలిచిన మొదటి ఇతర ఆటగాడు భాగస్వామి అవుతాడు.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"పెళ్లి పరిష్కరించబడింది: ట్రిక్ విజేత భాగస్వామి.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"వెడ్డింగ్ ప్లేయర్ మొదటి మూడు ట్రిక్‌లను గెలుచుకున్నాడు. ఈ ఒప్పందం ఇప్పుడు డైమండ్ సోలోగా మారింది.","Re announced.":"Re ప్రకటించింది.","Kontra announced.":"కాంట్రా ప్రకటించింది.","Re wins the deal.":"రీ డీల్‌ను గెలుచుకుంది.","Kontra wins the deal.":"కాంట్రా డీల్‌ను గెలుచుకుంది.","Final eyes":"ఫైనల్ కళ్ళు","Game points":"గేమ్ పాయింట్లు","Teams":"జట్లు","Start another deal to play again.":"మళ్లీ ఆడటానికి మరొక ఒప్పందాన్ని ప్రారంభించండి.","Rules reference":"నియమాల సూచన","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"జర్మన్ డోపెల్‌కాఫ్ అసోసియేషన్ · టోర్నమెంట్ నియమాలు, 21 ఫిబ్రవరి 2026","Card":"కార్డ్","eyes":"కళ్ళు"},"th":{"Doppelkopf":"ดอปเปลคอฟ","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — เกมไพ่ท้องถิ่นฟรี","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"เล่นเกมฝึกซ้อม Doppelkopf สี่ที่นั่งกับผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่สามคน เรียนรู้ทีม สิ่งสำคัญ เคล็ดลับ และการโทรของ Re/Kontra ฟรีไม่มีบัญชี","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"เล่นเกม Doppelkopf สี่ที่นั่งในพื้นที่ ติดตามชุดสูทนำหรือทรัมป์เมื่อทำได้ ค้นหาทีม Re ผ่านคลับควีน และลองประกาศ Re หรือ Kontra","A quick example":"ตัวอย่างสั้นๆ","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"ในเกมปกติ ผู้เล่นสองคนที่ครองคลับควีนคือ Re. หากผู้เล่นคนใดคนหนึ่งถือทั้งคู่ งานแต่งงานจะเริ่มต้นขึ้น ผู้เล่นคนแรกที่ชนะเคล็ดลับในสามคนแรกจะกลายเป็นคู่ของพวกเขา","How to play":"วิธีการเล่น","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"เกมนี้แจกไพ่ 48: เอซ สิบ คิง ควีน แจ็ค และเก้าสองใบในแต่ละดอก แต่ละที่นั่งทั้งสี่จะได้รับการ์ด 12 คำสั่งของทรัมป์เริ่มต้นด้วยไพ่หัวใจสิบ ตามด้วยไพ่ควีนและแจ็คตามลำดับ ตามด้วยไพ่เพชร เคล็ดลับจะชนะโดยคนที่กล้าหาญสูงสุดหรือไพ่สูงสุดของชุดนำหากไม่มีคนดีเล่น เกมดังกล่าวมีดวงตาการ์ด 240","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","How many cards and players are there?":"มีการ์ดและผู้เล่นกี่คน?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf เล่นที่นี่โดยมีสี่ที่นั่งและการ์ด 48: สองสำเนาของหน้าการ์ด 24 อย่างละสองชุด แต่ละที่นั่งจะได้รับการ์ด 12","How are the teams found?":"หาทีมเจอได้อย่างไร?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"ในเกมปกติ สองที่นั่งถือ club queen จาก Re; อีกสองรูปแบบคอนทรา หากที่นั่งเดียวจุราชินีคลับทั้งสองคน กฎการแต่งงานจะหาคู่ในช่วงสามเทคนิคแรก","What happens during a wedding?":"จะเกิดอะไรขึ้นระหว่างงานแต่งงาน?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"อีกที่นั่งแรกที่ชนะหนึ่งในสามเทคนิคแรกจะเข้าร่วมกับ Re หากที่นั่งแต่งงานชนะทั้งสามเกม เกมจะดำเนินต่อไปในรูปแบบไดมอนด์โซโลสำหรับผู้เล่นคนเดียว","Which card is the strongest trump?":"ไพ่ใบไหนคือทรัมป์ที่แข็งแกร่งที่สุด?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"หัวใจสิบสูงที่สุด ควีนส์ตามมาด้วยดอกจิก โพดำ หัวใจ ลำดับเพชร จากนั้นแจ็คตามลำดับดอกเดียวกัน ตามมาด้วยเอซเพชร สิบ คิง และเก้า","Must I follow suit?":"ฉันต้องปฏิบัติตามหรือไม่","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"ใช่ หากมีคนนำชุดที่ไม่ใช่ทรัมป์ ให้เล่นชุดนั้นเมื่อทำได้ หากมีผู้นำทรัมป์ ให้เล่นทรัมป์เมื่อทำได้ มิฉะนั้น ให้เลือกการ์ดใดก็ได้","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re และ Kontra หมายถึงอะไร","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"เป็นชื่อของทั้งสองทีม ระหว่างหน้าต่างเปิดที่อนุญาต ผู้เล่นสามารถประกาศทีมของตนได้หนึ่งครั้ง มองเห็นการโทรและเปลี่ยนเกณฑ์การชนะและคะแนนเกม","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"นี่คือกฎของทัวร์นาเมนต์ทั้งหมดใช่ไหม?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"No. นี่คือเวอร์ชันฝึกซ้อมในท้องถิ่นของการเล่นปกติพร้อมการเรียก Re/Kontra และกฎการแต่งงาน โดยจะตัดโซโลที่เลือกไว้ก่อนเล่น การปฏิเสธ บทลงโทษของทัวร์นาเมนต์ และกฎบ้านอื่นๆ","Can I play with three friends online?":"ฉันสามารถเล่นกับเพื่อนสามคนออนไลน์ได้ไหม?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"No. คู่ต่อสู้ทั้งสามของคุณเป็นผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ธรรมดา ไม่มีบัญชี การจับคู่ หรือผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"ข้อตกลงของฉันถูกอัพโหลดหรือบันทึกออนไลน์หรือไม่?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"ไม่มีการอัพโหลดข้อมูลเกม ข้อตกลงปัจจุบันของคุณจะถูกบันทึกโดยอัตโนมัติในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้ เพื่อให้คุณสามารถดำเนินการต่อได้ในภายหลัง","Rules and limitations":"กฎและข้อจำกัด","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"นี่คือเกมฝึกซ้อมในท้องถิ่นแบบไม่เป็นทางการ ไม่ใช่ผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์ การพนัน ลูกค้าทัวร์นาเมนต์ หรือนักแก้ปัญหาที่เชี่ยวชาญ โดยจะใช้ลำดับการ์ดเกมปกติของ DDV การเรียก Re/Kontra และการแก้ปัญหาการแต่งงาน แต่ไม่ได้ใช้โซโลที่เลือกได้ การปฏิเสธ เช่น keine 90 การลงโทษทัวร์นาเมนต์ กฎตารางพิเศษทั้งหมด หรือการให้คะแนนทัวร์นาเมนต์ที่ได้รับการรับรอง CPU ทั้งสามตัวใช้การวิเคราะห์พฤติกรรมทางกฎหมายแบบง่ายๆ และอาจทำการตัดสินใจที่อ่อนแอได้","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"เล่นฟรี การ์ดและคะแนนจะอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีการอัพโหลดข้อมูลเกม","Play Doppelkopf":"เล่นดอปเปลคอฟ","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Language":"ภาษา","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"เครื่องมือทั้งหมด","New deal":"ดีลใหม่","Resume saved deal":"ทำข้อตกลงที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","Delete saved deal":"ลบข้อตกลงที่บันทึกไว้","Choose New deal to begin.":"เลือกข้อตกลงใหม่เพื่อเริ่มต้น","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"เริ่มข้อตกลงใหม่หรือเล่นเกมที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","You":"คุณ","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"เบาะนั่ง","Your hand":"มือของคุณ","Current trick":"เคล็ดลับปัจจุบัน","Turn":"เทิร์น","Re eyes":"รีตา","Kontra eyes":"คอนทราอายส์","Re tricks":"Reเทคนิค","Kontra tricks":"เทคนิค Kontra","Match points":"จับคู่แต้ม","Announce Re":"ประกาศ Re","Announce Kontra":"ประกาศคอนทรา","Play selected card":"เล่นการ์ดที่เลือก","Select a card":"เลือกการ์ด","Re":"Re","Kontra":"คอนทรา","Team not yet known":"ยังไม่ทราบทีม","Trick table":"โต๊ะทริก","Clubs":"ไม้กอล์ฟ","Spades":"โพดำ","Hearts":"หัวใจ","Diamonds":"เพชร","Nine":"เก้า","Jack":"แจ็ค","Queen":"ควีน","King":"คิง","Ten":"สิบ","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"สำเนาที่สอง","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"ตาคุณ เลือกบัตรที่ถูกกฎหมาย","A computer player is thinking…":"ผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์กำลังคิดว่า...","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"ดีลใหม่พร้อมแล้ว คุณเป็นผู้นำการฝึกซ้อมรอบนี้","Selected card":"การ์ดที่เลือก","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"การเล่นนั้นไม่ถูกกฎหมาย ติดตามชุดสูทหรือทรัมป์เมื่อเป็นไปได้","Deal saved on this device.":"ดีลที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"การบันทึกในเครื่องไม่พร้อมใช้งานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้","Saved deal resumed.":"ข้อตกลงที่บันทึกไว้กลับมาทำงานต่อ","Saved deal deleted.":"ลบข้อตกลงที่บันทึกไว้แล้ว","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"ไม่สามารถอ่านข้อตกลงที่บันทึกไว้ได้ ลบมันออกแล้วเริ่มใหม่อีกครั้ง","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"งานแต่งงาน: ผู้เล่นคนแรกที่ชนะภายในสามเคล็ดลับจะกลายเป็นคู่หู","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"แก้ไขงานแต่งงานแล้ว: ผู้ชนะเคล็ดลับคือพันธมิตร","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"นักเล่นงานแต่งงานชนะสามลูกแรก ข้อตกลงนี้กลายเป็นโซโลเพชรแล้ว","Re announced.":"ประกาศอีกครั้ง","Kontra announced.":"Kontra ประกาศแล้ว","Re wins the deal.":"Re ชนะข้อตกลง","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra ชนะข้อตกลง","Final eyes":"ตาสุดท้าย","Game points":"แต้มเกม","Teams":"ทีม","Start another deal to play again.":"เริ่มดีลใหม่เพื่อเล่นอีกครั้ง","Rules reference":"การอ้างอิงกฎ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"สมาคมดอปเปลคอฟเยอรมัน · กฎการแข่งขัน, 21 ก.พ. 2026","Card":"การ์ด","eyes":"ตา"},"tl":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Libreng Larong Lokal na Card","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Maglaro ng four-seat Doppelkopf practice game laban sa tatlong lokal na manlalaro ng computer. Matuto ng mga team, trumps, trick at Re/Kontra na tawag. Libre, walang account.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Maglaro ng lokal na larong Doppelkopf na may apat na upuan. Sundin ang led suit o trump kung kaya mo, hanapin ang Re team sa pamamagitan ng club queens, at subukan ang Re o Kontra announcement.","A quick example":"Isang mabilis na halimbawa","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Sa isang normal na laro, ang dalawang manlalaro na may hawak na club queen ay si Re. Kung hawak ng isang manlalaro ang pareho, magsisimula ang kasal: ang unang manlalaro na manalo ng trick sa unang tatlo ay magiging kapareha nila.","How to play":"Paano laruin","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Ang laro ay tumatalakay sa 48 card: dalawang kopya ng ace, ten, king, queen, jack at siyam sa bawat suit. Ang bawat isa sa apat na upuan ay makakakuha ng 12 card. Ang order ng Trump ay nagsisimula sa puso na sampu, pagkatapos ay ang mga reyna at jacks sa pagkakasunud-sunod ng suit, na sinusundan ng mga diamond card. Ang isang trick ay napanalunan ng pinakamataas na trump, o ang pinakamataas na card ng led suit kung walang trump na nilalaro. Ang laro ay may 240 card eyes.","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","How many cards and players are there?":"Ilan ang baraha at manlalaro?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf ay nilalaro dito na may apat na upuan at 48 card: dalawang kopya ng bawat 24 card face. Ang bawat upuan ay tumatanggap ng 12 card.","How are the teams found?":"Paano nahanap ang mga koponan?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Sa isang normal na laro, ang dalawang upuan na may hawak na club queen ay bumubuo ng Re; ang dalawa pa ay bumubuo ng Kontra. Kung nasa isang upuan ang parehong club queens, ang panuntunan sa kasal ay makakahanap ng kapareha sa unang tatlong trick.","What happens during a wedding?":"Ano ang mangyayari sa panahon ng kasal?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Ang unang upuan na nanalo sa isa sa unang tatlong trick ay sumali sa Re. Kung ang upuan ng kasal ay nanalo sa lahat ng tatlo, ang laro ay magpapatuloy bilang isang solong diyamante ng isang manlalaro.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Aling card ang pinakamalakas na trumpo?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Ang pusong sampu ang pinakamataas. Sumusunod ang mga Queen sa club, spade, heart, diamond order, pagkatapos ay jacks sa parehong suit order, pagkatapos ay ang diamond ace, ten, king at nine.","Must I follow suit?":"Dapat ba akong sumunod?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Oo. Kung ang isang non-trump suit ay pinangunahan, laruin ang suit na iyon kapag maaari mo. Kung ang isang trumpo ay pinangunahan, tumugtog ng isang trumpeta kapag maaari mo. Kung hindi, pumili ng anumang card.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng Re at Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Sila ang pangalan ng dalawang koponan. Sa panahon ng pinapayagang pagbubukas ng window, maaaring ipahayag ng isang manlalaro ang kanilang koponan nang isang beses. Ang tawag ay nakikita at binabago ang threshold ng panalo at mga puntos ng laro.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Ito ba ang buong ruleset ng tournament?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang lokal na bersyon ng pagsasanay ng normal na paglalaro na may mga tawag sa Re/Kontra at ang panuntunan sa kasal. Nag-iiwan ito ng mga solong pinili bago maglaro, mga pagtanggi, mga parusa sa paligsahan at maraming mga panuntunan sa bahay.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Maaari ba akong makipaglaro sa tatlong kaibigan online?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Hindi. Ang iyong tatlong kalaban ay mga simpleng lokal na manlalaro ng computer. Walang account, matchmaking o online multiplayer.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Na-upload o nai-save ba online ang aking deal?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Walang na-upload na data ng laro. Awtomatikong nase-save ang iyong kasalukuyang deal sa browser na ito sa device na ito para maipagpatuloy mo ito sa ibang pagkakataon.","Rules and limitations":"Mga panuntunan at limitasyon","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Ito ay isang kaswal na lokal na pagsasanay na laro, hindi online na multiplayer, pagsusugal, kliyente ng tournament o isang dalubhasang solver. Ginagamit nito ang DDV na normal-game card order, ang Re/Kontra calls at wedding resolution, ngunit hindi nagpapatupad ng mga mapipiling solo, mga pagtanggi gaya ng keine 90, mga parusa sa tournament, lahat ng espesyal na panuntunan sa talahanayan o sertipikadong pag-iskor ng tournament. Ang tatlong CPU ay gumagamit ng simpleng legal-move heuristics at maaaring gumawa ng mga mahihinang desisyon.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Libreng laruin. Ang mga card at score ay mananatili sa browser na ito sa device na ito; walang na-upload na data ng laro.","Play Doppelkopf":"Maglaro ng Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Language":"Wika","UsefulVerse":"Kapaki-pakinabang na Verse","All tools":"Lahat ng tool","New deal":"Bagong deal","Resume saved deal":"Ipagpatuloy ang naka-save na deal","Delete saved deal":"I-delete ang naka-save na deal","Choose New deal to begin.":"Pumili ng Bagong deal para magsimula.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Magsimula ng bagong deal o ipagpatuloy ang iyong na-save na laro.","You":"Ikaw","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Seat","Your hand":"Ang iyong kamay","Current trick":"Kasalukuyang trick","Turn":"Liko","Re eyes":"Muling mga mata","Kontra eyes":"Kontra mata","Re tricks":"Muling mga trick","Kontra tricks":"Kontra trick","Match points":"Match points","Announce Re":"I-anunsyo ang Re","Announce Kontra":"I-anunsyo ang Kontra","Play selected card":"I-play ang napiling card","Select a card":"Pumili ng card","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Hindi pa kilala ang koponan","Trick table":"Trick table","Clubs":"Mga Club","Spades":"Mga Spade","Hearts":"Mga Puso","Diamonds":"Mga Brilyante","Nine":"Siyam","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Reyna","King":"Hari","Ten":"Sampu","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"pangalawang kopya","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Iyong turn. Pumili ng legal na card.","A computer player is thinking…":"Isang computer player ang nag-iisip…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Handa na ang bagong deal. Pinangunahan mo ang round ng pagsasanay na ito.","Selected card":"Pinili na card","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Hindi legal ang dulang iyon. Sundin ang suit o tramp kung maaari.","Deal saved on this device.":"Na-save ang deal sa device na ito.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Hindi available ang lokal na pag-save sa browser na ito.","Saved deal resumed.":"Ipinagpatuloy ang naka-save na deal.","Saved deal deleted.":"Na-delete ang naka-save na deal.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Hindi mabasa ang na-save na deal. Tanggalin ito at magsimulang muli.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Kasal: ang unang manlalaro na manalo sa loob ng tatlong trick ang magiging partner.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Naresolba ang kasal: ang mananalo sa trick ay ang partner.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Napanalo ng wedding player ang unang tatlong trick. Ang deal ay isa nang diamond solo.","Re announced.":"Muling inihayag.","Kontra announced.":"Inihayag ng Kontra.","Re wins the deal.":"Re ang nanalo sa deal.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Napanalo ng Kontra ang deal.","Final eyes":"Mga huling mata","Game points":"Mga puntos sa laro","Teams":"Mga Koponan","Start another deal to play again.":"Magsimula ng isa pang deal para muling maglaro.","Rules reference":"Sanggunian sa mga panuntunan","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"German Doppelkopf Association · Mga Panuntunan sa Tournament, 21 Peb 2026","Card":"Card","eyes":"mata"},"tr":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Ücretsiz Yerel Kart Oyunu","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Üç yerel bilgisayar oyuncusuna karşı dört kişilik bir Doppelkopf antrenman oyunu oynayın. Takımları, kozları, püf noktalarını ve Re/Kontra çağrılarını öğrenin. Ücretsiz, hesap yok.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Yerel dört kişilik Doppelkopf oyunu oyna. Yapabildiğiniz zaman lider takımı veya kozu takip edin, kulüp kraliçeleri aracılığıyla Re takımını bulun ve Re veya Kontra duyurusunu deneyin.","A quick example":"Hızlı bir örnek","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Normal bir oyunda, kulüp kraliçesini elinde bulunduran iki oyuncu Re'dir. Bir oyuncu her ikisini de elinde tutarsa, bir düğün başlar: İlk üçte bir el kazanan diğer oyuncu, onların ortağı olur.","How to play":"Nasıl oynanır","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Oyunda 48 kart dağıtılır: her renkten iki kopya as, on, papaz, kız, vale ve dokuz. Dört koltuğun her birine 12 kartları verilir. Trump sırası kalp onluluğuyla başlar, ardından renk sırasına göre kız ve valeler ve ardından elmas kartlar gelir. Bir löve, en yüksek kozla veya koz oynanmazsa led rengin en yüksek kartıyla kazanılır. Oyunda 240 kart gözleri var.","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","How many cards and players are there?":"Kaç tane kart ve oyuncu var?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf burada dört koltuk ve 48 kartlarla oynanıyor: 24 kart yüzlerinin her birinin iki kopyası. Her koltuğa 12 kartları verilir.","How are the teams found?":"Ekipler nasıl bulunur?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Normal bir oyunda, kulüp kraliçesini tutan iki koltuk Re'yi oluşturur; diğer ikisi Kontra'yı oluşturur. Bir koltukta her iki kulüp kraliçesi de bulunuyorsa, evlilik kuralı ilk üç el sırasında bir ortak bulur.","What happens during a wedding?":"Düğün sırasında ne olur?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"İlk üç numaradan birini kazanan diğer ilk koltuk Re'ye katıldı. Düğün koltuğu üçünü de kazanırsa oyun tek oyunculu elmas solo olarak devam eder.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"En güçlü koz hangi kart?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Kalp onlusu en yüksek seviyededir. Kızları sinek, maça, kupa, karo sırasına göre takip eder, ardından aynı renk sırasına göre valeler, ardından karo as, on, papaz ve dokuz gelir.","Must I follow suit?":"Ben de aynı yolu izlemeli miyim?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Evet. Eğer koz olmayan bir renk kullanılıyorsa, mümkün olduğunda o rengi oynayın. Eğer bir koz varsa, mümkün olduğunda koz oynayın. Aksi takdirde herhangi bir kartı seçin.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re ve Kontra ne anlama geliyor?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"İki takımın isimleridir. İzin verilen açılış penceresi sırasında bir oyuncu takımını bir kez anons edebilir. Çağrı görünürdür ve kazanma eşiğini ve oyun puanlarını değiştirir.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Bu tam turnuva kural seti mi?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Hayır. Bu, Re/Kontra çağrıları ve düğün kuralıyla normal oyunun yerel uygulama versiyonudur. Oyundan önce seçilen soloları, retleri, turnuva cezalarını ve birçok ev kuralını dışarıda bırakıyor.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Çevrimiçi olarak üç arkadaşımla oynayabilir miyim?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Hayır. Üç rakibiniz basit yerel bilgisayar oyuncularıdır. Hesap, çöpçatanlık veya çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun yok.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Anlaşmam çevrimiçi olarak yükleniyor mu veya kaydediliyor mu?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Oyun verisi yüklenmedi. Mevcut fırsatınız bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıya otomatik olarak kaydedilir, böylece daha sonra devam ettirebilirsiniz.","Rules and limitations":"Kurallar ve sınırlamalar","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Bu, çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun, kumar, turnuva istemcisi veya uzman çözücü değil, sıradan bir yerel alıştırma oyunudur. DDV normal oyun kartı sırasını, Re/Kontra çağrılarını ve düğün kararını kullanır, ancak seçilebilir soloları, keine 90 gibi retleri, turnuva cezalarını, tüm özel masa kurallarını veya sertifikalı turnuva puanlamasını uygulamaz. Üç CPU, basit yasal hareket buluşsal yöntemini kullanır ve zayıf kararlar verebilir.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Oynaması ücretsiz. Kartlar ve puanlar bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıda kalır; hiçbir oyun verisi yüklenmedi.","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf'u Oynat","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Language":"Dil","UsefulVerse":"Kullanışlı Ayet","All tools":"Tüm araçlar","New deal":"Yeni anlaşma","Resume saved deal":"Kayıtlı anlaşmayı devam ettir","Delete saved deal":"Kayıtlı anlaşmayı sil","Choose New deal to begin.":"Başlamak için Yeni anlaşma'yı seçin.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Yeni bir anlaşma başlatın veya kayıtlı oyununuza devam edin.","You":"Siz","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Koltuk","Your hand":"Eliniz","Current trick":"Güncel numara","Turn":"Dönüş","Re eyes":"Gözler","Kontra eyes":"Kontra gözler","Re tricks":"Yeniden püf noktaları","Kontra tricks":"Kontra püf noktaları","Match points":"Maç puanları","Announce Re":"Yeniyi Duyurduk","Announce Kontra":"Kontra'yı Duyurdu","Play selected card":"Seçilen kartı oynat","Select a card":"Bir kart seçin","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Takım henüz bilinmiyor","Trick table":"Yanıltıcı tablo","Clubs":"Kulüpler","Spades":"Maça","Hearts":"Kalpler","Diamonds":"Elmaslar","Nine":"Dokuz","Jack":"Jak","Queen":"Kraliçe","King":"Kral","Ten":"On","Ace":"As","second copy":"ikinci kopya","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Sıra sizde. Yasal bir kart seçin.","A computer player is thinking…":"Bir bilgisayar oynatıcısı şunu düşünüyor…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Yeni anlaşma hazır. Bu antrenman turuna siz liderlik edeceksiniz.","Selected card":"Seçili kart","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Bu oyun yasal değil. Mümkün olduğunda davayı takip edin veya kozu kullanın.","Deal saved on this device.":"Fırsat bu cihaza kaydedildi.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Yerel kaydetme bu tarayıcıda mevcut değil.","Saved deal resumed.":"Kaydedilen anlaşma devam ettirildi.","Saved deal deleted.":"Kayıtlı anlaşma silindi.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Kaydedilen anlaşma okunamadı. Silin ve yeniden başlayın.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Düğün: Üç el içinde kazanan diğer ilk oyuncu ortak olur.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Düğün çözüldü: kazanan taraf partnerdir.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Düğün oyuncusu ilk üç eli kazandı. Anlaşma artık elmas soloya dönüştü.","Re announced.":"Yeniden duyuruldu.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra duyuruldu.","Re wins the deal.":"Re anlaşmayı kazandı.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra anlaşmayı kazandı.","Final eyes":"Son gözler","Game points":"Oyun puanları","Teams":"Takımlar","Start another deal to play again.":"Tekrar oynamak için başka bir anlaşma başlatın.","Rules reference":"Kural referansı","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Alman Doppelkopf Derneği · Turnuva Kuralları, 21 Şubat 2026","Card":"Kart","eyes":"gözler"},"uk":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — безкоштовна місцева карткова гра","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Зіграйте в тренувальну гру Doppelkopf на чотири місця проти трьох локальних комп’ютерних гравців. Вивчайте команди, козирі, трюки та виклики Re/Kontra. Безкоштовно, без облікового запису.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Зіграйте в локальну чотиримісну гру Doppelkopf. Дотримуйтесь масті або козиря, коли зможете, знайдіть команду Re через трефових дам і спробуйте оголошення Re або Kontra.","A quick example":"Швидкий приклад","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"У звичайній грі два гравці, які тримають трефову даму, є Re. Якщо один гравець тримає обидва, починається весілля: перший гравець, який виграє трюк у перших трьох, стає їхнім партнером.","How to play":"Як грати","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"У грі роздають карти 48: дві копії туза, десятки, короля, дами, валета та дев’ятки кожної масті. Кожне з чотирьох місць отримує картки 12. Послідовність козирів починається з червової десятки, потім дам і валетів у порядку масті, а потім бубнових карт. Фокус виграє старший козир або старша карта головної масті, якщо козир не зіграний. У грі є карткові очі 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","How many cards and players are there?":"Скільки є карток і гравців?\nУ","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf грають тут із чотирма місцями та картами 48: дві копії кожної з лицьових сторін карт 24. Кожне місце отримує картки 12.","How are the teams found?":"Як знайти команди?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"У звичайній грі два місця, що тримають трефового ферзя, утворюють Re; дві інші утворюють Контру. Якщо одне місце займає обидві трефові дами, правило весілля знаходить партнера під час перших трьох прийомів.","What happens during a wedding?":"Що відбувається під час весілля?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Перше інше місце, яке виграє один із перших трьох трюків, приєднується до Re. Якщо весільне місце виграє всі три, гра продовжується як ромбове соло для одного гравця.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Яка карта найсильніший козир?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Черва десятка найвища. Дами йдуть у порядку трефа, пік, черва, бубна, потім валети в тому ж порядку масті, потім бубновий туз, десятка, король і дев’ятка.","Must I follow suit?":"Чи потрібно мені слідувати цьому прикладу?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Так. Якщо ведеться некозирна масть, грайте цією мастю, коли зможете. Якщо ведуть козир, грайте козир, коли можете. В іншому випадку виберіть будь-яку картку.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Що означають Re та Kontra?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Це назви двох команд. Протягом дозволеного вікна відкриття гравець може оголосити свою команду один раз. Дзвінок є видимим і змінює поріг виграшу та ігрові очки.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Це повний набір правил турніру?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"№ Це місцева практична версія звичайної гри з викликами Re/Kontra та правилом весілля. Він не включає соло, обрані перед грою, відмови, турнірні штрафи та багато внутрішніх правил.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Чи можу я грати з трьома друзями онлайн?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"№ Ваші троє суперників — прості локальні комп’ютерні гравці. Немає облікового запису, пошуку партнерів або багатокористувацької онлайн-ігри.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Моя угода завантажена чи збережена онлайн?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Дані гри не завантажуються. Ваша поточна угода автоматично зберігається в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої, щоб ви могли відновити її пізніше.","Rules and limitations":"Правила та обмеження","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Це повсякденна локальна гра, а не онлайн-гра для кількох гравців, азартні ігри, турнірний клієнт чи експертний розв’язувач. Він використовує порядок карт у звичайній грі DDV, дзвінки Re/Kontra та весільну резолюцію, але не реалізує вибіркові соло, відмови, такі як keine 90, турнірні штрафи, усі спеціальні правила столу чи сертифікований турнірний підрахунок очок. Три ЦП використовують просту евристику допустимих переміщень і можуть приймати слабкі рішення.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безкоштовна гра. Картки та результати залишаються в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої; дані гри не завантажуються.","Play Doppelkopf":"Грати в Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Language":"Мова","UsefulVerse":"Корисний вірш","All tools":"Всі інструменти","New deal":"Нова угода","Resume saved deal":"Відновити збережену угоду","Delete saved deal":"Видалити збережену угоду","Choose New deal to begin.":"Оберіть «Нова угода», щоб почати.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Розпочніть нову угоду або відновіть збережену гру.","You":"Ви","CPU":"ЦП","Seat":"Сидіння","Your hand":"Твоя рука","Current trick":"Поточний трюк","Turn":"Поворот","Re eyes":"Re очі","Kontra eyes":"Контра очі","Re tricks":"Повторні хитрощі","Kontra tricks":"Контра трюки","Match points":"Матч-очки","Announce Re":"Оголосити Re","Announce Kontra":"Анонс Контра","Play selected card":"Зіграти вибрану карту","Select a card":"Виберіть картку","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Контра","Team not yet known":"Команда ще не відома","Trick table":"Трюковий стіл","Clubs":"Булави","Spades":"Піки","Hearts":"Серця","Diamonds":"Діаманти","Nine":"Дев'ять","Jack":"Джек","Queen":"Королева","King":"Король","Ten":"Дес","Ace":"Ас","second copy":"другий примірник","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Ваша черга. Виберіть легальну картку.","A computer player is thinking…":"Комп’ютерний гравець думає…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Нова угода готова. Ви ведете цю практику.","Selected card":"Вибрана картка","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Ця гра не є законною. Наслідуйте приклад або козиріть, коли це можливо.","Deal saved on this device.":"Угоду збережено на цьому пристрої.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Локальне збереження недоступне в цьому браузері.","Saved deal resumed.":"Збережену угоду відновлено.","Saved deal deleted.":"Збережену угоду видалено.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Не вдалося прочитати збережену угоду. Видаліть його та почніть знову.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Весілля: перший інший гравець, який виграє протягом трьох прийомів, стає партнером.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Весілля вирішено: виграє трюк – партнер.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Весільний гравець виграв перші три трюки. Тепер угода є діамантовим соло.","Re announced.":"Оголошено повторно.","Kontra announced.":"Оголошено Контра.","Re wins the deal.":"Re виграє угоду.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Контра виграє угоду.","Final eyes":"Кінцеві очі","Game points":"Ігрові бали","Teams":"Команди","Start another deal to play again.":"Почніть іншу угоду, щоб грати знову.","Rules reference":"Посилання на правила","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Німецька асоціація Doppelkopf · Правила турніру, 21 лютий 2026","Card":"Картка","eyes":"оч"},"ur":{"Doppelkopf":"ڈوپلکوف","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf آن لائن - مفت لوکل کارڈ گیم","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"تین مقامی کمپیوٹر کھلاڑیوں کے خلاف چار نشستوں والا ڈوپلکوف پریکٹس گیم کھیلیں۔ ٹیمیں، ٹرمپ، چالیں اور ری/کونٹرا کالز سیکھیں۔ مفت، کوئی اکاؤنٹ نہیں۔","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"ایک مقامی چار سیٹوں والا ڈوپلکوف گیم کھیلیں۔ جب ہو سکے تو قیادت والے سوٹ یا ٹرمپ کی پیروی کریں، کلب کوئینز کے ذریعے ری ٹیم تلاش کریں، اور ری یا کونٹرا اعلان آزمائیں۔","A quick example":"ایک تیز مثال","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"ایک عام کھیل میں، وہ دو کھلاڑی جو کلب کی کوئین رکھتے ہیں وہ ری ہیں۔ اگر ایک کھلاڑی دونوں کو رکھتا ہے، تو شادی شروع ہو جاتی ہے: پہلے تین میں چال جیتنے والا پہلا دوسرا کھلاڑی ان کا پارٹنر بن جاتا ہے۔","How to play":"کیسے کھیلنا ہے۔","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"گیم 48 کارڈز کا سودا کرتی ہے: ہر سوٹ میں ace، دس، کنگ، کوئین، جیک اور نو کی دو کاپیاں۔ چار سیٹوں میں سے ہر ایک کو 12 کارڈ ملتے ہیں۔ ٹرمپ آرڈر ہارٹ ٹین سے شروع ہوتا ہے، پھر کوئینز اور جیکس سوٹ آرڈر میں، اس کے بعد ڈائمنڈ کارڈز۔ ایک چال سب سے زیادہ ٹرمپ جیت جاتی ہے، یا اگر کوئی ٹرمپ نہیں کھیلا جاتا ہے تو قیادت والے سوٹ کا سب سے زیادہ کارڈ۔ گیم میں 240 کارڈ کی آنکھیں ہیں۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","How many cards and players are there?":"کتنے کارڈ اور کھلاڑی ہیں؟","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf یہاں چار نشستوں اور 48 کارڈز کے ساتھ کھیلا جاتا ہے: 24 کارڈ کے ہر چہرے کی دو کاپیاں ہر سیٹ 12 کارڈ حاصل کرتی ہے۔","How are the teams found?":"ٹیمیں کیسے پائی جاتی ہیں؟","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"باقی دو کونٹرا کی شکل دیتے ہیں۔ اگر ایک نشست دونوں کلب کی ملکہ رکھتی ہے، تو شادی کا اصول پہلی تین چالوں کے دوران ایک ساتھی تلاش کرتا ہے۔","What happens during a wedding?":"شادی کے دوران کیا ہوتا ہے؟","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"پہلی تین چالوں میں سے ایک جیتنے والی پہلی دوسری سیٹ Re میں شامل ہوتی ہے۔ اگر شادی کی سیٹ تینوں جیت جاتی ہے، تو گیم ایک پلیئر ڈائمنڈ سولو کے طور پر جاری رہتا ہے۔","Which card is the strongest trump?":"کون سا کارڈ سب سے مضبوط ٹرمپ ہے؟","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"دل دس سب سے زیادہ ہے۔ کوئینز کلب، سپیڈ، ہارٹ، ڈائمنڈ آرڈر، پھر جیکس اسی سوٹ آرڈر میں، پھر ڈائمنڈ ایس، ٹین، کنگ اور نو کے ساتھ چلتی ہیں۔","Must I follow suit?":"کیا مجھے اس کی پیروی کرنی چاہیے؟","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"ہاں۔ اگر ایک غیر ٹرمپ سوٹ کی قیادت کی جاتی ہے، جب آپ کر سکتے ہیں تو اس سوٹ کو کھیلیں. اگر ٹرمپ کی قیادت کی جاتی ہے تو، جب آپ کر سکتے ہو ٹرمپ کو کھیلیں۔ بصورت دیگر، کوئی بھی کارڈ منتخب کریں۔","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re اور Kontra کا کیا مطلب ہے؟","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"وہ دونوں ٹیموں کے نام ہیں۔ کھلنے کی اجازت دی گئی کھڑکی کے دوران، ایک کھلاڑی ایک بار اپنی ٹیم کا اعلان کر سکتا ہے۔ کال نظر آتی ہے اور جیت کی حد اور گیم پوائنٹس کو تبدیل کرتی ہے۔","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"کیا یہ ٹورنامنٹ کا مکمل اصول ہے؟","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"No یہ ری/کونٹرا کالز اور شادی کے اصول کے ساتھ عام کھیل کا مقامی پریکٹس ورژن ہے۔ یہ کھیل سے پہلے منتخب کردہ سولوز، انکار، ٹورنامنٹ کے جرمانے اور گھر کے بہت سے قواعد کو چھوڑ دیتا ہے۔","Can I play with three friends online?":"کیا میں تین دوستوں کے ساتھ آن لائن کھیل سکتا ہوں؟","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"No آپ کے تین مخالفین سادہ مقامی کمپیوٹر پلیئر ہیں۔ کوئی اکاؤنٹ، میچ میکنگ یا آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر نہیں ہے۔","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"کیا میرا سودا آن لائن اپ لوڈ یا محفوظ ہے؟","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"کوئی گیم ڈیٹا اپ لوڈ نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔ آپ کی موجودہ ڈیل اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں خودکار طور پر محفوظ ہو جاتی ہے تاکہ آپ اسے بعد میں دوبارہ شروع کر سکیں۔","Rules and limitations":"قواعد اور حدود","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"یہ ایک عام مقامی پریکٹس گیم ہے، آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر، جوا، ٹورنامنٹ کلائنٹ یا ماہر حل کرنے والا نہیں۔ یہ DDV نارمل گیم کارڈ آرڈر، ری/کونٹرا کالز اور ویڈنگ ریزولوشن کا استعمال کرتا ہے، لیکن منتخب سولوز، انکار جیسے کہ کین 90، ٹورنامنٹ کے جرمانے، تمام خصوصی ٹیبل رولز یا تصدیق شدہ ٹورنامنٹ اسکورنگ کو لاگو نہیں کرتا ہے۔ تینوں CPUs سادہ قانونی چالوں کا استعمال کرتے ہیں اور کمزور فیصلے کر سکتے ہیں۔","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"کھیلنے کے لیے مفت۔ کارڈز اور اسکور اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں رہتے ہیں۔ کوئی گیم ڈیٹا اپ لوڈ نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","Play Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf کھیلیں","Related tools":"متعلقہ ٹولز","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت۔ آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"مفید آیت","All tools":"تمام ٹولز","New deal":"نئی ڈیل","Resume saved deal":"محفوظ ڈیل دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Delete saved deal":"محفوظ کردہ ڈیل کو حذف کریں۔","Choose New deal to begin.":"شروع کرنے کے لیے نئی ڈیل کا انتخاب کریں۔","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"ایک نئی ڈیل شروع کریں یا اپنی محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","You":"آپ","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"سیٹ","Your hand":"آپ کا ہاتھ","Current trick":"موجودہ چال","Turn":"ٹرن","Re eyes":"دوبارہ آنکھیں","Kontra eyes":"کونٹرا آنکھیں","Re tricks":"دوبارہ چالیں۔","Kontra tricks":"کونٹرا ٹرکس","Match points":"میچ پوائنٹس","Announce Re":"دوبارہ اعلان کریں۔","Announce Kontra":"Kontra کا اعلان کریں۔","Play selected card":"منتخب کارڈ کھیلیں","Select a card":"ایک کارڈ منتخب کریں۔","Re":"Re","Kontra":"کونٹرا","Team not yet known":"ٹیم ابھی تک معلوم نہیں ہے۔","Trick table":"ٹرک ٹیبل","Clubs":"کلب","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"دل","Diamonds":"ہیرے","Nine":"نو","Jack":"جیک","Queen":"ملکہ","King":"بادشاہ","Ten":"دس","Ace":"Ace","second copy":"دوسری کاپی","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"آپ کی باری ہے۔ قانونی کارڈ کا انتخاب کریں۔","A computer player is thinking…":"ایک کمپیوٹر پلیئر سوچ رہا ہے…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"نئی ڈیل تیار ہے۔ آپ اس پریکٹس راؤنڈ کی قیادت کرتے ہیں۔","Selected card":"منتخب کارڈ","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"وہ ڈرامہ قانونی نہیں ہے۔ جب ممکن ہو تو سوٹ یا ٹرمپ کی پیروی کریں۔","Deal saved on this device.":"ڈیل اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ ہوگئی۔","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"مقامی بچت اس براؤزر میں دستیاب نہیں ہے۔","Saved deal resumed.":"محفوظ کردہ ڈیل دوبارہ شروع ہو گئی۔","Saved deal deleted.":"محفوظ کردہ ڈیل کو حذف کر دیا گیا۔","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"محفوظ کردہ ڈیل کو پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ اسے حذف کریں اور دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Wedding: تین چالوں میں جیتنے والا پہلا دوسرا کھلاڑی پارٹنر بن جاتا ہے۔","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"شادی حل ہوگئی: چال جیتنے والا پارٹنر ہے۔","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"شادی کے کھلاڑی نے پہلی تین چالیں جیت لیں۔ معاہدہ اب ایک ہیرے کا سولو ہے۔","Re announced.":"دوبارہ اعلان کیا گیا۔","Kontra announced.":"کونٹرا نے اعلان کیا۔","Re wins the deal.":"Re نے معاہدہ جیت لیا۔","Kontra wins the deal.":"کونٹرا نے معاہدہ جیت لیا۔","Final eyes":"آخری آنکھیں","Game points":"گیم پوائنٹس","Teams":"ٹیمز","Start another deal to play again.":"دوبارہ کھیلنے کے لیے ایک اور ڈیل شروع کریں۔","Rules reference":"قواعد کا حوالہ","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"جرمن ڈوپلکوف ایسوسی ایشن · ٹورنامنٹ کے قواعد، 21 فروری 2026","Card":"کارڈ","eyes":"آنکھیں۔"},"vi":{"Doppelkopf":"Doppelkopf","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — Trò chơi bài địa phương miễn phí","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"Chơi trò chơi luyện tập Doppelkopf bốn chỗ với ba người chơi máy tính địa phương. Tìm hiểu các đội, quân át chủ bài, thủ thuật và lệnh gọi Re/Kontra. Miễn phí, không có tài khoản.","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"Chơi trò chơi Doppelkopf bốn chỗ tại địa phương. Đi theo bộ đồ dẫn đầu hoặc con át chủ bài khi bạn có thể, tìm nhóm Re thông qua các nữ hoàng của câu lạc bộ và thử thông báo Re hoặc Kontra.","A quick example":"Ví dụ nhanh","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"Trong một ván đấu bình thường, hai người chơi cầm quân hậu câu lạc bộ là Re. Nếu một người chơi nắm giữ cả hai, một đám cưới sẽ bắt đầu: người chơi đầu tiên thắng được trò lừa trong ba người đầu tiên sẽ trở thành đồng đội của họ.","How to play":"Cách chơi","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"Trò chơi chia các lá bài 48: hai bản sao của quân át, mười, vua, hoàng hậu, jack và chín trong mỗi bộ. Mỗi người trong số bốn ghế đều nhận được thẻ 12. Thứ tự Trump bắt đầu với số 10 trái tim, sau đó là quân hậu và quân jack theo thứ tự phù hợp, tiếp theo là quân bài kim cương. Một mánh khóe sẽ giành được bởi con át chủ bài cao nhất hoặc quân bài cao nhất của bộ đồ dẫn đầu nếu không có con át chủ bài nào được chơi. Trò chơi có mắt thẻ 240.","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","How many cards and players are there?":"Có bao nhiêu lá bài và người chơi?","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf được chơi ở đây với bốn chỗ ngồi và thẻ 48: hai bản sao của mỗi mặt thẻ 24. Mỗi ghế nhận được thẻ 12.","How are the teams found?":"Các đội được tìm thấy như thế nào?","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"Trong một trò chơi bình thường, hai ghế cầm một câu lạc bộ nữ hoàng dạng Re; hai mẫu còn lại là Kontra. Nếu một ghế chứa cả hai nữ hoàng của câu lạc bộ, quy tắc đám cưới sẽ tìm thấy bạn tình trong ba thủ thuật đầu tiên.","What happens during a wedding?":"Điều gì xảy ra trong một đám cưới?","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"Người còn lại đầu tiên giành được một trong ba thủ thuật đầu tiên tham gia cùng Re. Nếu ghế đám cưới thắng cả ba, trò chơi sẽ tiếp tục dưới dạng solo kim cương một người chơi.","Which card is the strongest trump?":"Con át chủ bài nào mạnh nhất?","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"Tâm mười là cao nhất. Quân hậu theo thứ tự câu lạc bộ, quân bích, quân tim, quân kim cương, sau đó là quân jack theo thứ tự giống nhau, sau đó là quân át kim cương, quân mười, vua và chín.","Must I follow suit?":"Tôi có phải làm theo không?","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"Có. Nếu bộ đồ không phải là con át chủ bài được dẫn trước, hãy chơi bộ đồ đó khi bạn có thể. Nếu một con át chủ bài bị dẫn trước, hãy chơi một con át chủ bài khi bạn có thể. Nếu không, hãy chọn bất kỳ thẻ nào.","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re và Kontra có nghĩa là gì?","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"Họ là tên của hai đội. Trong thời gian mở được phép, người chơi có thể công bố đội của mình một lần. Cuộc gọi hiển thị và thay đổi ngưỡng thắng cũng như điểm trò chơi.","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"Đây có phải là bộ quy tắc đầy đủ của giải đấu không?","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"Không. Đây là phiên bản thực hành địa phương của cách chơi bình thường với lệnh gọi Re/Kontra và quy tắc đám cưới. Nó loại bỏ các solo được chọn trước khi chơi, từ chối, hình phạt trong giải đấu và nhiều quy tắc chung.","Can I play with three friends online?":"Tôi có thể chơi trực tuyến với ba người bạn không?","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"Không. Ba đối thủ của bạn là những người chơi máy tính cục bộ đơn giản. Không có tài khoản, mai mối hoặc nhiều người chơi trực tuyến.","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"Ưu đãi của tôi có được tải lên hoặc lưu trực tuyến không?","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"Không có dữ liệu trò chơi nào được tải lên. Giao dịch hiện tại của bạn được lưu tự động trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này để bạn có thể tiếp tục lại sau.","Rules and limitations":"Quy tắc và giới hạn","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"Đây là một trò chơi luyện tập thông thường tại địa phương, không phải trò chơi nhiều người chơi trực tuyến, cờ bạc, khách hàng giải đấu hay người giải chuyên nghiệp. Nó sử dụng thứ tự thẻ trò chơi thông thường DDV, lệnh gọi Re/Kontra và giải quyết đám cưới, nhưng không thực hiện các màn solo có thể lựa chọn, các từ chối như keine 90, các hình phạt trong giải đấu, tất cả các quy tắc bàn đặc biệt hoặc tính điểm giải đấu được chứng nhận. Ba CPU sử dụng phương pháp phỏng đoán hành động hợp pháp đơn giản và có thể đưa ra những quyết định yếu kém.","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Chơi miễn phí. Thẻ và điểm vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này; không có dữ liệu trò chơi được tải lên.","Play Doppelkopf":"Chơi Doppelkopf","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Language":"Ngôn ngữ","UsefulVerse":"Verse hữu ích","All tools":"Tất cả dụng cụ","New deal":"Ưu đãi mới","Resume saved deal":"Tiếp tục giao dịch đã lưu","Delete saved deal":"Xóa giao dịch đã lưu","Choose New deal to begin.":"Chọn giao dịch mới để bắt đầu.","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"Bắt đầu giao dịch mới hoặc tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu của bạn.","You":"Bạn","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"Ghế","Your hand":"Bàn tay của bạn","Current trick":"Thủ thuật hiện tại","Turn":"Quay","Re eyes":"Mắt lại","Kontra eyes":"Mắt Kontra","Re tricks":"Re thủ thuật","Kontra tricks":"Thủ thuật Kontra","Match points":"Điểm phù hợp","Announce Re":"Thông báo lại","Announce Kontra":"Thông báo Kontra","Play selected card":"Chơi bài đã chọn","Select a card":"Chọn thẻ","Re":"Re","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"Đội chưa được biết đến","Trick table":"Bàn thủ thuật","Clubs":"Câu lạc bộ","Spades":"Pích","Hearts":"Trái tim","Diamonds":"Kim cương","Nine":"Chín","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Nữ hoàng","King":"Vua","Ten":"Mười","Ace":"Át","second copy":"bản sao thứ hai","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"Đến lượt bạn. Chọn một thẻ hợp pháp.","A computer player is thinking…":"Một người chơi máy tính đang suy nghĩ…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"Giao dịch mới đã sẵn sàng. Bạn dẫn đầu vòng thực hành này.","Selected card":"Thẻ được chọn","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"Trò chơi đó không hợp pháp. Làm theo hoặc át chủ bài khi có thể.","Deal saved on this device.":"Ưu đãi đã được lưu trên thiết bị này.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"Tính năng lưu cục bộ không khả dụng trong trình duyệt này.","Saved deal resumed.":"Giao dịch đã lưu đã được tiếp tục.","Saved deal deleted.":"Đã xóa giao dịch đã lưu.","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"Không thể đọc giao dịch đã lưu. Xóa nó và bắt đầu lại.","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"Đám cưới: người chơi đầu tiên giành chiến thắng trong vòng ba thủ thuật sẽ trở thành đối tác.","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"Đám cưới đã được giải quyết: người thắng trò lừa là đối tác.","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"Người chơi đám cưới thắng ba ván đầu tiên. Thỏa thuận bây giờ là một kim cương solo.","Re announced.":"Đã công bố lại.","Kontra announced.":"Kontra đã công bố.","Re wins the deal.":"Re thắng thầu.","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra thắng thầu.","Final eyes":"Đôi mắt cuối cùng","Game points":"Điểm trò chơi","Teams":"Đội","Start another deal to play again.":"Bắt đầu một giao dịch khác để chơi lại.","Rules reference":"Tham khảo quy tắc","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"Hiệp hội Doppelkopf Đức · Thể lệ giải đấu, 21 tháng 2 2026","Card":"Thẻ","eyes":"mắt"},"zh":{"Doppelkopf":"双影","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — 免费本地纸牌游戏","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"与三名本地电脑玩家进行一场四人 Doppelkopf 练习赛。了解团队、王牌、技巧和 Re/Kontra 跟注。免费，无需帐户。","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"玩当地的四人 Doppelkopf 游戏。尽可能跟随领先的花色或王牌，通过俱乐部皇后找到 Re 团队，并尝试 Re 或 Kontra 公告。","A quick example":"一个简单示例","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"在正常比赛中，持有俱乐部皇后的两名玩家是Re。如果一个玩家同时持有这两种牌，一场婚礼就开始了：第一个在前三局中赢得一墩的玩家成为他们的伴侣。","How to play":"怎么玩","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"游戏发48张牌：每种花色两张A、10、K、Q、J和9。四个座位中的每一个都获得 12 卡。王牌顺序从红心 10 开始，然后是按花色顺序排列的 Q 和 J，最后是方块牌。最大的王牌获胜，或者如果没有出王牌，则由主导花色中的最高牌赢得。游戏有240卡眼。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","How many cards and players are there?":"有多少张牌和多少名玩家？","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf 在这里使用四个座位和 48 卡进行游戏：每张 24 卡面各有两份。每个座位收到 12 卡。","How are the teams found?":"如何找到团队？","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"正常比赛时，两个座位持有俱乐部皇后形成Re；另外两个组成 Kontra。如果一个座位上有两位俱乐部皇后，则婚礼规则会在前三把戏中找到一位伴侣。","What happens during a wedding?":"婚礼期间会发生什么？","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"第一个赢得前三招之一的其他席位加入Re。如果婚礼席位赢得全部三项，则游戏将继续进行单人钻石独奏。","Which card is the strongest trump?":"哪张牌是最强王牌？","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"心十最高。 Q 依次为梅花、黑桃、红心、方块顺序，然后是相同花色顺序的 J，然后是方块 A、10、K 和 9。","Must I follow suit?":"我必须效仿吗？","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"是的。如果底牌是非王牌花色，尽可能打出该花色。如果有王牌，请尽可能打出王牌。否则，选择任何卡。","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re 和 Kontra 是什么意思？","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"它们是两支球队的名字。在允许的开放窗口内，玩家可以宣布一次自己的球队。该调用是可见的，并且会改变获胜阈值和游戏点数。","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"这是完整的锦标赛规则集吗？","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"编号这是 Re/Kontra 呼叫和婚礼规则的正常游戏的本地练习版本。它省略了比赛前选择的独奏、拒绝、比赛处罚和许多内部规则。","Can I play with three friends online?":"我可以和三个朋友在线玩吗？","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"编号你的三个对手都是简单的本地电脑玩家。没有帐户、配对或在线多人游戏。","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"我的交易是否已在线上传或保存？","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"没有上传游戏数据。您当前的优惠会自动保存在此设备上的浏览器中，以便您稍后可以恢复。","Rules and limitations":"规则和限制","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"这是一款休闲本地练习游戏，不是在线多人游戏、赌博、锦标赛客户端或专家解算器。它使用 DDV 正常游戏牌顺序、Re/Kontra 叫牌和婚礼决议，但不实施可选择的独奏、拒绝（例如 keine 90）、锦标赛处罚、所有特殊牌桌规则或经过认证的锦标赛计分。这三个 CPU 使用简单的合法移动启发法，可能会做出较弱的决策。","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免费玩。卡片和分数保留在此设备上的浏览器中；没有上传游戏数据。","Play Doppelkopf":"玩分身","Related tools":"相关工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Language":"语言","UsefulVerse":"有用的诗句","All tools":"所有工具","New deal":"新优惠","Resume saved deal":"恢复保存的交易","Delete saved deal":"删除已保存的交易","Choose New deal to begin.":"选择新交易开始。","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"开始新的交易或恢复您保存的游戏。","You":"你","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"座椅","Your hand":"你的手","Current trick":"当前技巧","Turn":"转","Re eyes":"眼睛","Kontra eyes":"Kontra 眼睛","Re tricks":"再技巧","Kontra tricks":"Kontra技巧","Match points":"赛点","Announce Re":"宣布重新","Announce Kontra":"Kontra 公告","Play selected card":"播放所选卡","Select a card":"选择一张卡","Re":"回复","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"团队尚未可知","Trick table":"技巧表","Clubs":"球杆","Spades":"黑桃","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"钻石","Nine":"九","Jack":"插孔","Queen":"大号","King":"王","Ten":"十","Ace":"王牌","second copy":"第二份","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"轮到你了。选择一张合法的卡。","A computer player is thinking…":"电脑玩家正在思考……","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"新交易已准备就绪。您领导这一轮练习。","Selected card":"选定的卡","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"这种玩法是不合法的。尽可能跟随或王牌。","Deal saved on this device.":"交易已保存在此设备上。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"此浏览器中无法进行本地保存。","Saved deal resumed.":"已保存的交易已恢复。","Saved deal deleted.":"已保存的交易已删除。","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"无法读取已保存的交易。删除它并重新开始。","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"婚礼：在三墩内第一个获胜的其他玩家成为搭档。","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"婚礼解决：绝招获胜者是伴侣。","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"婚礼玩家赢得了前三局。这笔交易现在是钻石单打。","Re announced.":"重新公布。","Kontra announced.":"Kontra 宣布。","Re wins the deal.":"Re 赢得了交易。","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra 赢得了这笔交易。","Final eyes":"最终的眼睛","Game points":"游戏积分","Teams":"团队","Start another deal to play again.":"开始另一笔交易再玩一次。","Rules reference":"规则参考","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"德国 Doppelkopf 协会 · 锦标赛规则，21 2 月 2026","Card":"卡","eyes":"眼睛"},"zh_tw":{"Doppelkopf":"雙影","Doppelkopf Online — Free Local Card Game":"Doppelkopf Online — 免費本地紙牌遊戲","Play a four-seat Doppelkopf practice game against three local computer players. Learn teams, trumps, tricks and Re/Kontra calls. Free, no account.":"與三名本地電腦玩家進行一場四人 Doppelkopf 練習賽。了解團隊、王牌、技巧和 Re/Kontra 跟注。免費，無需帳戶。","Play a local four-seat Doppelkopf game. Follow the led suit or trump when you can, find the Re team through the club queens, and try a Re or Kontra announcement.":"玩當地的四人 Doppelkopf 遊戲。盡可能跟隨領先的花色或王牌，透過俱樂部皇后找到 Re 團隊，並嘗試 Re 或 Kontra 公告。","A quick example":"一個簡單範例","In a normal game, the two players who hold a club queen are Re. If one player holds both, a wedding starts: the first other player to win a trick in the first three becomes their partner.":"在正常比賽中，持有俱樂部皇后的兩名玩家是Re。如果一個玩家同時持有這兩種牌，一場婚禮就開始了：第一個在前三局中贏得一墩的玩家成為他們的伴侶。","How to play":"怎麼玩","The game deals 48 cards: two copies of ace, ten, king, queen, jack and nine in each suit. Each of four seats gets 12 cards. Trump order starts with the heart ten, then the queens and jacks in suit order, followed by the diamond cards. A trick is won by the highest trump, or the highest card of the led suit if no trump is played. The game has 240 card eyes.":"遊戲發48張牌：每種花色兩張A、10、K、Q、J和9。四個座位中的每一個都獲得 12 卡。王牌順序從紅心 10 開始，然後是按花色順序排列的 Q 和 J，最後是方塊牌。最大的王牌獲勝，或者如果沒有出王牌，則由主導花色中的最高牌贏得。遊戲有240卡眼。","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","How many cards and players are there?":"有多少張牌和多少名玩家？","Doppelkopf is played here with four seats and 48 cards: two copies of each of 24 card faces. Each seat receives 12 cards.":"Doppelkopf 在這裡使用四個座位和 48 卡進行遊戲：每張 24 卡面各有兩份。每個座位收到 12 卡。","How are the teams found?":"如何找到團隊？","In a normal game, the two seats holding a club queen form Re; the other two form Kontra. If one seat holds both club queens, the wedding rule finds a partner during the first three tricks.":"正常比賽時，兩個座位持有俱樂部皇后形成Re；另外兩個組成 Kontra。如果一個座位上有兩位俱樂部皇后，則婚禮規則會在前三把戲中找到伴侶。","What happens during a wedding?":"婚禮期間會發生什麼事？","The first other seat to win one of the first three tricks joins Re. If the wedding seat wins all three, the game continues as a one-player diamond solo.":"第一個贏得前三招之一的其他席位加入Re。如果婚禮席位贏得全部三項，則遊戲將繼續進行單人鑽石獨奏。","Which card is the strongest trump?":"哪張牌是最強王牌？","The heart ten is highest. Queens follow in club, spade, heart, diamond order, then jacks in the same suit order, then the diamond ace, ten, king and nine.":"心十最高。 Q 依序為梅花、黑桃、紅心、方塊順序，然後是相同花色順序的 J，然後是方塊 A、10、K 和 9。","Must I follow suit?":"我必須效法嗎？","Yes. If a non-trump suit is led, play that suit when you can. If a trump is led, play a trump when you can. Otherwise, choose any card.":"是的。如果底牌是非王牌花色，盡可能打出該花色。如果有王牌，請盡可能打出王牌。否則，選擇任何卡。","What do Re and Kontra mean?":"Re 和 Kontra 是什麼意思？","They are the names of the two teams. During the allowed opening window, a player can announce their team once. The call is visible and changes the win threshold and game points.":"它們是兩支球隊的名字。在允許的開放視窗內，玩家可以宣布一次自己的球隊。該呼叫是可見的，並且會改變獲勝閾值和遊戲點數。","Is this the full tournament ruleset?":"這是完整的錦標賽規則集嗎？","No. This is a local practice version of normal play with Re/Kontra calls and the wedding rule. It leaves out solos chosen before play, refusals, tournament penalties and many house rules.":"編號這是 Re/Kontra 呼叫和婚禮規則的正常遊戲的本地練習版本。它省略了比賽前選擇的獨奏、拒絕、比賽處罰和許多內部規則。","Can I play with three friends online?":"我可以和三個朋友在線上玩嗎？","No. Your three opponents are simple local computer players. There is no account, matchmaking or online multiplayer.":"編號你的三個對手都是簡單的本地電腦玩家。沒有帳戶、配對或線上多人遊戲。","Is my deal uploaded or saved online?":"我的交易是否已線上上傳或儲存？","No game data is uploaded. Your current deal is saved automatically in this browser on this device so you can resume it later.":"沒有上傳遊戲資料。您目前的優惠會自動儲存在此裝置上的瀏覽器中，以便您稍後可以恢復。","Rules and limitations":"規則與限制","This is a casual local practice game, not online multiplayer, gambling, a tournament client or an expert solver. It uses the DDV normal-game card order, the Re/Kontra calls and wedding resolution, but does not implement selectable solos, refusals such as keine 90, tournament penalties, all special table rules or certified tournament scoring. The three CPUs use simple legal-move heuristics and may make weak decisions.":"這是一款休閒本地練習遊戲，不是線上多人遊戲、賭博、錦標賽用戶端或專家解算器。它使用 DDV 正常遊戲牌順序、Re/Kontra 叫牌和婚禮決議，但不實施可選擇的獨奏、拒絕（例如 keine 90）、錦標賽處罰、所有特殊牌桌規則或經過認證的錦標賽計分。這三個 CPU 使用簡單的合法移動啟發法，可能會做出較弱的決策。","Free to play. Cards and scores stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免費玩。卡片和分數保留在此裝置上的瀏覽器中；沒有上傳遊戲資料。","Play Doppelkopf":"玩分身","Related tools":"相關工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Language":"語言","UsefulVerse":"有用的詩句","All tools":"所有工具","New deal":"新優惠","Resume saved deal":"恢復已儲存的交易","Delete saved deal":"刪除已儲存的交易","Choose New deal to begin.":"選擇新交易開始。","Start a new deal or resume your saved game.":"開始新的交易或恢復您已儲存的遊戲。","You":"你","CPU":"CPU","Seat":"座椅","Your hand":"你的手","Current trick":"目前技巧","Turn":"轉","Re eyes":"眼睛","Kontra eyes":"Kontra 眼睛","Re tricks":"再技巧","Kontra tricks":"Kontra技巧","Match points":"賽點","Announce Re":"宣布重新","Announce Kontra":"Kontra 公告","Play selected card":"播放所選卡","Select a card":"選擇一張卡","Re":"回复","Kontra":"Kontra","Team not yet known":"團隊尚未可知","Trick table":"技巧表","Clubs":"球桿","Spades":"黑桃","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"鑽石","Nine":"九","Jack":"插孔","Queen":"大號","King":"王","Ten":"十","Ace":"王牌","second copy":"第二份","Your turn. Choose a legal card.":"輪到你了。選擇一張合法的卡。","A computer player is thinking…":"電腦玩家正在思考…","New deal ready. You lead this practice round.":"新交易已準備就緒。您帶領這一輪練習。","Selected card":"選定的卡","That play is not legal. Follow suit or trump when possible.":"這種玩法是不合法的。盡可能跟隨或王牌。","Deal saved on this device.":"交易已儲存在此裝置上。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser.":"此瀏覽器中無法進行本機儲存。","Saved deal resumed.":"已儲存的交易已復原。","Saved deal deleted.":"已儲存的交易已刪除。","The saved deal could not be read. Delete it and start again.":"無法讀取已儲存的交易。刪除它並重新開始。","Wedding: the first other player to win within three tricks becomes the partner.":"婚禮：在三墩內第一個獲勝的其他玩家成為搭檔。","Wedding resolved: the trick winner is the partner.":"婚禮解決：絕招獲勝者是伴侶。","The wedding player won the first three tricks. The deal is now a diamond solo.":"婚禮玩家贏得了前三局。這筆交易現在是鑽石單打。","Re announced.":"重新公佈。","Kontra announced.":"Kontra 宣布。","Re wins the deal.":"Re 贏得了交易。","Kontra wins the deal.":"Kontra 贏得了這筆交易。","Final eyes":"最終的眼睛","Game points":"遊戲積分","Teams":"團隊","Start another deal to play again.":"開始另一筆交易再玩一次。","Rules reference":"規則參考","German Doppelkopf Association · Tournament Rules, 21 Feb 2026":"德國 Doppelkopf 協會 · 錦標賽規則，21 2 月 2026","Card":"卡","eyes":"眼睛"}});
